	quest.001B6ED37355CE57.quest_subtitle: "Use a filter to remove the impurities from the Horse Urine you collected."
	quest.001B6ED37355CE57.title: "First Step in Processing"
	quest.005082737DA0D28C.quest_desc: ["Macaw’s Mods A collection of mods (Bridges, Doors, Roofs, Furniture, and more) that supply a vast array of building pieces for your constructions. Whether you’re erecting a Victorian-style workshop or a fortified base, Macaw’s mods offer specialized blocks (from bridges and railings to decorative roofs and windows) to enhance architecture. These pieces blend seamlessly with Create contraptions, allowing you to build visually stunning factories and homes."]
	quest.0070F4BD77233B68.quest_desc: [
		"§7The very substance of the Otherside crawls with living corruption - §fSculk Grime§7. This primordial ooze will become the foundation of your Space Grade Alloy."
		""
		"§7Prime harvesting locations:"
		"§7• Hanging from sculk-infested overhangs and ceilings"
		"§7• Clustered around pulsating §fSculk Tendrils§7"
		"§7• Pooling between active §fSculk Veins§7"
		"§7• Congealing near embedded §fEcho Shards§7"
		""
		"§7Strategic options:"
		"§7• Establish a forward operating base for ongoing harvesting"
		"§7• Extract sufficient quantities to bootstrap self-replicating production"
		""
		"§7This viscous substance holds the key to unlocking your interplanetary aspirations."
	]
	quest.0070F4BD77233B68.title: "Primordial Ooze"
	quest.00735810B03E0333.title: "Bake your first Stroopwafel"
	quest.0081604AF08D98A2.quest_desc: [
		"The &6large water wheel&r works the same as the regular water wheel but has a few differences, it will spin slower than a &eregular water wheel&r but it can will produce a higher stress capacity before it stops from over stressing. It also doesn't matter if 1 or more sides are covered as it will produce the same amount of stress units"
		""
		"It can also be aesthetically changed to match any plank type you right click on it"
	]
	quest.0081604AF08D98A2.quest_subtitle: "Bigger but slower"
	quest.00A79CAA6844228D.title: "Obtain Plastic"
	quest.00A9790E986C6B3F.title: "Create: Escalated"
	quest.00AD57D338214523.quest_desc: ["Building and charging gadgets is installed."]
	quest.00C28BC9D53061BE.quest_desc: [
		"§7To create cobbled deepslate:"
		""
		"§71. Place cobblestone and blackstone in a §fBasin"
		"§72. Mix them using a §fMixer §7powered by rotation"
		""
		"§7Tip: Set up a dedicated mixing station for this process with automated item input using funnels!"
	]
	quest.00C28BC9D53061BE.title: "Cobblestone + Blackstone -> Cobbled Deepslate"
	quest.00D8966078A8F2AA.quest_desc: [
		"§6Building a Castle"
		""
		"Combine various stone blocks to create an impressive castle!"
		""
		"§7Try these techniques:"
		"§7• Tower structure with varied blocks"
		"§7• Stone crenellations on top"
		"§7• Mixed stone for textured walls"
		"§7• Decorative windows and archways"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Add banners and flags for the final touch"
	]
	quest.00D8966078A8F2AA.title: "§eCastle Builder"
	quest.00DFC7824C3750FB.quest_subtitle: "When placed in front of the Encased Fan this allows it to haunt items.\\n\\nNotably sand into soul sand."
	quest.00F11AE1E586D83D.quest_subtitle: "Potato Cannons are a classic weapon to have, just remember to have suitable ammo in your inventory or this thing is useless."
	quest.0104893F8F3458DA.quest_subtitle: "Right click steel casings with a heavy plate."
	quest.0125799CA778E1F4.quest_desc: ["A &6gearbox&r is used to change the direction of rotation"]
	quest.0125799CA778E1F4.quest_subtitle: "You can craft each gearbox into the other one"
	quest.012BA43328D9FA5F.quest_desc: [
		"§7Mossy Cobblestone is created by mixing regular §fCobblestone§7 with §fVines§7 in a §fMechanical Mixer§7."
		""
		"§7The plant material gradually overgrows the stone, transforming it into a mossy variant."
		""
		"§7This mixture creates the perfect base for creating Sculk through haunting."
	]
	quest.012BA43328D9FA5F.title: "Cobblestone + Vines → Mossy Cobblestone"
	quest.0138F3EB263D1721.quest_subtitle: "The block that deals with train assembly and dissasembly."
	quest.0148D094A35294EB.quest_subtitle: "You'll need to be either lucky or have a lot of thorium for this"
	quest.0171DF5A697FD8DA.quest_desc: [
		"What does Distant Horizons do?"
		"Simply put, it add simplified terrain past Minecraft's default view distance to improve performance and allow for longer draw distances."
		"Now you can finally enjoy that lookout tower you built on top of a mountain!"
	]
	quest.0171DF5A697FD8DA.title: "Distant Horizons"
	quest.01C410421657C191.quest_subtitle: "Press &d\"R\"&r to See Crafts and &d\"Z\"&r to See How to build Towers"
	quest.01C410421657C191.title: "Pollution"
	quest.0203D270DDDC7E84.quest_desc: ["Splort &6creosote&r onto planks with a &6spout&r."]
	quest.0203D270DDDC7E84.quest_subtitle: "Unsure how dousing planks in low quality oil makes it hard."
	quest.021E30871E97C634.quest_subtitle: "An advanced item distribution machine that works if you make it point to specific points that the arm can reach, if it can't reach, the arm won't work, also requires SUs to move it."
	quest.0228747D6C21928F.quest_subtitle: "Make a hoe"
	quest.0228747D6C21928F.title: "Farming away"
	quest.029007D8E8446038.quest_desc: ["The &6train track&r is the thing that the train need to be assembled on and that they run on. They are integral for a train system to work"]
	quest.029007D8E8446038.quest_subtitle: "The key to train travel"
	quest.02903C6F107C8DA0.quest_subtitle: "Finally, nuclear"
	quest.02AF65B536422EAF.quest_subtitle: "Gasoline cylinder + Brass pipe"
	quest.02AF65B536422EAF.title: "LPG Cylinder"
	quest.02C1BFF134C8817D.quest_desc: [
		"§7Granite can be created by mixing §fDiorite§7 and §fNether Quartz§7 in a §fMechanical Mixer§7."
		""
		"§7This chemical reaction transforms the minerals into the reddish stone we need."
		""
		"§7Automate this process to ensure a steady supply for your Red Sand production."
	]
	quest.02C1BFF134C8817D.title: "Diorite + Nether Quartz → Granite"
	quest.02D045765BCADD7A.quest_desc: [
		"Building a lunar base allows you to establish a permanent presence on the Moon."
		""
		"Essential components for your base:"
		"- Oxygen Distributor (creates breathable air)"
		"- Oxygen Sealer (keeps oxygen inside rooms)"
		"- Energy source (Solar Panels work great in space!)"
		"- Air-tight blocks for construction"
		""
		"§7Tip: Use Steel Doors and Airlocks to maintain oxygen in your base while allowing entry/exit."
	]
	quest.02D045765BCADD7A.title: "Lunar Base Alpha"
	quest.02D05B1D0B266578.quest_desc: [
		"Once you have &6steel,&r you might choose to speed up your &6blast furnace&r by making these reinforcing walls for it."
		""
		"Only do this if you can cast the molten steel fast enough to keep up!"
	]
	quest.02D05B1D0B266578.quest_subtitle: "Speedy steel."
	quest.02D05B1D0B266578.title: "Reinforcement"
	quest.02FDDF872A9667BA.quest_desc: ["The &6chute&r acts similar to a hopper and dropper combined, as you can stack them on top of eachother and they will continue to funnnel the items down and drop them once they reach the end but they can also push items up if there is an &6encased fan&r blowing air up through the &6chute&r"]
	quest.02FDDF872A9667BA.quest_subtitle: "A way to move items"
	quest.02FE61BB85143811.quest_desc: [
		"The &6weighted ejector&r let's you send items through the air. "
		"To select the place that the &6ejector&r will send to, you shift right click the block you want it to land on then you can place the &6ejector&r down where you want the items to be flung from."
		""
		"You can edit the weight of the &6ejector&r, to do that you find an x on the &6ejector&r then hold right click whilst looking at it and then move the scroll wheel that appears to the amount of items that you want to be on the &6ejector&r"
	]
	quest.02FE61BB85143811.quest_subtitle: "Fling Items through the air"
	quest.0306E0A1DA82A811.quest_subtitle: "A redstone component that outputs a signal when in contact with another redstone contact. Perticularly useful for building contraptions."
	quest.032AC0FA1867AB4F.quest_desc: ["Gliders are the first mod in a vanilla-friendly mod pack designed to enhance the adventure and exploration aspect of Minecraft. These gliders can be crafted from basic materials like wood, iron, and gold, as well as more advanced materials like diamond and netherite. They were introduced to prevent players from rushing to The End to get Elytra."]
	quest.035D8D1D349F7BC3.title: "Enter an &6Ancient City&r"
	quest.037621E5EC46F613.quest_subtitle: "Have two of them."
	quest.037B8971900F3840.quest_desc: ["Make sure you read the description of each quest! They contain a lot of useful tips."]
	quest.037B8971900F3840.quest_subtitle: "...and its consequences."
	quest.037B8971900F3840.title: "The Industrial Revolution"
	quest.037C93F083A40C3C.quest_desc: [
		"§7Tuff is already automatically produced by your previous setups."
		""
		"§7This versatile stone is an excellent source of copper and zinc when processed."
	]
	quest.037C93F083A40C3C.title: "Already Automated: Tuff"
	quest.03C063D04037EEA7.quest_desc: ["Create has a feature built into it called &6Ponder&r, you can hold W on any create item and when the bar fills you will get shown how you can use the item in the world"]
	quest.03C063D04037EEA7.quest_subtitle: "Click the tick to start learning"
	quest.03C2A1DAA831572A.quest_desc: [
		"All &6stack upgrades&r are multiplicative, so having different upgrades in the backpack will increase the stack size."
		""
		"Having 1 of each &6stack upgrade&r will give you 1,024x the stack amount within the backpack"
	]
	quest.03C2A1DAA831572A.quest_subtitle: "x2 Stack Size"
	quest.03E500405A6CA1FB.quest_desc: ["The &6half drawers&r hold half of their respective full sized drawers"]
	quest.03E500405A6CA1FB.quest_subtitle: "What it holds"
	quest.03F23B56320E2CDF.title: "Already Automated: Redstone Dust"
	quest.03FAA1891E7D56FD.quest_subtitle: "A more configurable chute."
	quest.041A77E9C121407A.quest_desc: [
		"§6Gold Barrel"
		""
		"Superior vertical storage!"
		""
		"§7Storage:"
		"§7• Base: 27 slots"
		"§7• Upgrade: +27 slots"
		"§7• Total: 54 slots"
		""
		"§6Features:"
		"§7• 3 upgrade slots"
		"§7• Better visibility"
		"§7• Faster access"
	]
	quest.041A77E9C121407A.title: "§eGold Barrel"
	quest.0420DD4A8BB3868F.quest_desc: ["The &6mechanical arm&r can be setup to move items from one spot to another spot like depot to depot"]
	quest.0420DD4A8BB3868F.quest_subtitle: "A helping hand"
	quest.042FF0D46F325E31.title: "Use an Curving Press to process materials"
	quest.046435AD378CE0C8.quest_subtitle: "Best of the best Magnets in store, however extremely expensive"
	quest.049BDED68524411F.quest_desc: [
		"The &6train observer&r will look at a specific part of the train track and detect when a train is crossing that specific section of track. It will give out a redstone signal when it detects a train going over that piece of track"
		""
		"The &6train observer&r can also only detect when a specific cargo is being held within the train."
	]
	quest.049BDED68524411F.quest_subtitle: "Watches for trains"
	quest.04BCD055807BCAE0.quest_desc: [
		"Building on Glacio requires insulation and heating systems to counter the extreme cold."
		""
		"Consider adding:"
		"- Advanced heating systems"
		"- Thermal insulation"
		"- Cryogenic storage facilities"
		"- Observation towers"
		""
		"§7Tip: The breathable atmosphere means you can focus less on oxygen systems and more on temperature management."
	]
	quest.04BCD055807BCAE0.title: "Glacial Research Station"
	quest.04D70707F44E6366.title: "Locate a &6Deep Dark&r"
	quest.052BFCB615F91B42.quest_desc: ["Spawns: Badlands, or by placing a clay golem statue near a heat source / Hp: 20 / Attack: Default - 2, Deadbush - 4, Cactus - 6, Repaired: Clay / Drops: 0-2 Terracotta / Info: Right click with a cactus or deadbush to toggle between melee and ranged attacks."]
	quest.0545C4EC83C4D016.quest_desc: ["The &6iron backpack&r is the upgrade of the basic &ebackpack&r. It has 54 slots and can hold 2 upgrades"]
	quest.0545C4EC83C4D016.quest_subtitle: "Bigger storage on the go"
	quest.056C707476E4BA33.quest_subtitle: "You will require either of these to insert fuel into the inserter"
	quest.056C707476E4BA33.title: "Inserting fuel "
	quest.05821667594CB9D1.quest_desc: ["&6Andesite casing&r is one of the most used items in the start of create it is used to make a bunch of helpful blocks to make progress"]
	quest.05821667594CB9D1.quest_subtitle: "Right click a stripped log with an &6andesite alloy&r"
	quest.05BC7CBC05B15830.quest_subtitle: "Pushes heat to a small area, careful to not pump too much heat.."
	quest.05BFBACBB2337231.quest_subtitle: "Okay so, andesite is a very abundant stone that you can find in large pockets underground, and they blend really well with the stone texture so keep your eyes open for some. You'll need a lot of this stone if you are going to make any machinery around here so dig as much as you can! Mental note as well, Zinc ores are important too as using it with andesite makes the important alloy used to making machinery."
	quest.05BFBACBB2337231.title: "Andesite, the Foundation"
	quest.05D344B86D2AD2AA.title: "Build a &dNether Portal&r"
	quest.05DE72DD68A60883.title: "Obtain any log"
	quest.05E37B57A64D4BF0.quest_desc: [
		"The §bWolf Fossil§r is a powerful relic that strikes fear into skeletons."
		""
		"When placed or held, skeletons within a 20-block radius will flee in terror."
		""
		"This makes it perfect for exploring skeleton-infested areas like dungeons."
	]
	quest.05E99B1991641AF9.quest_desc: [
		"§6Spatial Storage"
		""
		"Store entire areas!"
		""
		"§7Components:"
		"§7• Spatial Pylon"
		"§7• Spatial IO Port"
		"§7• Spatial Cell"
		""
		"§6Available Sizes:"
		"§7• 2x2x2"
		"§7• 16x16x16"
		"§7• 128x128x128"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Huge power requirement!"
	]
	quest.05E99B1991641AF9.title: "§eSpatial Storage"
	quest.062051ED6D130ACD.quest_desc: [
		"&6Steel&r is used for basically everything in TFMG, you'll want to make a lot of this."
		""
		"Don't add more than a stack of each ingredient into the blast furnace at once. Additionally, it has a chance to not consume coal coke dust."
	]
	quest.062051ED6D130ACD.quest_subtitle: "From the moment I understood the weakness of my cast iron, it disgusted me."
	quest.063D47D4F61457BC.quest_subtitle: "Lets you schedule trains so that mobs or blaze burnders can drive them."
	quest.06653E21053ACDF6.quest_subtitle: "A redstone component that toggles on when recieving a redstone signal on one side and off when recieviing a signal on anoter side."
	quest.066FA99DD39A0BF4.quest_desc: [
		"Put the &6magnetic alloy&r on top of a lightning rod during a thunderstorm and wait for the rod to get hit. Channeling tridents also work."
		""
		"There is about a 50% yield from this process."
	]
	quest.066FA99DD39A0BF4.quest_subtitle: "Grug attract lightning, Grug make magnet."
	quest.066FA99DD39A0BF4.title: "How to make a Magnet"
	quest.0694B4500031172D.quest_desc: [
		"This mod adds a Camera and a frame for the images. The Camera takes real images of your game."
		""
		" "
		""
		"Features"
		" "
		""
		"Images can be displayed by right-clicking the image"
		"Images can be put into image frames"
		"Images can be put into albums"
		"Images can be put into lecterns"
		"Images can be copied"
		"Custom images can be uploaded"
		"Image Frames can be resized up to 8 x 8 blocks"
		"Date and photographer name are stored with the image item"
		"The Camera consumes a piece of paper for every taken image (Configurable)"
		"The Camera has multiple filters that can be applied"
		"Multiplayer compatible"
		"Images are saved in the world folder"
	]
	quest.06CD5DEE6AA5CAD2.quest_desc: ["The &61x1 drawer&r holds a total of &632 stacks&r of the dedicated item"]
	quest.06CD5DEE6AA5CAD2.quest_subtitle: "What it holds"
	quest.06E2A9904675C5C2.quest_desc: ["&3Steel vat&r plus heating required. Made from naphtha, but these two products don't stick around for long..."]
	quest.06E2A9904675C5C2.quest_subtitle: "Good luck getting these on their own."
	quest.06E2A9904675C5C2.title: "&2Propylene &7and &5Ethylene"
	quest.06E39E99E00A5283.quest_desc: [
		"Yeah this requires some tight redstone timing in order to extract the &5ethylene&r just before it turns into plastic."
		""
		"Cooling fluid is mainly used for improving modular engine efficiency."
		"Please consider if this is worth your time before trying to get some."
	]
	quest.06E39E99E00A5283.quest_subtitle: "If you can get this working then congrats."
	quest.06E39E99E00A5283.title: "Ok cool I guess"
	quest.06FD5D167D458C04.quest_desc: [
		"§7Process §fBrass Ingots§7 in a §fMechanical Press§7 to form Brass Sheets."
		""
		"§7These thin, malleable sheets are essential components for many advanced mechanisms."
		""
		"§7Ensure proper alignment in your press to produce consistent quality sheets."
	]
	quest.06FD5D167D458C04.title: "Brass Ingot → Brass Sheet"
	quest.07680D1563629D55.quest_subtitle: "It's really just a belt that doesn't move."
	quest.076C02684CB6D760.quest_subtitle: "Press &c\"Z\"&r To see How to Build It"
	quest.076C02684CB6D760.title: "Build Crude Oil Pump"
	quest.076CE5C221D9ACE9.quest_desc: [
		"§d§lOh The Biomes We've Gone Guide"
		""
		"Explore a vast array of new natural environments!"
		""
		"§6Main Features:"
		"§7• Dozens of new biomes"
		"§7• Unique trees and plants"
		"§7• New building materials"
		"§7• Special natural resources"
	]
	quest.076CE5C221D9ACE9.title: "§d§lBiome Exploration Guide"
	quest.0774DE92D4CE2598.quest_desc: ["Doggy Talents Next Upgrades the simple Minecraft wolf into a trainable, skill-bearing companion. Tame a dog and then craft treats to level it up, spending points on various talents. You can specialize your dog as a guard (increased attack and armor), a hunter (finds prey and loot), a pack hound (extra inventory space), and more. There are even AI improvements – dogs can be set to follow, patrol, or stay. In a pack as dangerous as this, having a faithful dog by your side who can fend off mobs or carry items is a huge boon. Plus, you can personalize your furry friend’s look and name, increasing immersion as you journey together."]
	quest.07BF12F7CEE0A7CB.quest_desc: ["Incendium A Nether overhaul that introduces unique biomes, formidable structures, and custom loot to the underworld. Incendium paints the Nether with 8 new biomes (like the perilous Quartz Flats and eerie Withered Forest) and populates them with challenging dungeons and enemies. You might siege a Piglin castle or delve a blazing volcano; triumphing can yield special weapons and artifacts. Incendium maintains a vanilla block palette, making its additions feel like a natural (if more dangerous) extension of the Nether."]
	quest.07D851E306AE269E.quest_desc: [
		"§7Water is essential for multiple steps in your production chain."
		""
		"§7Set up a reliable water supply system using buckets, mechanical pumps, or an infinite water source."
		""
		"§7Make sure to distribute this water efficiently to all the production stations that require it."
	]
	quest.07D851E306AE269E.title: "Water"
	quest.07DA0A789FA12D1C.quest_desc: [
		"§7Fluid pipes are the backbone of any liquid transport system."
		""
		"§7They connect fluid containers like tanks, basins, and spouts, allowing liquid to flow between them."
		""
		"§7To set up a basic fluid network:"
		"§71. Connect fluid sources (like §fPumps§7) to destinations (like §fTanks§7)"
		"§72. Use wrench to configure flow direction when needed"
		"§73. Add §fBacktank §7to your character for portable fluid storage"
		""
		"§7A well-designed fluid network is essential for sealed mechanism production!"
	]
	quest.087184E7F4212647.quest_desc: ["Using brass you are able to upgrade your copper backtank to a jetpack, using the pressurized air inside to propel yourself through the air."]
	quest.087184E7F4212647.title: "Create: Jetpack"
	quest.089E138A15237C67.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to the world of railways engineering! This chapter will guide you through building and managing your own railway empire using Create's train system."
		""
		"From basic tracks to complex automated networks, you'll learn everything needed to become a master railroad engineer."
		""
		"§7Get ready to lay tracks, build locomotives, and watch your trains transport goods and passengers across your world!"
	]
	quest.08C711A60B92C34F.quest_desc: [
		"§6Compacting Upgrade"
		""
		"Automatically compress items!"
		""
		"§7Features:"
		"§7• 2x2 and 3x3 compression"
		"§7• Auto-processing"
		"§7• Configurable"
		""
		"§6Common Uses:"
		"§7• Block crafting"
		"§7• Ingot compression"
		"§7• Resource blocks"
	]
	quest.08C711A60B92C34F.title: "§eCompacting Upgrade"
	quest.09324A017ED97424.quest_desc: [
		"§7The Warden Sword channels the raw power of the Warden into a devastating weapon."
		""
		"§6Special features:"
		"§7• Exceptionally high damage"
		"§7• Chance to inflict Blindness on targets"
		"§7• Deals additional damage to non-sculk creatures"
		"§7• Can be enchanted with standard sword enchantments"
		""
		"§cNote: §7Like the Heart of the Deep, this blade seems to pulse with dark energy, as if somehow alive. Some users report hearing faint whispers when wielding it in complete darkness."
	]
	quest.09324A017ED97424.title: "Warden's Wrath"
	quest.0934205CDF2B0F0E.quest_desc: [
		"§7The §fCultural Delights§7 mod celebrates diverse culinary traditions from around the world!"
		""
		"§7Automate the production of international delicacies like §fsushi§7, §fmaki§7, and more."
		""
		"§fSetup:§7"
		"§71. Create automated farms for §fcorn§7, §feggplants§7, and §fcucumbers§7"
		"§72. Set up a §fslicer§7 system for preparing intricate ingredients"
		"§73. Use §fbasins§7 and §fmixers§7 for preparing rice and avocado paste"
		"§74. Establish a §fsushi rolling§7 assembly line with §fdeployers§7"
		""
		"§fTIP:§7 Cultural dishes provide unique benefits - sushi provides water breathing effects!"
	]
	quest.0934205CDF2B0F0E.title: "Cultural Cuisine Automation"
	quest.0945E885A92D06B7.quest_subtitle: "The simplest way to generate kinetic energy, by using yourself as the power source. Get that arm strength!"
	quest.0945E885A92D06B7.title: "Crank it all the way!"
	quest.095C1249FDE419C7.quest_subtitle: "Melt my heart.."
	quest.095C1249FDE419C7.title: "Uh oh!"
	quest.09C334C044BC464F.quest_desc: [
		"Make sure to pipe out the &eCO2&r or it will clog up. You can make it taller than two blocks but it has zero effect."
		""
		"Air is collected from &6air intakes,&r which need rotation to start collecting. They can be 1x1, 2x2, or 3x3 multiblock. Notably they take zero power, so speed them up all you like."
		""
		"If you are having trouble with piping, refer to the &dhandy diagram on the right. &r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Just kidding- "
		""
		"&0&lFuel&r (creosote or furnace gas) is piped into the bottom face."
		""
		"&lAir&r (collected from air intakes) is piped into the side of the bottom block."
		""
		"&8&lCO2&r is extracted from the sides of the bottom block."
		""
		"&4&lHot air&r (your product) is extracted from the top face of the tower."
	]
	quest.09C334C044BC464F.quest_subtitle: "Takes in air and fuel to make hot air."
	quest.09C334C044BC464F.title: "Blast Stove"
	quest.09CF4DDAB1A2CC4A.quest_desc: [
		"§7The §fEnd's Delight§7 mod brings exotic meals from The End dimension!"
		""
		"§7Setting up automation for these otherworldly dishes requires special ingredients from The End, but offers powerful effects."
		""
		"§fAdvanced Setup:§7"
		"§71. Set up §fchorus fruit§7 and §fdragon's breath§7 collection systems"
		"§72. Process end-based ingredients with §fslicers§7 and §fmixers§7"
		"§73. Create automation for exotic recipes using §fcooking pots§7"
		""
		"§fWARNING:§7 Some End ingredients can be volatile! Use proper item filtering in your systems."
	]
	quest.09CF4DDAB1A2CC4A.title: "Otherworldly Cuisine"
	quest.09F1B6F0155A9ADC.quest_desc: [
		"Congratulations, Master Explorer! You've visited an impressive number of biomes from Oh The Biomes We've Gone."
		""
		"Your journey has taken you through forests, jungles, beaches, and more exotic locations."
		""
		"Take this special reward as recognition of your exploration prowess!"
	]
	quest.09F1B6F0155A9ADC.title: "§d§lMaster Explorer"
	quest.09F5744CA666F889.title: "Enjoy your first Oliebollen"
	quest.0A2167437E1C4F13.quest_subtitle: "A repeater that sends a pulse after a configurable amount of time."
	quest.0A2167437E1C4F13.title: "Do I feel a pulse?"
	quest.0A2D9EEF89D34A50.quest_desc: ["You can stream media via WaterFrames"]
	quest.0A2FEC235F9F58F3.quest_subtitle: "Become a walking furnace"
	quest.0A3BD53DFB6213D8.title: "Create: Aquatic Ambitions"
	quest.0A5D6D1B5F873643.quest_desc: [
		"§6Tool Swapper"
		""
		"Smart tool management!"
		""
		"§7Features:"
		"§7• Auto-swap tools"
		"§7• Context sensitive"
		"§7• Customizable"
		""
		"§6Functions:"
		"§7• Mining tool swap"
		"§7• Combat weapon swap"
		"§7• Tool damage awareness"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Great for extended mining!"
	]
	quest.0A5D6D1B5F873643.title: "§eTool Swapper"
	quest.0A5E5F6880D07B24.quest_desc: [
		"§7Pocket Computers are portable versions of standard computers."
		""
		"§7Carry your programs with you and run them on the go! Perfect for controlling your systems remotely."
		""
		"§7Try crafting a §fWireless Modem§7 to communicate with your main computer network from anywhere."
	]
	quest.0A5E5F6880D07B24.title: "Computers To Go"
	quest.0A69654DDA6B3302.quest_desc: [
		"§7Allurite is one of the two magnificent crystals found in Crystal Canyons."
		""
		"§7These vibrant blue crystals can be harvested and used in crafting various tools and decorative items."
		""
		"§7Mine them with a pickaxe to collect allurite shards - be careful, as they're quite fragile!"
		""
		"§7Each crystal cluster has a chance to drop multiple shards - use Fortune enchantments to maximize your yield."
	]
	quest.0A69654DDA6B3302.title: "Blue Crystal Wonders"
	quest.0A6F439E158D1525.quest_subtitle: "A filter that can filter by attributes like \"can be smelted\" or \"from Create\"."
	quest.0AA5E1088DBF6B62.quest_desc: [
		"§6Colorful Building Blocks"
		""
		"Add vibrant colors to your builds with these eye-catching blocks!"
		""
		"§7Some colorful options include:"
		"§7• Rainbow blocks and bricks"
		"§7• Colored tiles"
		"§7• Neon blocks"
		"§7• Stained stone bricks"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Use these for accent walls or to highlight important areas of your builds"
	]
	quest.0AA5E1088DBF6B62.title: "§eRainbow of Colors"
	quest.0AC135C487A6D937.quest_desc: [
		"§5§lEnd Dimension Victory"
		""
		"Congratulations on reaching The End! Your journey through the End Remastered mod has reached its climax."
		""
		"§6What to do in The End:"
		"§7• Defeat the Ender Dragon"
		"§7• Find End Cities and loot them"
		"§7• Collect Elytra from End Ships"
		"§7• Harvest Chorus Fruit and Dragon's Breath"
		"§7• Explore and find rare End treasures"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7The End is just the beginning of a new phase in your adventure!"
	]
	quest.0AC135C487A6D937.title: "§5§lEnd Dimension Discovered!"
	quest.0AE0E5AA8FB69FE2.quest_subtitle: "Gadgets for all situations"
	quest.0AE0E5AA8FB69FE2.title: "Welcome to Create:Connected"
	quest.0B06FEF86588FB29.quest_subtitle: "Automatically moves items into and out of the blast furnace"
	quest.0B29A56E1161806D.quest_desc: [
		"Uranus is a fascinating ice giant with its unique sideways rotation and beautiful blue color."
		""
		"Key features:"
		"• Moderate gravity"
		"• No oxygen"
		"• Extremely cold temperatures"
		"• Unique Uranite resources"
		""
		"The valuable Uranite found here will be crucial for your continued journey outward."
	]
	quest.0B29A56E1161806D.title: "The Ice Giant"
	quest.0B2B9207D0E1EC21.quest_desc: [
		"Building on Venus presents unique challenges due to the extreme heat and pressure. Your base will need specialized components to withstand these conditions."
		""
		"Consider adding:"
		"- Enhanced cooling systems"
		"- Reinforced structures"
		"- Advanced energy management"
		"- Acid rain protection"
		""
		"§7Tip: Due to the cloud cover, solar panels are less effective on Venus. Consider alternative energy sources."
	]
	quest.0B2B9207D0E1EC21.title: "Venusian Stronghold"
	quest.0B402669E1D35D5D.quest_desc: [
		"§7Process §fRedstone Dust§7 by using a §fSpout§7 to add §fLava§7, transforming it into Glowstone Dust."
		""
		"§7This infusion process enhances the luminescent properties of the redstone."
		""
		"§7Set up a precise fluid delivery system to control the lava flow rate."
	]
	quest.0B402669E1D35D5D.title: "Redstone + Lava → Glowstone Dust"
	quest.0B5FF13E714BF391.quest_subtitle: "Lets you see the rotational speed of a kinetic network."
	quest.0B75ECB88F50DE5E.quest_desc: [
		"§6Japanese Pagoda Design"
		""
		"Create an elegant Eastern-style building!"
		""
		"§7Design elements to include:"
		"§7• Layered roof with dark wood"
		"§7• Paper wall dividers"
		"§7• Stone foundation"
		"§7• Decorative lanterns"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Use framed glass and paper walls for delicate-looking windows"
	]
	quest.0B75ECB88F50DE5E.title: "§eJapanese-Style Builder"
	quest.0B7FFB9FF90F10CF.quest_subtitle: "Cast in a casting basin."
	quest.0B84230BFBD2E8BD.quest_desc: [
		"You did it!"
		""
		"You made a fully working automated production line!"
		""
		"Now you're finally ready to dive head first into more complex Create addons in §lChapter 3!"
	]
	quest.0B84230BFBD2E8BD.title: "Fully Automated Andesite Mechanism"
	quest.0BAC663F488B1095.title: "Assemble a Redstone Module"
	quest.0BB0533CA61648D9.quest_subtitle: "Press &c\"Z\"&r To see How to Build It"
	quest.0BB0533CA61648D9.title: "Obtain All the Engines and go bbrrrrr"
	quest.0BE140A8B9165E0E.quest_desc: [
		"The handcar is a manually powered rail vehicle added by Steam 'n' Rails."
		""
		"§7To use a handcar:"
		"§71. Craft the handcar components"
		"§72. Place it on the tracks"
		"§73. Players can operate it by 'pumping' (sneak + use)"
		""
		"§7Tip: Handcars are perfect for track inspection or short trips without setting up a full locomotive!"
	]
	quest.0BE140A8B9165E0E.title: "Maintenance Vehicle"
	quest.0C06ADCDCDC6592C.quest_desc: ["§7If you have followed the quests correctly, you should already have automated this."]
	quest.0C07E95932428E85.quest_desc: ["The Underworld Knight resides in his own dark fortress hidden in the Nether. It wields a massive sword and a dagger, sweeping attacks and make agressive combos. Its armor is the strongest of its dimensions."]
	quest.0C28FF9D09B326D7.quest_subtitle: "Used to visualise and control which direction trains go in intersections."
	quest.0C5CB66CB943E865.quest_desc: [
		"§7Now that you've established oil extraction, it's time to set up an oil storage system."
		""
		"§7Create a proper fluid transport network with:"
		"§7• Fluid pipes to transfer crude oil from the pumpjack"
		"§7• Fluid tanks for storage"
		"§7• Mechanical pumps to control flow"
		""
		"§7A well-designed storage system ensures you'll always have crude oil available for processing."
	]
	quest.0C5CB66CB943E865.title: "Oil Storage"
	quest.0C5DBB7C27A5BE91.quest_subtitle: "Make a cookie"
	quest.0C5F842394B5832E.title: "Collect 3 &dWither Skulls&r and 4 soul sand"
	quest.0C6024EF59A2C962.quest_desc: [
		"§6Block Mixing"
		""
		"The true power of Chipped comes from combining different block variants in your builds."
		""
		"Try these design ideas:"
		"§7• Gradient walls using similar blocks in different patterns"
		"§7• Textured floors with complementary designs"
		"§7• Detailed facade work with mixed stone variants"
		"§7• Interior accents using specialty blocks"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Take screenshots of combinations you like for future reference!"
	]
	quest.0C6024EF59A2C962.title: "Advanced Building Techniques"
	quest.0C61DF69F901DB52.quest_desc: [
		"With your Tier 5 rocket complete, it's time to reach for the ringed jewel of our solar system - Saturn!"
		""
		"Saturn features:"
		"• Moderate gravity (10.44)"
		"• No oxygen"
		"• Solar power rating: 11"
		"• Temperature: -154°C"
		"• Tier 5 planet"
		""
		"You'll need to gather Saturlyte materials to build even more powerful rockets for the outer reaches of the solar system."
	]
	quest.0C61DF69F901DB52.title: "Rings of Power"
	quest.0C7B35B85C48F9C4.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to the next frontier of exploration and technology - space travel!"
		""
		"In this chapter, you'll prepare for lunar exploration by creating automated production lines for the most crucial resource: Space Grade Alloy."
		""
		"Complete these quests to build a sustainable space program that will eventually take you to the moon and beyond."
		""
		"§6After mastering the Industrial Revolution in Chapter 3, you're ready to reach for the stars!"
	]
	quest.0C7B35B85C48F9C4.title: "4. One Small Step For Man"
	quest.0C8D19B106618A91.quest_subtitle: "The Gearbox is sort of like an extension cord, but for shafts where it can change the direction of the shafts and can have more than one shaft attached in a different side of the gearbox. A vertical gearbox also exists."
	quest.0D20937E785230F6.quest_desc: ["§7To create §fAmethyst Shards§7, you'll need to crush calcite blocks using §fCrushing Wheels §7or a §fMillstone§7."]
	quest.0D20937E785230F6.title: "Calcite -> Amethyst Shard"
	quest.0D5B96D290D3B9F0.quest_desc: [
		"Pluto, our beloved distant dwarf planet, presents unimaginable challenges with its extreme cold and minimal atmosphere."
		""
		"Key features:"
		"• Low gravity (0.62)"
		"• No oxygen"
		"• Extremely cold (-229°C)"
		"• Tier 9 difficulty"
		"• Rare Plutonite resources"
		""
		"The Plutonite you'll find here is among the rarest and most valuable materials in the solar system."
	]
	quest.0D5B96D290D3B9F0.title: "The Distant Dwarf"
	quest.0D6D4E708F19D7F9.quest_desc: [
		"§7Allurite clusters are stunning blue crystal formations found in Crystal Canyons."
		""
		"§7These decorative blocks add a touch of underground beauty to any build."
		""
		"§7Place them strategically to create an ethereal atmosphere in your home."
		""
		"§7Use the Allurite Compounder to grow your own clusters - it converts Allurite Shards into full clusters over time."
	]
	quest.0D6D4E708F19D7F9.title: "Crystalline Formations"
	quest.0DC41469E58623D8.quest_desc: [
		"§7Set up a §fLava Production System§7 using §fDripstone and Cauldrons§7 or an §fIgneous Extruder§7."
		""
		"§7Use §fFluid Pipes§7 with §fEncased Fans§7 to cool the system and prevent overheating."
	]
	quest.0DC41469E58623D8.title: "Lava Production"
	quest.0E1295C049BE1351.quest_desc: [
		"§7Lava is a critical resource for several processes in your space program."
		""
		"§7Set up a sustainable lava collection system using either the §fNether§7 or a lava farm with §fDripstone§7."
		""
		"§7Make sure your system can handle the fluid volume needs of your automation."
	]
	quest.0E1295C049BE1351.title: "Lava Supply"
	quest.0E14F28C0CDFBED6.quest_desc: [
		"The Undead Soul is dropped by Skeleton Horses."
		""
		"§7Find Skeleton Horsemen during thunderstorms."
		"§7Defeat the skeleton riders first, then the horses for a chance to obtain this Eye."
		"§7These are rare spawns during storms - be patient!"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Installed: Skeleton Horse Spawn is a minimalistic configurable mod which allows skeleton horses to spawn naturally with a skeleton riding it. Whenever a skeleton spawns, it has a chance to be spawned as a rider."
	]
	quest.0E1743D6E3729E6A.quest_subtitle: "You want to get rotational power out of your engine, right?"
	quest.0E1743D6E3729E6A.title: "Output Shaft"
	quest.0E1E056EBC1B0E57.title: "Wrap snack in Paper"
	quest.0E2D0BE5D6A6A3E2.quest_desc: [
		"Archeological ruins can be found throughout the world, each with their own unique treasures and stories."
		""
		"Notable locations to explore include:"
		""
		"- §bDesert Temples§r - Home to ancient artifacts and suspicious blocks"
		"- §bUnderwater Ruins§r - Contain sea-related artifacts and fossils"
		"- §bTrail Ruins§r - Recently discovered structures with a wealth of archeological finds"
		"- §bAncient Cities§r - Dangerous but rewarding locations deep underground"
		""
		"Each location has unique items and artifacts that can only be found there!"
	]
	quest.0E2D0BE5D6A6A3E2.title: "Ruins of the Ancient World"
	quest.0E491A562DF88795.quest_subtitle: "Weighted Ejectors can throw items accuratly long distances."
	quest.0E62D382712B3777.quest_desc: [
		"The Rogue Eye is found in Jungle Temples."
		""
		"§7Search for Jungle Temples hidden in dense jungle biomes."
		"§7Be careful of the arrow trap mechanism."
		"§7Check all the chests thoroughly."
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Jungle Temples can be located using the explorer's compass. You can also complete quest "
		"{ \"text\": \"Forgotten Guardian\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"1054168AFD8520D4\" } }"
		"{image:atm:textures/questpics/undergarden/undergarden_guardian.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.0E63C1AD9074987E.quest_desc: ["Melt &6quartz&r in the blast furnace and cast the resulting &6liquid silicon&r."]
	quest.0E63C1AD9074987E.quest_subtitle: "Another use for the blast furnace."
	quest.0E6A676E8758ABC8.title: "Already Automated: Gold Ingot"
	quest.0E79EC5A8E3FF9F4.quest_desc: [
		"The Black Forest is a dark, mysterious woodland with a unique ecosystem."
		""
		"§6Features:"
		"§7• Dark dense trees"
		"§7• Mushrooms and fungi"
		"§7• Mysterious atmosphere"
		""
		"Inspired by the real Black Forest of Germany, this biome is both beautiful and a bit eerie."
	]
	quest.0E79EC5A8E3FF9F4.title: "Into the Darkness"
	quest.0E8331ECB414B3E9.quest_desc: [
		"§6Storage Solutions"
		""
		"A well-organized base is crucial for efficient progression. Start with basic storage solutions and work your way up to advanced systems."
		""
		"§7Storage Tips:"
		"§7• Create double chests for more space"
		"§7• Use signs and item frames for organization"
		"§7• Group similar items together"
		"§7• Plan space for future expansion"
		""
		"§6Looking Ahead:"
		"§7As you progress, you'll unlock:"
		"§7• Advanced storage systems"
		"§7• Automated item sorting"
		"§7• Mass storage solutions"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Good organization early on prevents chaos later!"
	]
	quest.0E8331ECB414B3E9.title: "§eStorage Fundamentals"
	quest.0E8464117CEC6CC6.quest_desc: [
		"It's time to build the complete burger assembly line!"
		""
		"§6Main components:§r"
		"• Input systems for all ingredients"
		"• Mechanical arms for precise placement"
		"• Deployers for building the burger layer by layer"
		"• Belt system to move the burger through assembly"
		"• Packaging system for the final product"
		""
		"§6Process flow:§r"
		"1. Start with bottom bun on belt"
		"2. Add cooked patty"
		"3. Add sliced tomatoes"
		"4. Add cabbage leaves"
		"5. Top with second bun"
		"6. Package completed burger"
		""
		"This is the pinnacle of your burger automation journey!"
	]
	quest.0E8464117CEC6CC6.quest_subtitle: "The Final Step"
	quest.0E8464117CEC6CC6.title: "The Burger Assembly Line"
	quest.0E91E173CE057100.quest_subtitle: "Ponder the Mechanical Spawner to see the use :3"
	quest.0EB0A302142AB2F6.quest_subtitle: "Pump it."
	quest.0EB0A302142AB2F6.title: "Pumpjack Essentials"
	quest.0EC45E13A8FAB3A4.quest_desc: [
		"Congratulations, space explorer! You've conquered the known galaxy, from Earth to the distant Proxima Centauri system."
		""
		"Your journey through the stars has made you a master of space technology and planetary survival. What new horizons await in future updates? Only time will tell..."
		""
		"For now, you can focus on building magnificent bases across the various planets, creating a true interplanetary civilization!"
	]
	quest.0EC45E13A8FAB3A4.title: "Master of the Universe"
	quest.0F05EB61EE8C34BC.quest_desc: [
		"Make your home cozy with proper lighting and decorations!"
		"Lanterns provide better light than torches and look much nicer."
		""
		"§7Tip: Chain blocks can hang lanterns from ceilings."
		""
		"§7Tip: Different colored candles can create ambient lighting."
	]
	quest.0F05EB61EE8C34BC.title: "Let There Be Light"
	quest.0F22EF03C750E879.quest_subtitle: "Has more options compared to the basic"
	quest.0F35AF004588B678.quest_subtitle: "The thing your train goes on. No tracks, no train."
	quest.0F35AF004588B678.title: "Train Tracks"
	quest.0F52D4BF687F5CF3.quest_desc: [
		"§7The Pumpjack is a multi-block structure designed to extract oil from underground deposits."
		""
		"§7Please look at the ponder for detailed instructions on how to build and operate the pumpjack."
		""
		"§7The pumpjack requires rotational force to operate. More speed means faster extraction!"
		""
		"§7Helpful tips:"
		"§7• Oil deposits are often found in specific biomes like deserts or near oceans"
		"§7• Use fluid pipes with mechanical pumps to direct the flow to your storage tanks"
		"§7• Add a gauge to monitor extraction progress"
	]
	quest.0F52D4BF687F5CF3.title: "Building a Pumpjack"
	quest.0F74A3DE59E3A007.quest_desc: [
		"§6Trim"
		""
		"Add some style to your storage network!"
		""
		"§7Function:"
		"§7• Decorative blocks for your network"
		"§7• Can be colored with the Paint Kit"
		"§7• Makes your storage system look nicer"
		""
		"§6Paint Kit:"
		"§7• Colors your trims and framed components"
		"§7• Customize the look of your network"
		"§7• Multiple colors available"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Use different colors to organize different sections of your storage system!"
	]
	quest.0F74A3DE59E3A007.title: "§eStorage Decoration"
	quest.0FB15AB76CD06E92.quest_desc: [
		"The mechanical press turns items into their processed variants by applying pressure."
		""
		"§7Use it to create plates from ingots, which are essential for many Create recipes."
		""
		"§7Tip: Place a depot underneath to hold items for processing!"
	]
	quest.0FB15AB76CD06E92.title: "Under Pressure"
	quest.0FB4FFD361C5DF69.quest_subtitle: "It's just a seat, nothing more, nothing less. But if you're in a moving contraption, might as well glue it to the contraption so you can sit and move along with it. Don't superglue yourself to the seat."
	quest.0FB4FFD361C5DF69.title: "Chair."
	quest.0FCB25BA5EB5E745.quest_subtitle: "Chains together individual Minecarts, causing them to move as a group"
	quest.0FE929F3B68E113D.quest_desc: [
		"§7The Otherside is home to several unique and deadly creatures:"
		""
		"§6Sculk Snappers:"
		"§7• Camouflaged predators that blend with sculk terrain"
		"§7• Ambush attackers with powerful bites"
		""
		"§6Shattered:"
		"§7• Twisted entities of immense power"
		"§7• Highly aggressive with devastating attacks"
		""
		"§6Shriek Worms:"
		"§7• Emit sounds that can summon Wardens"
		"§7• Usually found in sculk patches"
		""
		"§6Survival tactics:"
		"§7• Stay vigilant and watch the terrain carefully"
		"§7• Listen for distinct sounds warning of nearby threats"
		"§7• Establish safe zones with light sources"
		"§7• Travel in short, planned excursions"
	]
	quest.0FE929F3B68E113D.title: "Hostile Territory"
	quest.0FF39255BD5908AD.title: "Crush Nether Wart to obtain Spices"
	quest.0FF6AA4B49FD2431.quest_desc: [
		"§6Automation Tips"
		""
		"Setting up automated processing is key to efficiency!"
		""
		"§7Basic Automation Setup:"
		"§7• Item collection (Hoppers/Chutes)"
		"§7• Sorting system"
		"§7• Processing stations"
		"§7• Output collection"
		""
		"§6Recommended Components:"
		"§7• Create Belts"
		"§7• Funnels"
		"§7• Chutes"
		"§7• Smart Chutes"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Always build with expansion in mind!"
	]
	quest.0FF6AA4B49FD2431.title: "§eAutomation Basics"
	quest.0FFBEB84F6AE0722.quest_desc: [
		"§6Void Upgrade"
		""
		"Automatically delete excess items!"
		""
		"§7Features:"
		"§7• Destroys overflow"
		"§7• Filter compatible"
		"§7• Stack threshold"
		""
		"§6Best Uses:"
		"§7• Mob farms"
		"§7• Cobblestone generators"
		"§7• Automated farms"
	]
	quest.0FFBEB84F6AE0722.title: "§eVoid Upgrade"
	quest.10331210B10CF626.quest_subtitle: "Lets you use SU to break blocks, can also be attached to contraptions to make tunnel bores and the like."
	quest.1054168AFD8520D4.quest_desc: ["Found via the Undergarden Catacombs"]
	quest.107FD0A61301E536.title: "Obtain a &2Sentry Armour Trim&r"
	quest.10A7F4F09C5D4367.quest_desc: ["Better Weaponry Expands the arsenal with 15 new weapon sets and more. From daggers and rapiers to battleaxes and halberds, this mod introduces a weapon for every style – each with its own attack reach and speed. It also adds new enchantments (like Vampirism to leech health, or Blinding to impair foes) and even a new shield type. All these weapons are balanced to work with Better Combat’s animations and can be made from materials including copper, amethyst, and emerald, giving more uses to those resources. Forge yourself a signature weapon and enjoy the novel combat tactics it brings (perhaps a scythe for sweeping crowds, or dual daggers for quick strikes)."]
	quest.10B1204244E2ECD9.quest_desc: ["§7To transform §fWheat Flour§7 into §fDough§7, you'll need to set up a §fBulk Washing§7 station."]
	quest.10B1204244E2ECD9.title: "Wheat Flour -> Dough"
	quest.10CD621228F226E9.quest_desc: [
		"§7Process §fMoon Stone§7 in a §fCrushing Wheel§7 to extract valuable Lunar Essence."
		""
		"§7This mystical essence contains concentrated lunar energy, essential for infernal mechanisms."
		""
		"§7Carefully store this essence as it is sensitive to regular daylight conditions."
	]
	quest.10CD621228F226E9.title: "Moon Stone → Lunar Essence"
	quest.10EFC2F7A8954ED3.quest_desc: [
		"§7Put cobblestone and quartz into a §fBasin§7, and place a §fMixer §7above it. "
		""
		"§7When powered the §fMixer §7can automate any shapeless recipe. "
	]
	quest.10EFC2F7A8954ED3.title: "Cobblestone + Nether Quartz -> Diorite"
	quest.1188D57C76DBD215.quest_desc: [
		"Potentiometers let a &bpercentage&r of the input voltage to the output side. Unlike real life, they do not waste power."
		""
		"For example, if your base is wired at &33kV&r, but you only need &3150V&r for your lights, you can set up a potentiometer for the lights at 5%. This way, they don't eat several kW of power for zero gain."
		""
		"The vaguely arrow shaped end of the block is the output."
	]
	quest.1188D57C76DBD215.quest_subtitle: "Easing the tension."
	quest.118D443869E39F1A.quest_desc: ["The &6portable storage interface&r needs 2 to work correctly, one of them on the machine and the other one not attached to the machine and with a 1 block gap and aligned with eachother before the machine is started so that on each rotation is will deposit the excess items into the stationary one"]
	quest.118D443869E39F1A.quest_subtitle: "Move items from farms to storage"
	quest.119DB8BE8676C954.quest_subtitle: "Sacrifice some storage space to hold energy"
	quest.11B587849F60CE12.quest_subtitle: "Backpacks in backpacks. What is this craziness"
	quest.11B606606C704FF4.quest_desc: ["Soulbound enchant is available to let you keep items on death. "]
	quest.11B606606C704FF4.title: "Soulbound Enchant"
	quest.11B9849F3169EDD9.quest_desc: ["Happy Ghast Backport is installed."]
	quest.11CBF2CE777F8CDF.quest_desc: [
		"&6Blaze burners&r as used to heat up the basin which is needed to make certain things like &6brass&r"
		""
		"To collect blazes in a &6blaze burner&r you can either right click a blaze with an empty &6blaze burner&r or right click a blaze spawner to collect them"
	]
	quest.11CBF2CE777F8CDF.quest_subtitle: "Used to heat a basin below a mixer"
	quest.11CBF2CE777F8CDF.title: "Blaze Burner"
	quest.11D8E015814D44F8.quest_desc: ["Sits on top of the &6vat&r and takes different attachments. Requires rotational power."]
	quest.11D8E015814D44F8.quest_subtitle: "Circus (Beta Mix)"
	quest.11E0F24B636A3444.quest_desc: [
		"§6Magnet Upgrades"
		""
		"Automatically collect nearby items!"
		""
		"§7Features:"
		"§7• Collects in radius"
		"§7• Configurable range"
		"§7• Filter compatible"
		""
		"§6Advanced Features:"
		"§7• Range upgrades"
		"§7• Filter integration"
		"§7• Redstone control"
	]
	quest.11E0F24B636A3444.title: "§eMagnet Upgrade"
	quest.11E7A6BEB9954B6D.quest_desc: [
		"Add flair to your trains with decorative accessories!"
		""
		"§7Ideas for train decorations:"
		"§71. Hanging lanterns for nighttime illumination"
		"§72. Flowerpots for a touch of nature"
		"§73. Custom banners with your railway logo"
		"§74. Item displays showing cargo or destinations"
		"§75. Trapdoors and fences for detailed exteriors"
