		"§7• Pattern storage"
		"§7• Quick crafting"
	]
	quest.21B1CE9F5539E916.title: "§eCrafting Upgrade"
	quest.21B2D54BEC60EEBA.quest_desc: ["The &6item drain&r has the ability to take liquid out of a container and then it stores it until it it is piped out into a container"]
	quest.21B2D54BEC60EEBA.quest_subtitle: "Fluid extraction"
	quest.21DD4EFBB31B669D.quest_subtitle: "An upgraded version of the Copper Backtank. How is there so much defense if you're not protected from the front, though?"
	quest.2210D3D462A7F4B2.quest_desc: [
		"§7To process raw rubber into usable rubber:"
		""
		"§71. Smelt raw rubber in a furnace"
		"§72. Alternatively, use an §fEncased Fan §7with lava for bulk processing"
		""
		"§7Rubber is essential for creating §fMechanical Belts§7, §fFunnels§7, and §fTunnels §7- all crucial components for your factory!"
		""
		"§7Make sure to set up a dedicated smelting line for rubber production."
	]
	quest.2210D3D462A7F4B2.title: "Raw Rubber -> Rubber"
	quest.2246A107ECC3CBC5.quest_subtitle: "Ooh, this is a fun contraption! Okay, so this thing is used to build your structures automatically, provided that you have a structure printed out in your schematic paper. You just need to prepare gunpowder and a storage unit with the required materials to build what you want. Also use a clipboard, will ya? It'll take note of the materials for you."
	quest.225E99C0B642665D.quest_desc: [
		"§7Redstone Dust can be obtained by crushing §fRed Sand§7 in a §fCrusher§7."
		""
		"§7This is a more efficient method than mining for redstone ore directly."
		""
		"§7Ensure your crushing system can handle the volumes needed for consistent glowstone production."
	]
	quest.225E99C0B642665D.title: "Red Sand → Redstone Dust"
	quest.226171470A06E7E8.quest_subtitle: "Get 4 planks"
	quest.226171470A06E7E8.title: "Craft some planks"
