		""
		"§7If you haven't already set up Diorite automation from Chapter 3, now is the time to do so."
		""
		"§7A steady supply will be crucial for your space program's material chain."
	]
	quest.258FAAE0D1B26631.title: "Diorite Supply"
	quest.25AA89F7E9F8455D.quest_desc: [
		"The Rose Fields are meadows filled with beautiful roses and other colorful flowers."
		""
		"§6Features:"
		"§7• Abundant rose bushes"
		"§7• Colorful flower patches"
		"§7• Lush grass"
		""
		"A perfect place to collect flowers for decoration or dyes."
	]
	quest.25AA89F7E9F8455D.title: "Fields of Red"
	quest.25B76A897BF55A33.quest_desc: [
		"§7Silver ore is one of the valuable resources found in the depths of the world, particularly near Crystal Canyons."
		""
		"§7This precious metal can be used to craft powerful tools, weapons, and unique items."
		""
		"§7Smelt raw silver to obtain ingots for advanced crafting."
		""
		"§7Silver is more abundant in deeper areas - try searching around Y-level -30 and below."
	]
	quest.25B76A897BF55A33.title: "Silver Mining"
	quest.25C81B959F2AE99F.quest_desc: [
		"The Guardian Eye is dropped by Elder Guardians."
		""
		"§7Find an Ocean Monument in deep ocean biomes."
		"§7Defeat the Elder Guardian boss to obtain this Eye."
		"§7Elder Guardians apply Mining Fatigue to nearby players - bring milk to counter it."
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Water breathing potions and night vision potions will help immensely in the monument."
		"{image:cosmeticarmoursmod:item/maskguardian width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.25F0FF6A47031667.quest_desc: [
		"Relics Introduces dozens of powerful relic items with complex mechanics and an RPG-like progression. Relics can be rings, amulets, or curios that grant abilities which often synergize with each other. Uniquely, Relics features a leveling and random-stat system: the more you use a relic, the stronger it can become, and no two relics are exactly alike. Some might unleash area attacks when you’re low on health, others might improve loot drops or grant short-term buffs on certain triggers. The mod is designed to adjust to modpacks automatically, meaning the relics will scale their effects in this high-power pack appropriately. Seeking out relics and mastering their use (and combos) adds a whole new layer of progression beyond armor and enchantments."
		""
		"Relics: Artifacts Compat A compatibility add-on that blends the Artifacts and Relics mods, ensuring their items work together seamlessly. It may, for example, allow certain Artifacts to count as Relics for set bonuses or progression, or unify how they’re equipped (both use the Curios API). In practical terms, this means you can enjoy both mods without worrying about balancing issues or slot conflicts – and in some cases even unlock combined effects. Perhaps wearing a certain Artifact alongside a Relic triggers a unique buff courtesy of this compat mod. It’s all about making two great mods play nicer and feel like one cohesive system of powerful gear."
	]
	quest.25F0FF6A47031667.quest_subtitle: "https://www.minecraft-guides.com/wiki/relics/"
	quest.2675A430A1BDE699.quest_desc: [
		"§6§lEngineering Marvels Await"
		""
		"At the heart of this modpack lies Create - a revolutionary mod that brings realistic mechanics, kinetic energy, and beautiful machinery to Minecraft."
		""
		"§7Create Basics:"
		"§7• Kinetic energy powers all Create machines"
		"§7• Shafts and gears transmit power"
		""
		"§d§lCreate's Potential:"
		"§7✦ Automated farming and resource processing"
		"§7✦ Complex item sorting and transport"
		"§7✦ Factories that produce items automatically"
		"§7✦ Moving contraptions for trains, elevators, and more"
		"§7✦ Beautiful mechanical displays and gadgets"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7The Create in-game manual (accessed by pressing 'w' while hovering over Create items) is your best resource for learning mechanics!"
	]
	quest.2675A430A1BDE699.title: "§e§lMechanical Wonders"
	quest.26C7E8D13AE63CE3.quest_desc: ["The Meshtrap block is tailored for static setups, perfect for underwater fishery hubs. When placed, it captures fish entities it encounters and gathers nearby items. Unlike the Frametrap, it operates only in a stationary state, seamlessly integrating with your logistics system to transport collected resources for processing. Ideal for creating efficient, automated fishery operations."]
	quest.26C7E8D13AE63CE3.quest_subtitle: "Read Desc"
	quest.26D0F49351B15B05.quest_desc: ["Artifacts Scattered throughout dungeon chests and structures are unique baubles and trinkets with special powers. The Artifacts mod includes items inspired by Terraria – like the Cloud in a Bottle (double jump), Helium Flamingo (float in water), or Night Vision Goggles. These artifacts equip in a special slot and often provide ability-like effects rather than raw stats. They encourage exploration, as you never know what useful relic you’ll pull from the next treasure chest. Finding an Artifact can significantly enhance your character (imagine permanent speed boost boots or a backpack that refills hunger), making them some of the most sought-after loot in the game."]
	quest.26D0F49351B15B05.quest_subtitle: "https://www.minecraft-guides.com/wiki/relics/"
	quest.26D51B83049F45EC.quest_desc: [
		"§7Beyond Earth's atmosphere, one thing becomes immediately apparent - there is nothing to breathe. The §fOxygen Loader§7 solves this critical problem."
		""
		"§7This sophisticated machine:"
		"§7• Extracts oxygen from water through electrolysis"
		"§7• Compresses the gas into tanks for transport"
		"§7• Connects to your spacesuit systems for continuous oxygen supply"
		"§7• Powers life support systems in space habitats"
		""
		"§7Set up a steady water supply to your Oxygen Loader and automate the production of filled oxygen tanks for long-duration missions. Your survival in space depends entirely on maintaining adequate oxygen reserves."
		""
		"§7Remember: In space, running out of oxygen isn't just inconvenient - it's fatal."
	]
	quest.26D51B83049F45EC.title: "Breath of Life"
	quest.26D7ADB984AA5EB1.quest_subtitle: "Fast and rather reliable. Make sure your runway is long enough"
	quest.26D892E1FD132784.quest_desc: [
		"§7Redstone Dust is already automatically produced by your previous setups."
		""
		"§7This essential component powers your contraptions and is a key ingredient for advanced mechanisms."
	]
	quest.26D892E1FD132784.title: "Already Automated: Redstone Dust"
	quest.26E05E19385C944F.quest_desc: [
		"Time to establish a proper home!"
		"Craft a bed to set your spawn point and a crafting table to begin your crafting journey."
		"These will be the foundation of your base."
	]
	quest.26E05E19385C944F.title: "Home Sweet Home"
	quest.26F551A7A1DE167B.quest_desc: [
		"Saturn's resources will be crucial for your journey further into the solar system."
		""
