		""
		"§7To craft railway tracks:"
		"§71. Use iron ingots and wooden slabs in a crafting grid"
		"§72. Place them in the world by right-clicking"
		"§73. Connect sections by placing tracks next to each other"
		""
		"§7Tip: Use brass tools like the §fWrench§7 to modify placed tracks!"
