	quest.29D9BD953307B1BD.quest_desc: [
		"§7You've done it! Your first rocket is complete - a testament to human ingenuity and your mastery of space-age technology."
		""
		"§7This marvel of engineering will carry you beyond Earth's atmosphere to the lunar surface, where new resources and discoveries await."
		""
		"§7Before launch, ensure you have:"
		"§7• Adequate oxygen supplies loaded into the rocket"
		"§7• A full tank of refined fuel"
		"§7• Your space suit equipped and pressurized"
		"§7• Essential tools and resources for lunar exploration"
		""
		"§7With the countdown initiated, you'll embark on humanity's greatest adventure - stepping foot on another celestial body."
		""
		"§c§lRemember: There's no air in space or on the Moon. Without proper preparation, your journey will be tragically brief."
	]
	quest.29D9BD953307B1BD.title: "Chariot to the Stars"
