	quest.2C8EF8E65133D178.quest_subtitle: "In order to get brass you're going to need to heat a mechanical mixer that's mixing copper and zinc.\\n\\n the Empty Blaze burner can be filled by right-clicking it on either a blaze spawner or a blaze."
