		"§7• Blast resistant"
		"§7• Maximum capacity"
		"§7• Fastest operations"
	]
	quest.40C8FC342C6407D6.title: "§dNetherite Barrel"
	quest.4104397B5AAA3BA7.quest_desc: [
		"The wrench is an essential tool for any Create engineer!"
		"It allows you to rotate, dismantle, and configure mechanical components."
		""
		"§7Tip: Right-click to rotate blocks in the direction you're facing."
		""
		"§7Tip: Shift + Right-click to instantly pick up mechanical blocks."
		""
		"§7Tip: You can also use it to change gearbox configurations!"
	]
	quest.4104397B5AAA3BA7.title: "Engineer's Best Friend"
	quest.410BEC9893112A43.quest_subtitle: "Cogwheels are used to either increase rotational speed or to extend contraptions depending on the way they're facing. Play around with the sizes of the cogwheels and see what you can make out of them."
	quest.410BEC9893112A43.title: "Are they just gears, but named differently?"
