	quest.4363F5A8705C5B13.title: "Use an Centrifuge to process materials"
	quest.4377B43142216C8D.quest_subtitle: "A helmet that lets you use air from an equipped tank to breathe underwater. Don't even think of seeing this work under lava."
	quest.4378D0CC8C7B5728.quest_desc: ["§7To create §fGasoline§7, you'll need to process crude oil through a §fRefining§7 process."]
	quest.4378D0CC8C7B5728.title: "Crude Oil -> Gasoline"
	quest.438ACCE0D9FC0BF3.quest_subtitle: "Slow and fuel hungry but carries an entire storage."
	quest.43B25BCF2BBBA9F4.quest_desc: [
		"§6Ancient Cities Reimagined"
		""
		"The Deep Dark's ancient cities have been completely reimagined with more complexity and treasures."
		""
		"§7New ancient city features:"
		"§7• Expanded architecture and ruins"
		"§7• More structured layouts with districts"
		"§7• Additional lore elements and story hints"
		"§7• Unique sculk-infested chambers"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Be extra cautious - while the rewards are greater, so is the danger. More Wardens may lurk in these expanded ruins than in vanilla."
	]
	quest.43B25BCF2BBBA9F4.title: "City of Forgotten Echoes"
	quest.43D31DAC4737005E.quest_subtitle: "Oh naur... creo..."
	quest.43D4387F9D3CCF41.quest_subtitle: "Full enchanting with liquid XP"
	quest.43E02E5DBDE6F0D2.quest_desc: ["You may have to sacrifice some creosote to unclog the ovens. Pump excess creosote into the flarestack to burn it away. "]
	quest.43E02E5DBDE6F0D2.quest_subtitle: "\"The atmosphere is nature's bin\" -E\\&F"
	quest.442159787F607B8E.quest_desc: [
		"The &6crushing wheel&r is used to start processing raw resources more automatically"
		""
		"Some natural spawning blocks from create can be crushed to get resources the list is:"
		""
		"&cCrimsite&r is crushed to get a 40% chance at raw crushed Iron and a nugget"
		"&bAsurine&r is crushed to get a 30% chance at raw crushed Zinc and a nugget"
		"&aVeridium&r is crushed to get a 80% chance at raw crushed Copper and a nugget"
		"&eOchrum&r is crushed to get a 20% chance at raw crushed Gold and a nugget"
	]
	quest.442159787F607B8E.quest_subtitle: "Crushing stuff"
	quest.443868FD42BD73C8.quest_desc: ["The &6mechanical speed controller&r is a easier way to speed up rotational speeds, you can right click it and set the speed you want it to spin at"]
	quest.443868FD42BD73C8.quest_subtitle: "Replaces the cog wheel method"
	quest.445816396CD02500.quest_subtitle: "Use a stonecutter without placing one down"
	quest.4464EFE9484A2B6C.quest_desc: ["This mod includes 23 butterflies from my original mod, LUMINOUS. This mod, eventually, will lose the geckolib requirement, and ports to older versions as well as newer versions will be possible"]
	quest.44AE17D3427B487C.quest_subtitle: "\"A fancier rope pulley\"\\n\\nAllows for the creation of elevators."
	quest.44C3B2628015505C.quest_subtitle: "Allows for movement of structures linearly using rotational force."
	quest.44C3B2628015505C.title: "Mechanical Piston"
	quest.44CC9A31E497E49D.quest_desc: ["The Void Blossom spawns in its own cave, deep underground, usually at the bottom level. While mining, you might randomly come across this cave, which is easily identifiable due to the Amethyst spikes surrounding the area, which shows this isn’t a randomly generated cave."]
	quest.44CC9A31E497E49D.quest_subtitle: "Overworld Caves"
	quest.44E0DDEE0578557F.quest_subtitle: "A multi-block item storage that can't be accessed manually. Not even a door can open it."
	quest.44FC080A04EF3970.quest_subtitle: "Obtain a Tungsten Ingot from Wolframite Ore"
	quest.44FC080A04EF3970.title: "The Tungsten Age"
	quest.45250A119F4802EC.quest_desc: [
		"Change between different piston arrangements by right clicking with a &6schematic.&r Each one has its pros and cons in terms of SU production and fuel consumption."
		""
		"&lDo not do this for radial engines, that is a bug and will corrupt your world.&r"
	]
	quest.45250A119F4802EC.quest_subtitle: "Ah yes the alphabet: I, V, W, U, BOXER"
	quest.45250A119F4802EC.title: "Engine Configurations"
	quest.457F1F059FD8B0CE.quest_desc: [
		"The &6train door&r has 3 modes and each of the modes decide how the door will intereact."
		""
		"The normal mode lets the player interact with the door but it also will auto open and shut depending on whether the machine is moving or not"
		""
		"The manual mode lets the player interact with the door like it's a regular door"
		""
		"The special mode doesn't let the player interact and will only open and close when moving or with a redstone signal (shift + right click will override the special mode)"
	]
	quest.457F1F059FD8B0CE.quest_subtitle: "Fancy door"
	quest.4587777617532196.quest_desc: [
		"§7If you're looking for §fSculk Grime§7 for your space program but don't want to rely only on synthetic production, you'll need to explore the depths of the world."
		""
		"§7Ancient Cities are massive underground structures found deep in the §fDeep Dark§7 biome. These abandoned ruins contain valuable resources but also deadly dangers."
		""
		"§7Bring the following equipment:"
		"§7• §fSilk Touch§7 tools for harvesting sculk blocks"
		"§7• §fSoul Torches§7 to keep sensors from activating"
		"§7• §fWool blocks§7 to muffle your footsteps"
		"§7• Swift Sneaking enchantment if possible"
		""
		"§7Be extremely cautious - disturbing too many §fSculk Sensors§7 or §fShriekers§7 will summon the Warden."
	]
	quest.4587777617532196.title: "Echoes in the Darkness"
	quest.45C6DCAE2574058E.quest_desc: [
		"§7Space is an unforgiving void - hostile to human life in every way. Your §fSpace Suit§7 is your only protection against the vacuum, extreme temperatures, and cosmic radiation."
		""
		"§7Each component serves vital functions:"
		"§7• The §fHelmet§7 provides visibility and oxygen circulation"
		"§7• The §fSuit§7 regulates body temperature and protects vital organs"
		"§7• The §fPants§7 maintain blood circulation in zero gravity"
		"§7• The §fBoots§7 anchor you to surfaces with magnetic soles"
		""
		"§7This advanced equipment must be paired with oxygen supply systems and maintained regularly to ensure survival in the harsh environment of space."
		""
		"§c§lNever attempt space travel without a complete, fully charged suit!"
	]
	quest.45C6DCAE2574058E.title: "Void Walker's Garb"
	quest.45C9802AC8C7B3D4.quest_desc: ["Spawns: Caves / Hp: 10 / Attack: 2 / Drops: 1 Coal / Info: Light with flint and steel. Passive towards mobs until lit."]
	quest.45D61414A86BE2F0.quest_desc: [
		"§7Create a digital jukebox that plays custom music and sounds!"
		""
		"§7Basic steps:"
		"§7- Use §fspeakers§7 to play audio"
		"§7- Create a §ffile format§7 for storing songs"
		"§7- Build a user interface on §fmonitors§7 for selection"
		""
		"§7Advanced features:"
		"§7- §fPlaylist management§7 system"
		"§7- §fVisual equalizer§7 display"
		"§7- §fRhythm games§7 with monitor touch input"
		"§7- §fMulti-speaker§7 setups for stereo sound"
	]
	quest.45D61414A86BE2F0.title: "Digital DJ"
	quest.45DE263406F8E158.quest_desc: [
		"§6§lReach for the Strength"
		""
		"&4L_Ender’s Cataclysm "
		"A major combat expansion adding difficult dungeons and powerful boss fights inspired by Minecraft Dungeons. Cataclysm introduces deadly arenas like the Burning Arena (home to Ignis, a blazing infernal boss) and the Crystal Archives (guarded by a magic-infused Illager mage). Each boss guards legendary artifacts – weapons and armor with game-changing abilities. These encounters are multi-phase, bullet-hell battles that will test your combat skills and preparedness to the fullest."
		""
		"§c§lImportant:"
		"The cataclysm category houses all of the quests for the mod. "
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: &7Come prepared with fully enchanted gear and weapons with potions, you are gonna need it!"
	]
	quest.45DE263406F8E158.title: "It is a good time to die!"
	quest.460EACCAA9676362.quest_subtitle: "Right click a tank of cooling fluid to fill the bottle. Applying this to engines gives a roughly 30% fuel saving."
	quest.4613F6388966DB43.quest_subtitle: "Welcome to Create Enchantment Industry, a mod offering more tools and methods to handle experience and enchantment in Create."
	quest.4613F6388966DB43.title: "Enchantment Industry"
	quest.46AA6DDEE2D61735.quest_desc: [
		"§6Decorative Glass"
		""
		"Add style to your windows and glass structures!"
		""
		"§7Try these glass options:"
		"§7• Beveled glass panes"
		"§7• Framed glass"
		"§7• Patterned glass"
		"§7• Colored glass variants"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Use these for elegant greenhouses or shop displays"
	]
	quest.46AA6DDEE2D61735.title: "§eElegant Glass Designs"
	quest.46AB6BCAC2CCE419.quest_subtitle: "Will compress anything that can be in a 2x2 craft"
	quest.46DAF6518AC72572.title: "Create: Bells and Whistles"
	quest.470070CC289B0D65.quest_desc: ["§7Do the same thing as for the normal cohwheel, but now §fDeploy §7the planks onto the cogwheel instead of the shaft. "]
	quest.470070CC289B0D65.title: "Planks + Cogwheel -> Large Cogwheel"
	quest.47700FC39E0F7BD4.quest_desc: [
		"This mod adds a tape measure which you can use to measure the distance between positions."
		""
		" "
		""
		"After obtaining the Tape Measure you can start measuring by right-clicking on a block once."
		""
		"Then moving to the second position and right-clicking the block on that position."
	]
	quest.477A02A9E8D642D6.quest_desc: ["DECORATION!!!"]
	quest.477A02A9E8D642D6.quest_subtitle: "DECORATION!!!"
	quest.478996586F76CDED.quest_desc: [
		"§6Diamond Backpack"
		""
		"Premium mobile storage!"
		""
		"§7Storage:"
		"§7• Base: 108 slots"
		"§7• 4 upgrade slots"
		"§7• Diamond trim"
		""
		"§6Features:"
		"§7• Massive capacity"
		"§7• Multiple upgrade combos"
		"§7• Enhanced durability"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Perfect for major expeditions!"
	]
	quest.478996586F76CDED.title: "§eDiamond Backpack"
	quest.47A34C2267D6EB1E.quest_desc: ["The &6harvester&r will automatically harvest crops when added to a machine"]
	quest.47A34C2267D6EB1E.quest_subtitle: "Crop harvesting"
	quest.47A92AE4FD058EC0.quest_desc: ["§7To transform §fSlime Balls§7 into §fMagma Cream§7, you'll need to use a §fBulk Superheating§7 process."]
	quest.47A92AE4FD058EC0.title: "Slime Ball -> Magma Cream"
	quest.47EC14F22A514B79.quest_desc: [
		"§7To fully control your fluid systems, you'll need these components:"
		""
		"§7§fMechanical Pumps §7- Actively move fluids through pipes when powered"
		"§7§fFluid Valves §7- Control flow rate with redstone or rotation speed"
		"§7§fSmart Fluid Pipes §7- Filter which fluids can pass through"
		""
		"§7Tip: Use valves to prevent backflow in complex systems with multiple fluid sources!"
	]
	quest.47EC14F22A514B79.title: "Moving Fluids"
	quest.47F2B5FE5F90F49F.title: "Diesel Cylinder"
	quest.47F5F4AC4E8E09D9.quest_desc: [
		"§7Blackstone can be created from cobblestone:"
		""
		"§71. Place cobblestone on a §fDepot §7or §fBelt"
		"§72. Use an §fEncased Fan §7with soul fire to §fHaunt §7it into blackstone"
		""
		"§7Remember to set up soul fire (using soul sand/soil) for the haunting process!"
	]
	quest.47F5F4AC4E8E09D9.title: "Cobblestone -> Blackstone"
	quest.47FF87781B537FD5.quest_desc: ["Let's you quickly insert into item vault. "]
	quest.47FF87781B537FD5.quest_subtitle: "Put on item vault"
	quest.483BB9005E58EAE5.quest_desc: [
		"Requires air to be fed in from an air intake."
		""
		"Make sure to pipe out the CO2."
	]
	quest.483BB9005E58EAE5.quest_subtitle: "Same as the simple large engine but makes some more power."
	quest.48573F9B8B326804.title: "Summon and kill &dThe Wither&r"
	quest.485CB03C2E484418.quest_desc: ["Use the explorer's compass to find it. "]
	quest.48A3E636426CDACA.quest_desc: ["Respawning Structures A tweak mod that causes certain generated structures to regenerate their loot and enemies after a set time. Cleared a dungeon or tower? Don’t be surprised to find it inhabited again later! This ensures that the world remains dynamic and rewarding to re-explore – you can’t permanently pacify the wild. It keeps adventures renewable, but also means you must stay on guard even in regions you thought were safe."]
	quest.48AE232DF7A23859.quest_desc: [
		"§6Crafting CPU"
		""
		"Automated crafting brain!"
		""
		"§7Components:"
		"§7• Crafting Storage"
		"§7• Crafting Co-Processor"
		"§7• Must form multiblock"
		""
		"§6Features:"
		"§7• Parallel processing"
		"§7• Multiple CPU clusters"
		"§7• Status monitoring"
		""
