	quest.48D322B83D9B9D32.quest_desc: [
		"§7Create Sculk Grime by mixing §fSculk§7, §fWater§7, and additional §fSculk Grime§7 in a §fMechanical Mixer§7."
		""
		"§7This process yields 2 Sculk Grime for every 1 used, creating a self-sustaining loop."
		""
		"§7This is a key automation breakthrough that allows for infinite Grime production!"
	]
	quest.48D322B83D9B9D32.title: "Sculk + Water + Sculk Grime → 2x Sculk Grime"
	quest.48E5D56C47DF6642.quest_subtitle: "The thing your train goes on."
	quest.48E5D56C47DF6642.title: "Train Tracks"
	quest.490298E732311D92.quest_desc: [
		"§7To create §fRedstone Dust§7, you'll need to process redstone blocks through a §fCrushing Wheel§7."
		""
		"§7Set up an automated system that processes redstone blocks into fine dust."
		""
		"§7This dust is essential for creating the logic processors that power your AE2 network."
	]
	quest.490298E732311D92.title: "Planks -> Sticks"
	quest.490381CD8605FAB3.quest_desc: [
		"§7To make copper sheets, you'll need to process copper ingots:"
		""
		"§71. Place copper ingots on a §fDepot"
		"§72. Use a §fMechanical Press §7powered by rotation to press the ingots into sheets"
		""
		"§7Tip: Set up an automated system with funnels to feed copper ingots into the press and collect the sheets!"
	]
	quest.490381CD8605FAB3.title: "Copper Ingots -> Copper Sheets"
	quest.4918B0939E4604A0.quest_subtitle: "Have a look at your entire inventory like a computer looking at all their files in one place and access them."
	quest.4918B0939E4604A0.title: "Terminals"
	quest.494EB3A11ADC2336.quest_desc: [
		"Let's take your veggie production to the next level with automation!"
		""
		"Create's mechanical harvesters can automatically collect crops when they're fully grown."
		""
		"§6Setup:§r"
		"• Place mechanical harvesters facing your crop fields"
		"• Connect them to a rotational power source"
		"• Add a collection system using funnels and chests/belts"
		""
		"§7This is your first step toward true automation!§r"
	]
	quest.494EB3A11ADC2336.title: "Automated Harvesting"
	quest.496FC8106904193E.quest_subtitle: "Diesel Generators are a compact way of generating kinetic energy."
	quest.49901AE0CD7E39EF.title: "Craft Concrete Formwork"
	quest.49C19FE1535DBFA0.quest_desc: [
		"\"Those who followed this eye were never seen again; rumors say they found the great city of atlantis, or lost their way trying.\""
		""
		"§7The Exotic Eye seems to lead to the most mysterious places in the world."
		"§7This eye is found in the most exotic and hard-to-reach locations."
		"§7Be careful when using it - it might lead you on a dangerous journey!"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Look for this eye in the rarest biome variants in your world."
	]
	quest.49EE6F88CD93352E.quest_subtitle: "When placed in front of the Encased Fan this allows it to blast items."
	quest.4A05B8ACEF72BAC0.quest_desc: [
		"The mechanical drill can mine blocks automatically when attached to moving contraptions."
		""
		"§7Perfect for automated mining operations or clearing large areas."
		""
		"§7Try attaching it to a piston or mechanical bearing for different mining patterns."
	]
	quest.4A05B8ACEF72BAC0.title: "Automated Mining"
	quest.4A0C64647FC9572B.quest_desc: [
		"§7The §fModular Diesel Engine§7 provides greater power output than its smaller counterpart."
		""
		"§7This industrial-grade engine consumes more fuel but delivers substantially more rotational force."
		""
		"§7Perfect for powering multiple contraptions simultaneously or driving high-demand machinery."
		""
		"§7Ensure you have a robust fuel production line to keep this hungry engine running efficiently."
	]
	quest.4A19E3387DBD7FB0.quest_desc: [
		"Consumes spools of &6wire&r to wind around items."
		""
		"Crafting recipes involving the winder (e.g. generator, potentiometer) will always wind the exact amount necessary."
		""
		"For winding &6magnetic coils&r, a winding &bpercentage&r can be specified out of 1000 turns, with a minimum of 100 turns (10% = 100 turns). Making more than 100 turns is only used for transformer coils. Number of turns left on the wire spool can be observed with &egoggles.&r"
		""
		"Items cannot be extracted manually (except for the wire spool), but there is no filter for unfinished items. For manual winding operations, use a funnel and a lever."
	]
	quest.4A19E3387DBD7FB0.quest_subtitle: "Now you've wound me up."
	quest.4A27BAEC8E0C8F2C.quest_desc: [
		"§6Crushing"
		""
		"Your first step in advanced processing is crushing raw ores. This opens up better processing paths."
		""
		"§7Required Create Components:"
		"§7• Crushing Wheels (2)"
		"§7• Mechanical Power"
		""
		"§6Yields per Raw Ore:"
		"§7• 1 Raw Ore → 1 Crushed Ore"
		"§7• Chance for experience nugget"
		"§7• Additional processing options unlocked"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Automate crushing early - you'll need lots of crushed ore!"
	]
	quest.4A27BAEC8E0C8F2C.title: "§eCrushing Operations"
	quest.4A28DEAA0E884AE6.quest_desc: [
		"§7Echo Crystals are rare formations found deep within the Otherside. When mined, they produce Echo Shards - valuable resources with unique resonant properties."
		""
		"§6Finding Echo Crystals:"
		"§7• Look in deep caverns of the Otherside"
		"§7• Often found near ancient structures"
		"§7• Emit a faint blue glow and resonant sound"
		""
		"§6Mining techniques:"
		"§7• Use tools with silk touch to harvest the entire crystal"
		"§7• Regular mining yields fewer shards"
		"§7• Mining quietly reduces the chance of attracting nearby hostiles"
	]
	quest.4A28DEAA0E884AE6.title: "Resonant Fragments"
	quest.4A32E607F9C82266.quest_desc: [
		"§7The §fFestive Delight§7 addon adds seasonal treats perfect for holiday celebrations!"
		""
		"§7Automating §fgingerbread houses§7 and §fcandy canes§7 can bring festive cheer to your base year-round."
		""
		"§fTIP:§7 These seasonal items make great gifts and decorations. Set up a dedicated production line to keep your storage stocked!"
		""
		"§7Try using §fbasin mixing§7 for the dough and §fdeployers§7 for the assembly!"
	]
	quest.4A32E607F9C82266.title: "Festive Treats Factory"
	quest.4A59ED3829D4D682.title: "Prepare Stamppot by Pressing Carrots and Potatoes in a Basin"
	quest.4A691BB889C1E38A.quest_desc: [
		"Every adventurer needs a good set of tools!"
		"Craft some basic stone tools to help you gather resources more efficiently."
		""
		"§7Tip: Stone tools are much more durable than wooden ones."
		""
		"§7Tip: The stone pickaxe will let you mine iron ore, which you'll need soon."
	]
	quest.4A691BB889C1E38A.title: "Stone Age Basics"
	quest.4A74062E59F8CD56.quest_desc: [
		"Mechanical belts transfer rotation between shafts that aren't directly connected."
		""
		"§7Place two shafts parallel to each other, with empty spaces between them, and right-click with rope to create a belt."
		""
		"§7Belts can also transport items when used with funnels and chutes!"
	]
	quest.4A74062E59F8CD56.title: "Item and Power Transport"
	quest.4A8BE37C33E3BB05.quest_desc: [
		"§6Processors"
		""
		"The brains of your system!"
		""
		"§7Types Available:"
		"§7• Logic (Gold)"
		"§7• Calculation (Certus)"
		"§7• Engineering (Diamond)"
		""
		"§7Creation Process:"
		"§7• Press components (Create Deploying)"
		"§7• Combine with silicon"
		"§7• Process in Create Assembly"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Automate processor production early!"
	]
	quest.4A8BE37C33E3BB05.title: "§eProcessors"
	quest.4A9BDC210AA45E32.quest_desc: [
		"§7The Spectre is a mysterious entity found in the depths of Crystal Canyons."
		""
		"§7These ethereal beings are tied to the magical properties of the crystals."
		""
		"§7Be cautious when approaching - they may have secrets to reveal!"
		""
		"§7Spectres are attracted to the power of crystals and will sometimes be found observing crystal formations."
	]
	quest.4A9BDC210AA45E32.title: "Ethereal Encounters"
	quest.4A9D0D014C61CB7B.quest_desc: ["The &6sturdy sheets&r mark the start of the train age, you will benefit from having lava and obsidian generating passively at this point if you plan to have an expansive and grand rail line throughout your world"]
	quest.4A9D0D014C61CB7B.quest_subtitle: "The start of the great railways"
	quest.4AA1614DA59D37C5.quest_desc: [
		"§7Allocate a portion of your automated §fGlowstone Dust§7 to your Moon Cobblestone production."
		""
		"§7This luminous material adds essential properties to the lunar stone creation process."
		""
		"§7Ensure consistent delivery to maintain your Moon Cobblestone manufacturing loop."
	]
	quest.4AA1614DA59D37C5.title: "Glowstone Dust"
	quest.4AA3033E2554D625.title: "Deepfry ice?"
	quest.4AB99C8447183BAC.quest_desc: [
		"§7If you followed Chapter 2 correctly, you should already have log automation set up."
		""
		"§7Your existing automation system should be using:"
		"§71. §fMechanical Saws §7on a §fRotating Contraption"
		"§72. §fDeployers §7with saplings to replant trees"
		""
		"§7This sustainable wood farm will be crucial for rubber production!"
	]
	quest.4AB99C8447183BAC.title: "Already Automated: Logs"
	quest.4AD661C0A10ABD3B.quest_desc: ["With a spout attached to the tank of liquid xp via pipes, you will be able to put the liquid back into bottles either by right clicking bottles onto a depot or having bottles put on a belt line underneath the spout"]
	quest.4AD661C0A10ABD3B.quest_subtitle: "Making Bottles o' Enchanting"
	quest.4AFEE661284E2CBA.quest_desc: [
		"§7Feed Cobblestone from your §fCobblestone Generator§7 into your Netherrack production line."
		""
		"§7This basic building block combines with Cinder Flour and Lava to form Netherrack."
		""
		"§7Ensure a steady supply to keep your Netherrack production running smoothly."
	]
	quest.4AFEE661284E2CBA.title: "Cobblestone"
	quest.4B18C473FE242906.quest_desc: [
		"§7Create §fGlowstone Dust§7 by using a §fSpout§7 to pour §fLava§7 onto §fRedstone Dust§7."
		""
		"§7The intense heat of lava transforms the redstone into glowstone through a magical reaction."
		""
		"§7Set up an automated system that can reliably produce Glowstone Dust without manual intervention."
	]
	quest.4B18C473FE242906.title: "Lava + Redstone → Glowstone Dust"
	quest.4B3D35E2B7562509.quest_subtitle: "2x base storage capacity"
	quest.4B3E9D750F5E8B2B.quest_desc: [
		"§6Paper and Cloths"
		""
		"Add delicate decorative elements to your builds!"
		""
		"§7Try crafting these options:"
		"§7• Paper walls and lanterns"
		"§7• Colored paper blocks"
		"§7• Patterned cloths"
		"§7• Decorative screens"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Perfect for Japanese-style builds and dividers"
	]
	quest.4B3E9D750F5E8B2B.title: "§ePaper and Fabric Decor"
	quest.4B4B3352870D70EC.title: "Collect chorus fruit and flower"
	quest.4B5F93FB8ACD708D.quest_subtitle: "Easy way to drop items into your storage system"
	quest.4B856811D221C35B.quest_desc: ["§7To create §fWheat Flour§7, you'll need to process wheat through §fCrushing Wheels§7."]
	quest.4B856811D221C35B.title: "Wheat -> Wheat Flour"
	quest.4B99B70CD1506925.quest_subtitle: "connect both of these directly to a rod. (reminder that the inserter works ONLY in a straight line)"
	quest.4B99B70CD1506925.title: "Inserting fuel and pumping out heat"
	quest.4B9F31AC8F3D77FC.quest_desc: [
		"Beyond Saturn lies Uranus, a mysterious ice giant with unique challenges and resources."
		""
		"Prepare for the journey by crafting a Tier 7 rocket using your newly acquired Saturlyte materials."
		""
		"§7The extreme cold of Uranus will test even your most advanced equipment. Consider bringing additional heating modules and specialized insulation."
	]
	quest.4B9F31AC8F3D77FC.title: "Sideways Journey"
	quest.4BA46D65C25A492B.quest_desc: [
		"Having conquered the Moon, Mars, Venus, Mercury, and even ventured to the orbit of Proxima Centauri, you're now ready to explore the outer reaches of our solar system!"
		""
		"Ad Extendra introduces even more planets to discover, more powerful rockets to build, and greater challenges to overcome."
		""
		"Your journey continues with exploring gas giants like Jupiter and Saturn, and eventually reaching the most distant dwarf planets like Pluto."
		""
		"Prepare yourself for the next stage of your cosmic adventure!"
	]
	quest.4BA46D65C25A492B.title: "Beyond the Inner Planets"
	quest.4BAACD5ACEDCAB1F.quest_subtitle: "Decide more about what's automatically picked up"
	quest.4BCC40F1007650F7.quest_desc: [
		"The §fDawn of Time Builder §7mod adds authentic medieval building blocks and furniture."
		""
		"§7Create a cozy medieval tavern, a grand castle, or a humble village house."
		""
		"§7Tip: Mix and match with vanilla blocks for the best results."
	]
	quest.4BCC40F1007650F7.title: "Medieval Aesthetics"
	quest.4BDCEB6206242999.quest_desc: ["§7If you have followed the quests correctly, you should already have automated this."]
	quest.4BDCEB6206242999.title: "Andesite Alloy"
	quest.4BF00406D0D157D6.quest_desc: [
		"§7Tuff is already automatically produced by your previous setups."
		""
		"§7This versatile stone is an excellent source of copper and zinc when processed."
	]
	quest.4BF00406D0D157D6.title: "Already Automated: Tuff"
	quest.4BFC113227A11218.quest_desc: [
		"§7Fill a §fBlaze Cake Base§7 with §fLava§7 using a §fSpout§7 to create a complete Blaze Cake."
		""
		"§7This energy-dense food item can be used to supercharge Blaze Burners for high-temperature operations."
		""
		"§7Set up precise fluid control to prevent overflow during this filling process."
	]
	quest.4BFC113227A11218.title: "Blaze Cake Base + Lava → Blaze Cake"
	quest.4C076BCACF6E16CA.title: "Defeat the &5Ender Dragon&r"
	quest.4C1E7C32DEB7CF21.quest_desc: [
		"Coastal cliffs are dangerous places. Adventurers tell of winged serpents called nagas with impressive speed and menacing acid venom. Though these drakes are evasive, a well-placed arrow can knock a naga right out of the sky; time your shots to hit when the naga is preparing an attack, and you can defeat it with ease."
		""
		"Naga acid is deadly, but can actually be used to neutralize other poisons. The fangs they drop upon death can be used to brew poison antidotes and preventatives."
	]
	quest.4C23E2F82033B1B7.quest_desc: [
		"Congratulations! You've mastered the art of teleportation with Waystones."
		""
		"You now have the knowledge to create a comprehensive teleportation network throughout your world, with various specialized waystones and teleportation tools to suit your needs."
		""
		"Remember, teleportation consumes experience by default, but server settings may change this behavior."
	]
	quest.4C23E2F82033B1B7.title: "§d§lTeleportation Master"
	quest.4C2D5F9FD7B8FB22.quest_desc: ["One can only begin to make these questlines once they are well and truly addicted to cement."]
	quest.4C2D5F9FD7B8FB22.quest_subtitle: "No, it's not concrete yet."
	quest.4C3454AE44250449.quest_desc: [
		"Like Blazes and Breezes, Bluffs are elemental magic given form. They are drawn to places of immense elemental power, and so they infested the Earthrend Monasteries after the monks disappeared."
		""
		"They drop Bluff Rods on death, which are used to repair Geomancy items and to start the Sculptor's test."
	]
	quest.4C5CDA8B11EC5D91.quest_desc: [
		"§6Paved Paths and Roads"
		""
		"Create beautiful pathways and roads for your builds!"
		""
		"§7Try these path designs:"
		"§7• Stone path blocks"
		"§7• Asphalt and concrete"
		"§7• Patterned path blocks"
		"§7• Mixed materials for texture"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Add path lights and decorative borders for extra detail"
	]
	quest.4C5CDA8B11EC5D91.title: "§ePathways and Roads"
	quest.4C87283E5D8A3872.quest_desc: ["Drill drains help you to create your tunnels and quarries without the common problem of flooding and without the need of expensive arrays of deployers, balanced at the cost of including the storage for the fluids (configurable)."]
	quest.4C87283E5D8A3872.title: "Create Drill Drain"
	quest.4C9DD3B28C6746BF.quest_desc: [
		"§6Wooden Varieties"
		""
		"Blockus expands your wooden building options tremendously!"
		""
		"§7Try these wooden variants:"
		"§7• Herringbone planks"
		"§7• Parquet planks"
		"§7• Wooden tiles"
		"§7• Charred planks"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Mix different wood patterns for interesting ceilings and floors"
	]
	quest.4C9DD3B28C6746BF.title: "§eEnhanced Wood Options"
	quest.4CA82D89B59B33F6.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Casting Basin or Casting Table"
	quest.4CA82D89B59B33F6.title: "Don't Try To Blow on It!"
	quest.4CADD10D59979DE7.quest_desc: [
		"Mercury is the closest planet to the Sun, with extreme temperatures that cycle between burning hot and freezing cold as it rotates. It's rich in valuable resources, especially Calorite."
		""
		"Key Mercury features:"
		"- Additional Calorite deposits"
		"- Most extreme temperature variations"
		"- Barren, cratered landscape"
		"- No atmosphere"
		""
		"§7Warning: The temperature swings on Mercury can damage equipment. Full Netherite-tier protection is essential."
	]
	quest.4CADD10D59979DE7.title: "Sunburnt World"
	quest.4CCDD0283D36BD8A.quest_desc: ["The &6train casing&r is the main block use to create all things train related"]
	quest.4CCDD0283D36BD8A.quest_subtitle: "Almost ready to assemble"
	quest.4CDB3F8E217ADC8E.quest_subtitle: "Mix in a heated basin."
	quest.4CEAA300547D8103.quest_desc: [
		"§7Cobblestone can be generated infinitely using a §fCobblestone Generator§7."
		""
		"§7Set up a mechanical system to harvest and transport the generated cobblestone."
		""
		"§7This renewable resource is fundamental to your space program's material chain."
	]
	quest.4CEAA300547D8103.title: "Cobblestone Generation"
	quest.4CFB72C84BA53782.quest_desc: ["The &6millstone&r has the ability to crush many items"]
	quest.4CFB72C84BA53782.quest_subtitle: "Can make dye and other things"
	quest.4CFB72C84BA53782.title: "Millstone"
	quest.4D4C232EAD4C89BC.quest_desc: [
		"§6Alpha/Beta Leaf Blocks"
		""
		"Remember when leaves were completely opaque blocks?"
		""
		"§7These blocks include:"
		"§7• First leaf block texture"
		"§7• Beta leaf patterns"
		"§7• Solid, non-transparent leaf blocks"
		"§7• Original tree designs"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Mix with modern leaves to create an interesting contrast"
	]
	quest.4D4C232EAD4C89BC.title: "§eOriginal Tree Blocks"
	quest.4D4EC850EBE23FA3.quest_desc: [
		"The Warp Plate is an advanced teleportation device that automatically teleports any entity that stands on it to the linked waystone."
		""
		"Perfect for creating automated transportation systems!"
	]
	quest.4D4EC850EBE23FA3.title: "Automated Teleporter"
	quest.4D55A7ABD7557FF1.quest_desc: ["Any &6enchanted item&r can be placed on a disenchanted and it will take the xp and store it as liquid and you will get what you put that was enchanted back, so &6enchanted book&r will give you a book back, or &6an enchanted piece of armour&r will give you the armour piece without any enchantments"]
	quest.4D55A7ABD7557FF1.quest_subtitle: "Any enchanted book"
	quest.4D55A7ABD7557FF1.title: "Disenchanting Enchanted Items"
	quest.4D57C59D27514975.quest_desc: ["§7If you have followed the quests correctly, you should already have automated this."]
	quest.4D82A6BF692E1A75.quest_desc: ["Lanterns dot the canopy of roofed forests, glowing like jellyfish. Some cultures believe that these creatures contain the souls of the recently deceased. Others wish on them like stars. Adventurers, however, know that the luminous jelly inside lanterns is a great light snack that will briefly illuminate the darkest of nights."]
	quest.4DA2A7D83DCFC75A.quest_desc: [
		"§7Build a fully automated Biodiesel production line."
		""
		"§7Biodiesel is created by mixing Plant Oil and Ethanol in a Mixer, then processing it further."
		""
		"§7This high-quality fuel provides excellent performance for your Diesel Engine."
	]
	quest.4DA2A7D83DCFC75A.title: "Biodiesel Production"
	quest.4DC3AC792B3B91E2.quest_desc: ["The &6mechanical bearing&r is the centre piece of machines, it lets you build any machine onto it and becomes the central spinning part of the machine"]
	quest.4DC3AC792B3B91E2.quest_subtitle: "The key to machines"
	quest.4DC3AC792B3B91E2.title: "Mechanical Bearing"
	quest.4DD5EEE415ACB9AA.quest_desc: [
		"§7Vines can be created by processing §fKelp§7 through a §fMechanical Saw§7."
		""
		"§7The cutting action transforms the aquatic plant into climbing vines suitable for your automation needs."
		""
		"§7Set up an automatic cutting station to process kelp into vines efficiently."
	]
	quest.4DD5EEE415ACB9AA.title: "Kelp → Vines"
	quest.4DD8EC6663F695BC.quest_subtitle: "Place down a Sequenced Pulse Generator"
	quest.4DD8EC6663F695BC.title: "Computational Supremacy"
	quest.4DE18CB6F344809A.title: "Make a fully powered beacon"
	quest.4DF1F48B12D460B1.quest_desc: [
		"§6Smelting Upgrades"
		""
		"Process items directly in storage!"
		""
		"§7Types Available:"
		"§7• Smelting"
		"§7• Smoking"
		"§7• Blasting"
		""
		"§6Features:"
		"§7• Auto-processing"
		"§7• Fuel efficient"
		"§7• Filter compatible"
	]
	quest.4DF1F48B12D460B1.title: "§eProcessing Upgrades"
	quest.4E0503134BFF19F0.quest_subtitle: "A block that can monitor the fill levels of inventories and tanks."
	quest.4E058BAF38B16EE0.quest_subtitle: "And then we connect- POP!"
	quest.4E1D2DC78E017E20.title: "Card"
	quest.4E23C0E757337A53.quest_desc: [
		"§fSplashing §7gravel will remove all the pebbles and leave you with only flint and iron nuggets"
		""
		"§7For references on how §fSplashing §7works, look at the nether quartz quest. "
	]
	quest.4E23C0E757337A53.title: "Gravel -> Iron Nuggets"
	quest.4E45C1FA4A67B68D.quest_desc: [
		"§6Patterned Blocks"
		""
		"Create elegant floors and walls with these patterned options!"
		""
		"§7Try these patterns:"
		"§7• Checkered patterns"
		"§7• Small and large tiles"
		"§7• Circular patterns"
		"§7• Lattice designs"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Perfect for bathroom, kitchen, and formal room floors"
	]
	quest.4E45C1FA4A67B68D.title: "§ePatterned Flooring"
	quest.4E834477717F726A.quest_subtitle: "Allows you to control the train."
	quest.4E8D3CEF2950E465.quest_subtitle: "Craft the Estrogen Patches and enjoy your long lasting femininity."
	quest.4E8D3CEF2950E465.title: "(Almost) Permanent!"
	quest.4EA5BE7A1FC1C75E.title: "Locate a &bShipwreck&r"
	quest.4EBD5363B552085D.quest_desc: [
		"Puts electrical appliances into series-parallel groups without having to use &6diodes&r or other circuit-splitting parts."
		""
		"Different group numbers are parallel to each other and act like they are on different diodes."
	]
	quest.4EBD5363B552085D.title: "Series and Parallel"
	quest.4EEC97348FEBC92B.quest_desc: ["An addon for the Create 6 mod featuring a unique way of fluid transportation in your logistics network - the Jar. It works like packages for items but for liquids, so it can be neatly integrated into your frog-chain logistical system."]
	quest.4EEC97348FEBC92B.title: "Create Factory Logistics"
	quest.4F05D563FC9D8D0F.quest_desc: [
		"The Tropical Rainforest is a lush, vibrant jungle environment teeming with life."
		""
		"§6Features:"
		"§7• Exotic flora"
		"§7• Dense vegetation"
		"§7• Unique tropical trees"
		""
		"Explore this dense jungle to find rare plants and resources."
	]
	quest.4F05D563FC9D8D0F.title: "Into the Jungle"
	quest.4F40D0CC2A7778BB.quest_desc: [
		"§6Crafting Terminal"
		""
		"Upgrade your storage access with crafting capabilities!"
		""
		"§7Functions:"
		"§7• All features of the Storage Terminal"
		"§7• Built-in 3x3 crafting grid"
		"§7• Access to all items for crafting"
		""
		"§6Benefits:"
		"§7• Craft while viewing your entire inventory"
		"§7• Auto-pulls items from storage"
		"§7• Perfect for bulk crafting projects"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7This should be your main terminal for daily use!"
	]
	quest.4F40D0CC2A7778BB.title: "§eCrafting with Storage Access"
	quest.4F4415CE4EC30024.quest_desc: ["The &6fluid tank&r is a easy way to store a large amount of liquid. The biggest it can be is a 3x3 base and upto 30 tall, which stores a crazy amount"]
	quest.4F4415CE4EC30024.quest_subtitle: "A large liquid container"
	quest.4F5AA576DC7B9B24.quest_desc: ["Throw each of these items in the top of the &6blast furnace&r to produce &emolten steel&r and &emolten slag&r."]
	quest.4F5AA576DC7B9B24.quest_subtitle: "Toss em in the top one after the other. "
	quest.4F5AA576DC7B9B24.title: "Ingredients for Steel"
	quest.4F5DD073636265D5.title: "Create: Extended Wrenches"
	quest.4F603085044BFAAD.title: "Obtain a &2Shaper Armour Trim&r"
	quest.4F61B1F3D1E2C6E2.quest_subtitle: "The main block used for bulk fluid storage."
	quest.4F6A42D9A9E00F94.quest_subtitle: "A more advanced fluid transporter"
	quest.4F6DD7B2A0FBFFB7.quest_subtitle: "Ponder me"
	quest.4F78375EDADAFEC2.title: "Safety goggles on"
	quest.4F898957C7452378.quest_subtitle: "It has to be useful for something, right?"
	quest.4F8BAA7B943299D9.quest_desc: ["Mix nickel and copper in a heated basin."]
	quest.4F8BAA7B943299D9.quest_subtitle: "Don't try to look like you have a constant tan."
	quest.4F93E0F0CD810949.quest_desc: [
		"§7Advanced computers offer more memory and capabilities than standard computers."
		""
		"§7With an §fAdvanced Computer§7, you'll be able to run more complex programs and handle more demanding tasks."
		""
		"§7Perfect for your more ambitious automation projects!"
	]
	quest.4F93E0F0CD810949.title: "Computing Upgrade"
	quest.4F9529851C2F6EA7.quest_desc: [
		"§7Use Create's §fMechanical Saws §7to set up an automatic tree farm. "
		""
		"§7The most popular way to do this is by placing a §fMechanical Bearing§7, then on top of it, a long row of §fMechanical Saws§7, and §fDeployers §7to place the saplings. "
		""
		"§7This will automatically cut down and re-plant trees. "
	]
	quest.4F9529851C2F6EA7.title: "Logs"
	quest.4F98083A1EF33FD8.quest_desc: [
		"§6Gold Tier Storage"
		""
		"Double your basic storage!"
		""
		"§7Features:"
		"§7• Base: 27 slots"
		"§7• Upgrade: +27 slots"
		"§7• Total: 54 slots"
		""
		"§6Additional Benefits:"
		"§7• 3 upgrade slots"
		"§7• Enhanced protection"
		"§7• Faster access speed"
	]
	quest.4F98083A1EF33FD8.title: "§eGold Storage Tier"
	quest.4F9FB3DB916057A8.title: "Already Automated: Copper Ingot"
	quest.4FB387FAB93183B5.quest_desc: [
		"§7The §fDiesel Engine§7 is a powerful rotational generator that runs on various fuel types."
		""
		"§7It can use §fBiodiesel§7, §fPlant Oil§7, or §fDiesel§7 to generate significant rotational force."
		""
		"§7Setup requires a §fFluid Pipe§7 to feed fuel and mechanical power to start the engine."
		""
		"§7Once running, it provides consistent high-speed rotation for your factory's most demanding machinery."
	]
	quest.4FF33CC46A10DD53.quest_desc: [
		"Now that you've mastered railway engineering, here are some advanced project ideas to showcase your skills:"
		""
		"§71. Multi-line metro system with color-coded routes"
		"§72. Automated resource distribution network"
		"§73. Scenic railway with custom stations for each biome"
		"§74. Mountain railway with tunnels and viaducts"
		"§75. Underground subway network connecting bases"
		""
		"§7Share your creations with others for inspiration and ideas!"
	]
	quest.4FF89BDBF3F309A5.quest_desc: [
		"The ultimate explorer needs the ultimate transport! The Jet Suit allows for free flight, making exploration of any world much easier."
		""
		"With this advanced technology, you can soar through the atmospheres of planets, reach difficult locations, and escape dangerous situations quickly."
		""
		"§7Tip: The Jet Suit requires energy to function. Make sure it's charged before venturing out on long expeditions."
	]
	quest.4FF89BDBF3F309A5.title: "Taking Flight"
	quest.4FFD6C191AD6FCC5.quest_desc: [
		"A much better, portable version of the electric gauge. Immensely useful for seeing if something is getting enough &2current&r and &cpower.&r"
		""
		"&4D&6y&ee&aa&3b&5l&de&c!"
	]
	quest.4FFD6C191AD6FCC5.quest_subtitle: "!! Does not work with goggles on !!"
	quest.4FFE92F9BD1FA9F9.quest_desc: ["The &62x2 drawer&r holds &68 stacks&r in each of the option slots"]
	quest.4FFE92F9BD1FA9F9.quest_subtitle: "What it holds"
	quest.5062F049AFCBC5CB.quest_desc: ["You will polish the &drose quartz&r to use in making electron tubes"]
	quest.5062F049AFCBC5CB.quest_subtitle: "Off hand the sand paper and then right click with the &drose quartz&r"
	quest.5062F049AFCBC5CB.title: "&dPolished Rose Quartz&r"
	quest.509618C2041CC4A7.quest_desc: [
		"§7Iron nuggets are essential components for sealed mechanisms."
		""
		"§7If you've followed Chapter 2, you should already have iron nugget automation through:"
		"§71. §fCrushing §7gravel in a §fCrusher §7or §fMillstone"
		"§72. §fWashing §7the crushed gravel using §fEncased Fans §7with water"
		""
		"§7Make sure your iron nugget production is efficient - you'll need many of them!"
	]
	quest.509618C2041CC4A7.title: "Automated Iron Nuggets"
	quest.50A80D9729C0B76C.quest_desc: [
		"§7To create §fSturdy Sheets§7, you'll need to use a §fsequenced assembly process§7."
		""
		"§7First, apply §fLava§7 to §fPowdered Obsidian§7, then press the result twice to form the sturdy sheet."
	]
	quest.50A80D9729C0B76C.title: "Lava + Powdered Obsidian -> Sturdy Sheet"
	quest.50B1D8919A88F66C.quest_desc: [
		"A proper home needs proper walls and floors!"
		"Stone bricks and wooden planks are classic building materials."
		""
		"§7Tip: Mix different block types for texture in your builds."
		""
		"§7Tip: Stairs and slabs can add depth to your walls."
	]
	quest.50B1D8919A88F66C.title: "Building Basics"
	quest.50C0D23949DD8BE6.quest_subtitle: "Allows you to stop rotational force coming through when powered by a redstone signal."
	quest.50E24C9D3DB0D995.quest_desc: [
		"With the Slice 'n' Dice working, let's create a complete veggie processing line!"
		""
		"§6Complete setup:§r"
		"• Automated farms feed directly into your system"
		"• Mechanical harvesters collect crops"
		"• Belts transport vegetables to the slicer"
		"• Sliced vegetables are sorted and stored"
		""
		"This system should process tomatoes into tomato slices and cabbage into cabbage leaves, ready for burger assembly!"
	]
	quest.50E24C9D3DB0D995.title: "Veggie Prep Line"
	quest.511054E8740CDC84.title: "Obtain Molten Steel"
	quest.51199F7B9ADAA4A2.quest_desc: ["Chimes is a Minecraft mod that introduces Wind Chimes into the game! Wind Chimes produce ambient chiming sounds when hung from supporting blocks and can be interacted with. In addition, Wind Chimes animate in the wind and repel Phantoms from approaching players near a chiming Wind Chime! More detailed information can be found in the following."]
	quest.51199F7B9ADAA4A2.quest_subtitle: "Keeps specific mob away."
	quest.512D1E50513754E6.quest_desc: ["Farmer’s Delight (and addons) A farming and cooking expansion that enriches the way you grow food and prepare meals. Farmer’s Delight adds new crops (tomatoes, cabbages, rice, etc.), a cooking pot for hearty stews, a frying pan for gourmet dishes, and more. You can craft knives to obtain cooking ingredients and build a cozy kitchen setup. Its many addons (such as Nether’s Delight for Nether ingredients and others for additional recipes) ensure no region is left out – you can even cook with exotic Nether fauna. High-quality foods from this mod grant powerful buffs and saturation, which pairs well with the survival-focused Spice of Life mods. Embracing farming and cooking will greatly enhance your long-term survivability and is a rewarding side progression when you need a break from adventuring."]
	quest.512D1E50513754E6.quest_subtitle: "Make brand new food and plant new crops."
	quest.512D1E50513754E6.title: "Farmers Delight"
	quest.5192A23748C3AC21.quest_subtitle: "Deployer can now perform Cutting Board Recipes (Farmer's Delight) on Belt and Depot."
	quest.5192A23748C3AC21.title: "Cutting Board Recipe Automation"
	quest.51CED99CFEEFD157.quest_desc: [
		"§6Glowing Obsidian"
		""
		"This mysterious block once appeared during Nether Reactor activations!"
		""
		"§7Historical facts:"
		"§7• Created when activating a Nether Reactor"
		"§7• Emitted a reddish glow"
		"§7• Was removed before official release"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Perfect for atmospheric lighting in dark builds"
	]
	quest.51CED99CFEEFD157.title: "§eGlowing Obsidian"
	quest.51D48D32ED67E37C.title: "Obtain Recipe Card, Lathe automation item"
	quest.51E37CE8D0904957.title: "Locate a &2Pillager Outpost&r"
	quest.51E47C9A52DC30BE.quest_desc: [
		"§6Redstone Aesthetics"
		""
		"Make your redstone creations beautiful too!"
		""
		"§7Try these redstone-friendly blocks:"
		"§7• Colored redstone lamps"
		"§7• Hidden redstone conduits"
		"§7• Decorative buttons and levers"
		"§7• Integrated design elements"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Hide your redstone while keeping your builds beautiful"
	]
	quest.51E47C9A52DC30BE.title: "§eRedstone and Decoration"
	quest.5208292C9BD68EFD.quest_desc: [
		"§6Pattern Provider"
		""
		"Crafting automation hub!"
		""
		"§7Pattern Types:"
		"§7• Crafting patterns"
		"§7• Processing patterns"
		""
		"§6Setup Tips:"
		"§7• Adjacent to machines"
		"§7• Clear input/output"
		"§7• Proper pattern type"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Use pattern multiplier!"
	]
	quest.5208292C9BD68EFD.title: "§eAutomated Crafting"
	quest.520F99324F9DA2C8.quest_desc: [
		"§6Common Legacy Ores"
		""
		"The original common mineral ore designs!"
		""
		"§7These blocks include:"
		"§7• Beta coal ore pattern"
		"§7• Original iron ore texture"
		"§7• Classic stone patterns with ore speckles"
		"§7• Early mining-focused blocks"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Use these in mining shaft builds for authenticity"
	]
	quest.520F99324F9DA2C8.title: "§eCommon Legacy Ores"
	quest.5216C61BC0901BA4.quest_desc: [
		"Pump in various fuels to light up the area."
		""
		"Works with: &efurnace gas, crude oil, heavy oil, diesel, kerosene, naphtha, gasoline and LPG&r."
		""
		"Even though they don't have recipes yet: &9hydrogen, butane and propane&r also work."
	]
	quest.5216C61BC0901BA4.quest_subtitle: "Peak Victorian aesthetic."
	quest.52490456CC021CD1.quest_subtitle: "Used to visualise valid paths for trains."
	quest.5272D9AC88702DE2.quest_subtitle: "Modular Diesel Generators function like normal Diesel generators. They can be stacked. They will generate stress proportionally to how much engines you stack."
	quest.52A29EA2DDF3B044.title: "Premium Armor"
	quest.52B14336BAF0A69E.quest_desc: [
		"§7The low gravity environment of the moon allows for extraordinary mobility."
		""
		"§7Craft a §fGravity Normalizer§7 to adjust gravity to your preference for various activities."
		""
		"§7Experiment with different gravity settings to improve mining efficiency and movement."
	]
	quest.52B14336BAF0A69E.title: "Lunar Gravity Experiments"
	quest.52C1D5727A82A72F.quest_subtitle: "Tunnels are used to manage the flow of items on belts."
	quest.52D8B15C3B75AB7F.quest_desc: [
		"The &2generator&r consumes SU to generate electricity. The faster it spins, the more voltage and power it creates, up to a maximum of &3255V&r and &c12.1kW&r. More nerd details on the next page."
		""
		"This is a multi-step deploying recipe, with one step involving the &ewinding machine&r."
		"Start with a &6shaft&r and do the following steps:"
		""
		"1. Capacitor"
		"2. Heavy plate"
		"3. Use a &ewinding machine&r to wrap 75 turns of &6copper wire&r around it."
		"4. Magnet"
		"5. Steel mechanism"
		"6. Screwdriver"
		""
		"Repeat this three times for an 83% chance of getting a generator."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&30RPM - 40RPM&r"
		"No electricity generation"
		""
		"&341RPM - 223RPM&r"
		"Linear voltage rise from 1V - 255V"
		"Constant current limit of 40A, thus power output ranges from 40W - 10.2kW"
		""
		"&3224RPM - 256RPM&r"
		"Constant 255V with increasing power output up to 12.1kW"
		"Current limit increases to 47.5A"
	]
	quest.52D8B15C3B75AB7F.quest_subtitle: "You got the power."
	quest.52D8B15C3B75AB7F.title: "Generator"
	quest.5301642EE0752220.quest_subtitle: "Lets you couple and decouple trains without dissasembly."
	quest.53154550397E9704.quest_desc: ["Found via structure Soul Blacksmith"]
	quest.53318D9F89044F59.quest_desc: [
		"§6Inventory Proxy"
		""
		"Access your network from different locations!"
		""
		"§7Function:"
		"§7• Creates a 'virtual' access point for your network"
		"§7• No physical connection needed to the main network"
		"§7• Must be in the same dimension"
		""
		"§6Applications:"
		"§7• Access your storage from different rooms"
		"§7• Create multiple access points around your base"
		"§7• Avoid running cables everywhere"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Place these in different rooms of your base for convenient access!"
	]
	quest.53318D9F89044F59.title: "§eRemote Access Points"
	quest.53328997DC184B7C.quest_subtitle: "The engine base will prompt you to right click each of these items onto it."
	quest.53328997DC184B7C.title: "Turbine Parts"
	quest.534C7AA1B143DEA5.quest_desc: [
		"Your exploration skills are impressive! You've found many of the unique biomes."
		""
		"Keep exploring to find every last biome this world has to offer."
	]
	quest.534C7AA1B143DEA5.title: "Seasoned Wanderer"
	quest.5361C0C6569939F9.title: "Make yourself strong"
	quest.536D6C70EB11777F.quest_desc: [
		"Now it's time to turn your flour into proper burger buns!"
		""
		"§6Manual process:§r"
		"• Combine flour with water in a basin to make dough"
		"• Cook the dough in a furnace or smoker to make bread"
		""
		"Later, we'll automate this entire process!"
	]
	quest.536D6C70EB11777F.title: "Bun Bakery"
	quest.538C505892BF5691.quest_desc: [
		"Fresh vegetables are essential for a quality burger!"
		""
		"Set up farms for tomatoes and cabbage - they'll add freshness and flavor to your burgers."
		""
		"§6Tips:§r"
		"• Tomatoes grow on vines and need support"
		"• Cabbage grows similar to wheat but yields leafy greens"
		"• Use Rich Soil for faster growth"
	]
	quest.538C505892BF5691.title: "Fresh Toppings"
	quest.539E547765EB8363.quest_desc: [
		"§6The Loom Bench"
		""
		"Expand your textile decoration options with the Loom Bench. Create beautiful fabric designs for your interior spaces."
		""
		"§7Materials you can work with:"
		"§7• Wool blocks in all colors"
		"§7• Carpets and banners"
		"§7• Beds and other textile items"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Use varied wool patterns to create detailed rugs and tapestries for your walls."
	]
	quest.539E547765EB8363.title: "Textile Treasures"
	quest.53A51C9FCBE10CD9.quest_desc: [
		"§7Now that you've mastered the treasures of the Galosphere, you're ready for advanced exploration!"
		""
		"§7With your sterling armor, silver bombs, and glow flares, the deepest caves await your discovery."
		""
		"§7Continue your underground journey to uncover even more mysteries of the world below."
		""
		"§7Your understanding of crystal magic and silver crafting has opened up new possibilities for your adventures."
	]
	quest.53A51C9FCBE10CD9.title: "Master of the Crystal Depths"
	quest.53B3A5430D8A2A8A.quest_desc: [
		"§7The §fSlicer§7 is the heart of automated food processing. It can cut, slice, and dice ingredients using §fCreate's§7 rotational power."
		""
		"§7When powered, it will process any valid §fCutting Board§7 recipes automatically!"
		""
		"§7This machine is essential for mass-producing prepared ingredients for your automated kitchen."
		""
		"§fTIP:§7 Use §ffunnels/hoppers§7 to feed ingredients in and §fbelts§7 to move processed items out."
	]
	quest.53B3A5430D8A2A8A.title: "Automated Slicing and Dicing"
	quest.53BB590289D14A36.quest_desc: ["The &6disenchanter&r has the ability to take enchants off of armour and store the xp it collects as liquid xp that can then be solidified to be consumed to be used again, it will be really helpful to have at a mob farm for armour drops. Standing on a &6disenchanter&r will take levels from the player and turn them into liquid"]
	quest.53BB590289D14A36.quest_subtitle: "Liquid xp?"
	quest.53D1F8DFB89185AF.title: "Obtain a &5Spire Armour Trim&r"
	quest.53EA40114B347A83.quest_desc: [
		"&4Fireproof vats&r required in a 3x3x2 box."
		""
		"Graphite electrodes required. Make sure to pump out the CO2."
		""
		"The electrode holders require a minimum of &25A&r to work, but they have 3X the resistance unlike the electrolyzer. They must be supplied with at least &31.5KV&r each. This can be achieved with 2x max speed &6generators&r, a &6transformer&r with a turn ratio of &e6,&r and &6diodes&r on each electrode holder."
	]
	quest.53EA40114B347A83.quest_subtitle: "For speedy steel."
	quest.53EA40114B347A83.title: "&dArc Furnace"
	quest.541988089F760BD6.quest_subtitle: "A redstone component that toggles its state with every redstone pulse."
	quest.54290566BC89BBC7.quest_subtitle: "Dats conk creet baybeee"
	quest.54326B24BD28FA83.quest_subtitle: "Give your Blaze a guide and turn it into a master chef! Blaze Stove will provide Mechanical Arm support for kitchenwares including: Cooking Pot (Farmer's Delight), Kettle (Farmer's Respite), Copper Pot (Miner's Delight). Blaze Stove can also boost cooking up to 4x for the kitchenware above!"
	quest.5435BF11EB742A73.quest_subtitle: "Blow a Shear Pin"
	quest.5435BF11EB742A73.title: "Snap!"
	quest.543924673E879C51.quest_subtitle: "Decides what is piped in or out of the backpack"
	quest.547BBCA834B28B58.quest_desc: [
		"§6Maximum Yield Guide"
		""
		"Combining all processing methods for maximum output."
		""
		"§7Optimal Processing Chain:"
		"§7• Fortune III Mining (2.2x raw ore)"
		"§7• Crushing (+ 30% nugget chance)"
		"§7• Advanced Processing (2x ingot yield)"
		""
		"§6Total Maximum Yields per Ore Block:"
		"§7• Basic Smelting: 1 Ingot"
		"§7• With Fortune III: 2.2 Ingots"
		"§7• With Crushing + Washing: ~2.5 Ingots"
		"§7• With Advanced Processing: ~4.4 Ingots"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Always use the advanced processing for bulk ore processing!"
	]
	quest.547BBCA834B28B58.title: "§dMaximum Yields"
	quest.54A4E0568EAA9DF4.quest_subtitle: "You will need 12 blocks surronding a coil in order to maximize its energy generation"
	quest.54A4E0568EAA9DF4.title: "Strange rock?"
	quest.54AB8A5FBF3A28B7.quest_desc: [
		"§6The Alchemy Bench"
		""
		"Transform rare and special materials using the Alchemy Bench to create unique decorative blocks not possible with other workstations."
		""
		"§7Materials you can work with:"
		"§7• Ender-related blocks"
		"§7• Nether materials"
		"§7• Precious minerals and metals"
		"§7• Magical blocks and items"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7These exotic materials can serve as amazing accent pieces in your builds."
	]
	quest.54AB8A5FBF3A28B7.title: "Magical Transformations"
	quest.54B22282A8D8E09F.quest_subtitle: "Links the engine controller to an engine."
	quest.54BD6B8C2F83DE5A.quest_desc: [
		"§7Meteorites contain §fPress Molds§7 and §fCertus Quartz§7, which are essential for getting started with AE2."
		""
		"§7Find and mine at least one meteorite to collect these resources. Use the §fMeteorite Compass§7 to locate these fallen space rocks."
		""
		"§7The compass will point to the nearest meteorite when held in your hand."
	]
	quest.54BD6B8C2F83DE5A.title: "Meteorite Hunter"
	quest.54C243CD0E3D8F80.quest_desc: ["&6Andesite funnels&r are used to pull items out of a chest one at a time, they will drop the items onto a &6belt&r or &6depot&r below it"]
	quest.54C243CD0E3D8F80.quest_subtitle: "Crafted with andesite alloy and dried kelp"
	quest.54C243CD0E3D8F80.title: "Andesite Funnel"
	quest.54D2AA9C9BC4C5CA.quest_desc: [
		"§7Let's set up an automated crop farm using §fCreate§7 and §fSlice n' Dice§7!"
		""
		"§fSetup:§7"
		"§71. Create a farm with §fRich Soil§7 (better yields!)"
		"§72. Install §fSprinklers§7 above connected to a water source"
		"§73. Add §fmechanical harvesters§7 to automatically collect crops"
		"§74. Use §ffunnels/belts§7 to transport harvested crops"
		""
		"§7Focus on §fFarmers Delight§7 crops like §ftomatoes§7, §fcabbage§7, and §frice§7 for maximum culinary potential!"
	]
	quest.54D2AA9C9BC4C5CA.title: "Automated Crop Farming"
	quest.54EFD2A2AC4F58AB.quest_desc: [
		"The goggles allow you to see detailed information about your mechanical systems."
		""
		"§7When wearing them, you can see stress information, rotation speed, and capacity of your networks."
		""
		"§7Essential for debugging complex contraptions!"
	]
	quest.54EFD2A2AC4F58AB.title: "Engineer's Vision"
	quest.5519761745E81CC5.quest_subtitle: "Become the place that items are attracted to"
	quest.552BA6725C7A539C.quest_desc: ["§7Compress gold nuggets into ingots."]
	quest.552BA6725C7A539C.title: "Gold Block -> Gold Ingot"
	quest.5554A1FDA7D3EBD0.quest_desc: [
		"§7Combine §fBlaze Powder§7, §fGold Nuggets§7, and §fLava§7 in a §fSuperheated Mixer§7."
		""
		"§7This high-temperature reaction transforms these materials into valuable Blaze Rods."
		""
		"§7Ensure your automation system can handle the extreme heat of this process."
	]
	quest.5554A1FDA7D3EBD0.title: "Blaze Powder + Gold Nuggets + Lava → Blaze Rod"
	quest.5562F1C4EAEE40B3.quest_subtitle: "Collect a carrot"
	quest.55695CA65A8AA86D.quest_subtitle: "Can be extended to 2 blocks long."
	quest.55B2F46ABCFF9D10.quest_desc: ["§7To create §fPrinted Logic Circuits§7, you'll need to use §fDeployers§7 with the §fInscriber Logic Press§7 on gold ingots."]
	quest.55B2F46ABCFF9D10.title: "Gold Ingot -> Printed Logic Circuit"
	quest.55C383C939A63F69.quest_subtitle: "Automatically moves items into and out of the furnace"
	quest.5611FCC58301372A.quest_subtitle: "Allows you to setup a sequence of rotations that are executed upon the block receiving a redstone signal."
	quest.5628A55BE77177CA.quest_subtitle: "Use star in overworld"
	quest.563B74BC50D924A2.title: "Obtain Molten Slag"
	quest.56465CD2EE78CDB3.quest_desc: ["§7To create §fMagma Blocks§7, you'll need to compress §fMagma Cream§7 using a §fMechanical Press§7."]
	quest.56465CD2EE78CDB3.title: "Magma Cream -> Magma Block"
	quest.564F6FF42EFA0D2C.quest_desc: [
		"§7Process §fMoon Cobblestone§7 in a §fFurnace§7 or §fBulk Blasting§7 setup to produce Moon Stone."
		""
		"§7This smelting process refines the rough cobblestone into a smoother, more valuable material."
		""
		"§7Design your smelting operation to handle large quantities efficiently."
	]
	quest.564F6FF42EFA0D2C.title: "Moon Cobblestone → Moon Stone"
	quest.568A78ACC4A5B01B.quest_desc: [
		"§7Cast Iron is created by heating and compressing regular §fIron Ingots§7."
		""
		"§7Use a §fMechanical Press§7 with a heat source underneath to transform Iron Ingots into Cast Iron."
		""
		"§7This material is much more durable than regular iron, making it suitable for space-grade applications."
	]
	quest.568A78ACC4A5B01B.title: "Iron Ingot → Cast Iron"
	quest.568CB34CD44AE536.quest_desc: [
		"§7Set up a §fLava Production System§7 using §fDripstone and Cauldrons§7 or an §fIgneous Extruder§7."
		""
		"§7For large-scale automation, consider melting cobblestone in a §fSuperheated Mixer§7."
	]
	quest.568CB34CD44AE536.title: "Lava Production"
	quest.569D382481186F74.quest_subtitle: "Craft the elusive Estrogen Pill."
	quest.569D382481186F74.title: "Pill up gals!"
	quest.56BAE5E3BC4BBA13.quest_desc: [
		"Space stations are a crucial part of your interplanetary infrastructure."
		""
		"Build stations in orbit around different planets to provide safe havens, refueling points, and research facilities."
		""
		"§7Proper space station planning will make your further explorations much more efficient."
	]
	quest.56BAE5E3BC4BBA13.title: "Orbital Outposts"
	quest.56BE267CE6F7C4F9.quest_desc: ["When placing an &6Enchanted golden apple&r onto a &6disenchanter&r it will remove the enchanted aspect and give you a &eregular golden apple&r back and store the xp as liquid xp, that xp can be tranfered into a tank for later storage"]
	quest.56BE267CE6F7C4F9.quest_subtitle: "Notch Apple"
	quest.56BE267CE6F7C4F9.title: "Disenchanting Enchanted Golden Apples"
	quest.56C4A94A4B23BCBB.quest_desc: ["Golem Overhaul adds 9 new golem types, all with their own unique mechanics! All golem stats can be found under images."]
	quest.56C4CFD931801B18.quest_desc: [
		"§7Train stations are required for boarding, loading/unloading, and scheduling trains."
		""
		"§7To set up a basic station:"
		"§71. Place the train station block at the end of a section of track"
		"§72. Right-click the station to access its interface"
		"§73. Name your station something descriptive"
		""
		"§7Tip: Stations are perfect for creating loading/unloading areas for resources!"
	]
	quest.56C4CFD931801B18.title: "Next Stop: Automation"
	quest.56E16ECAA3E2107D.title: "Use an Belt Grinder to process materials"
	quest.56F0C1A2AA92A80B.quest_desc: [
		"§7Ethanol is a critical component for Biodiesel production."
		""
		"§7It can be created by fermenting various crops and sugars in the Fermenter."
		""
		"§7Set up an efficient crop farm to maintain a steady ethanol supply."
	]
	quest.56F0C1A2AA92A80B.title: "Ethanol Production"
	quest.56FD7B7332D5B294.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Belt Grinder"
	quest.56FD7B7332D5B294.title: "What a Cheese Grater!"
	quest.5713427D96B1CFC2.quest_desc: [
		"Requires air to be fed in from an air intake."
		""
		"Make sure to pipe out the CO2."
	]
	quest.5713427D96B1CFC2.quest_subtitle: "Will run on Furnace Gas, Kerosene, Naptha, and Diesel."
	quest.5715B2F5CC67960D.quest_desc: [
		"§7Compress §fCopper Nuggets§7 in a §fMechanical Press§7 to form Copper Ingots."
		""
		"§7This consolidation process transforms the small nuggets into useful, full-sized ingots."
		""
		"§7Set up an automated sequence to batch process nuggets efficiently."
	]
	quest.5715B2F5CC67960D.title: "Copper Nugget → Copper Ingot"
	quest.5720A87944651114.quest_subtitle: "The labels glow in the dark"
	quest.576533FF249013B1.quest_desc: [
		"These jungle-lurking plant monsters want nothing more than to eat anything that moves! They may seem like ordinary ferns, but they'll emerge if you come close. You can't get close enough to strike them, so find some other way of killing them! They drop foliaath seeds."
		"To grow a foliaath, obtain a seed and plant it by right clicking on grass or dirt. Every half-day for two days, feed the baby foliaath by tossing it a meat item. Then, it will emerge as a fully grown foliaath. Be careful: grown foliaaths aren't tamed and will still attack you!"
	]
	quest.57795893C03D7A10.quest_desc: [
		"Raw patties need to be cooked! Let's set up an automated cooking station."
		""
		"§6Components needed:§r"
		"• Stoves (heat source)"
		"• Mechanical arms or deployers"
		"• Belts to move patties through the system"
		""
		"§6Setup:§r"
		"• Place stoves under a belt system"
		"• Have mechanical arms place patties on the stoves"
		"• Another arm picks up cooked patties and places them on the output belt"
	]
	quest.57795893C03D7A10.title: "Patty Grill Station"
	quest.578996586F76CDEE.quest_desc: [
		"§6Netherite Backpack"
		""
		"Ultimate mobile storage!"
		""
		"§7Storage:"
		"§7• Base: 135 slots"
		"§7• 5 upgrade slots"
		"§7• Netherite trim"
		""
		"§6Features:"
		"§7• Maximum capacity"
		"§7• Fire resistant"
		"§7• All upgrade options"
		"§7• Indestructible"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Safe for nether exploration!"
	]
	quest.578996586F76CDEE.title: "§dNetherite Backpack"
	quest.57A56DF0CAD93B0E.quest_desc: [
		"Time to find some §bsuspicious blocks§r! These can be found in:"
		""
		"- Desert Pyramids"
		"- Ancient Cities"
		"- Ocean Ruins"
		"- Trail Ruins"
		"- And more hidden locations!"
		""
		"Use your brush on suspicious blocks to carefully excavate artifacts."
	]
	quest.57A56DF0CAD93B0E.title: "Digging Up The Past"
	quest.57ACBCC7BBE8304C.quest_desc: [
		"The Create Railways Navigator is a powerful tool for managing complex rail networks."
		""
		"§7To access the Railways Navigator:"
		"§71. Press 'O' (default key) to open the interface"
		"§72. Use the map view to see your entire rail network"
		"§73. View train positions and status in real-time"
		""
		"§7This interface is essential for managing multiple trains efficiently!"
	]
	quest.57ACBCC7BBE8304C.title: "Railways Navigator Interface"
	quest.57BACA91541F39D0.quest_subtitle: "Gives a redstone signal based on how full the drawer is"
	quest.57FCBFBA8789F893.quest_subtitle: "Works underwater!"
	quest.58622C7D53FEA01C.quest_desc: [
		"Brass switches allow for changing track directions from a distance."
		""
		"§7To use brass switches effectively:"
		"§71. Place them at track junctions"
		"§72. Connect to redstone signals if desired"
		"§73. They can be activated by approaching trains"
		""
		"§7Tip: These are essential for automated rail networks with multiple paths. Try combining them with observers for automated routing!"
	]
	quest.58622C7D53FEA01C.title: "Smart Junction Control"
	quest.58681EC1AFD55115.quest_subtitle: "Use a crafting table without placing one down"
	quest.586EAE6E8065351A.quest_desc: [
		"To be able to decide &ewhat other players can interact&r with within your claim there are some options you can change to match your preferance"
		""
		"- Open &6the claim menu&r"
		""
		"- Click &6player config menu&r"
		""
		"- Click &6my player config&r"
		""
		"- The options are on pages 7-9 of all the different parts that you can choose what people are able to interact with in chunks that you have claimed"
	]
	quest.586EAE6E8065351A.quest_subtitle: "What people can interact with"
	quest.58746CD4481F19C7.quest_desc: ["Potion Blender A simple but powerful utility allowing you to combine multiple potions into one. Tired of chugging three different potions before a fight? Blend them into a single concoction that carries all effects at once. For example, you could merge swiftness, strength, and regeneration into one “battle brew.” The mod balances this by shortening the duration for each effect when combined, but the convenience is often worth it. Potion Blender encourages creative use of brewing – make specialized cocktails for different situations (a mining elixir, a nether exploration tonic, etc.). It synergizes with Create mod’s automatic brewers or deployers, which could mass-produce these custom potions for you."]
	quest.58B813E082CC1FC5.quest_desc: [
		"You are suppoed to get the eye from buying it from a master cleric but I can't get it to work so try"
		"{ \"text\": \"this quest\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"17D9E65A7C586747\" } }"
	]
	quest.58BA699805459F6F.title: "Obtain Cement"
	quest.58D007AD390CBCBB.quest_subtitle: "When Used, Redeems Experience points contained within."
	quest.58D07759E8539B1E.quest_desc: ["The &6gold backpack&r is the upgrade of the &eiron backpack&r. It has 81 storage slots and can hold 3 upgrades"]
	quest.58D07759E8539B1E.quest_subtitle: "Even bigger storage on the go"
	quest.58F76F5ECB96A7F9.quest_desc: [
		"§fBlockus §7expands your building palette with hundreds of new blocks."
		""
		"§7Create beautiful patterns with new types of wood, stone, and decorative blocks."
		""
		"§7Perfect for adding detail and texture to your builds."
	]
	quest.58F76F5ECB96A7F9.title: "Building Expanded"
	quest.592E1F5B76A1B354.quest_desc: [
		"§7Create a central control system for your entire base!"
		""
		"§7Basic steps:"
		"§7- Set up a §fnetwork§7 with wireless modems"
		"§7- Connect computers to various machines and farms"
		"§7- Create a §fprotocol§7 for sending commands"
		"§7- Build a control dashboard on monitors"
		""
		"§7Advanced features:"
		"§7- §fPower management§7 that activates machines only when needed"
		"§7- §fInventory awareness§7 that processes items efficiently"
		"§7- §fSecure access§7 with password protection"
		"§7- §fRemote control§7 via pocket computers"
	]
	quest.592E1F5B76A1B354.title: "Command Center"
	quest.594DF31D7CC8DFAB.quest_desc: ["If you have Crafts and Additions just use the blaze burners with the straw, they're op."]
	quest.594DF31D7CC8DFAB.quest_subtitle: "Acts like a blaze burner but with fuel and CO2."
	quest.595816F923175174.quest_subtitle: "Destroys excess items that are filtered"
	quest.599493C00661FBCB.quest_desc: [
		"§7To create §fRedstone Torches§7, you'll need to combine:"
		""
		"§7- §fCopper Sheets§7"
		"§7- §fRedstone Dust§7"
		""
		"§7These torches are essential for powering your AE2 network and other redstone-based systems."
		""
		"§7Set up an automated assembly line to combine these components efficiently."
	]
	quest.599493C00661FBCB.title: "Stick + Redstone Dust -> Redstone Torch"
	quest.59AEBA331EE4F644.quest_desc: ["The &6steam engine&r is a way to produce stress units using heat and water. When placing a &6steam engine&r on the side of a &efluid tank&r that's full of water and has a heat source below it it will start to create rotational force. The higher the heat source the faster the &6steam engine&r will move. The best source for the highest output is &eblaze burners&r being fed blaze cakes to super heat the water tank. At the highest level you can add 8 &6steam engines&r to the tank."]
	quest.59AEBA331EE4F644.quest_subtitle: "A different stress unit source"
	quest.59B3C74916F146D2.quest_desc: [
		"Your journey doesn't end with the inner planets and Proxima Centauri system!"
		""
		"With the Ad Extendra mod, your space exploration continues to the outer planets of our solar system and beyond."
		""
		"Check out the 'Beyond the Stars' chapter in the Main Questline to continue your cosmic adventure to Jupiter, Saturn, and the distant dwarf planets!"
	]
	quest.59B3C74916F146D2.title: "More Planets Await!"
	quest.59CA271F0FCAAE5D.quest_desc: [
		"Create mechanical contraptions can be synchronized with music for amazing displays!"
		""
		"§7Build a contraption that moves in time with your music box melodies."
		""
		"§7Use sequenced gearshifts, clutches, and other components to create rhythm-based machines."
	]
	quest.59CA271F0FCAAE5D.title: "Musical Machines"
	quest.59F6A314AEC07A7D.quest_desc: [
		"Long ago, the Earthrend Monks led the world in the study of earth magic. They used their powerful geomancy to shape mountains and cliffs into monasteries - bastions of education in prayer and self-defense. But those days have passed. The monasteries stand today abandoned and dilapidated. Elemental monsters called Bluffs flood the halls, drawn to the magic left behind."
		""
		"Only one monk remains: Tongbi, the Sculptor. A master of geomancy, Tongbi waits in the monastery’s courtyard, challenging visitors to a parkour test. Never before has a disciple reached the top of this arduous climb, but the one who does will be worthy of the power of the Earthrend Monks. The Sculptor will grant them a powerful artifact called the Earthrend Gauntlet, which gives its wielder control over earth magic."
	]
	quest.5A07D5F76A89C1DC.title: "Use an Lathe to process materials"
	quest.5A127E86B5514E15.quest_desc: [
		"§6Washing"
		""
		"Washing crushed ores provides additional nuggets and sometimes rare materials."
		""
		"§7Required Create Components:"
		"§7• Encased Fan"
		"§7• Water Source"
		""
		"§6Yields per Crushed Ore:"
		"§7• 1 Crushed Ore → 9 Nuggets"
		"§7• Chance for bonus drops"
		"§7• Experience orbs from processing"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Set up washing stations in a line for efficient processing!"
	]
	quest.5A127E86B5514E15.title: "§eWashing Operations"
	quest.5A30AD82DF3F0C8E.quest_desc: [
