		"§7• Enhanced vanilla structures with new designs"
		"§7• More detailed and immersive buildings"
		"§7• Challenging dungeons with better loot"
		"§7• A more exciting world to explore"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Use the biome compass to try to find them!"
	]
