		"§71. Create Display Boards for dynamic information"
		"§72. Station names and platform numbers"
		"§73. Direction indicators and wayfinding"
		"§74. Warning signs for track junctions"
		"§75. Destination boards at platforms"
		""
		"§7Create Display Boards can be connected to redstone to show different messages based on train status, schedules, or other conditions!"
	]
