		"§7Defeat the pillagers and check the chests at the top of the outpost."
		"§7Be careful of the Pillager Captain - he drops a Bad Omen effect when killed."
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Use a shield to block Pillager arrow attacks. You can also do the quest "
