	quest.68B84C4E24FE31A7.quest_desc: [
		"§7The §fSilent's Delight§7 mod adds unique ingredients and recipes for a quiet, peaceful meal!"
		""
		"§7These subtle yet satisfying dishes are perfect for automated kitchen systems."
		""
		"§fSetup:§7"
		"§71. Farm specialized ingredients with §fsprinklers§7 and §fharvesters§7"
		"§72. Use §fslicers§7 to prepare silent ingredients with precision"
		"§73. Craft silent meals using a combination of §fbasins§7 and §fcooking pots§7"
		"§74. Store these calm treats in §fcabinets§7 for when you need tranquility"
		""
		"§fTIP:§7 Silent meals can provide special movement effects without making noise - perfect for stealth!"
	]
	quest.68B84C4E24FE31A7.title: "Silent Cuisine Automation"
	quest.68CC0DF64AD608C1.quest_subtitle: "Generates twice as much SU as the regular water wheel but at a slower RPM. Just know that this thing is bigger and bulkier so have a lot of space for it."
	quest.68DAF6E0803E1B15.quest_desc: [
		"You've explored the first set of biomes! There's still much more to discover."
		""
		"Continue your journey to find all the unique biomes the mod has to offer."
	]
	quest.68DAF6E0803E1B15.title: "Novice Explorer"
	quest.6917FD94931ED8CF.quest_desc: ["&3Steel vat&r required."]
	quest.6917FD94931ED8CF.quest_subtitle: "No clay needed, one step."
	quest.6917FD94931ED8CF.title: "A Quicker way to make Concrete"
	quest.692DE8214170C3BC.quest_desc: ["Create: Deep Dark is a Create addon featuring new end-game items based on the Deep Dark biome, making venturing into Warden territory more fun and rewarding."]
	quest.692DE8214170C3BC.title: "Create: Deep Dark"
	quest.6933CF9259784296.title: "Use an Vibrating Table to process materials"
	quest.6938D99EEF8F4434.quest_desc: [
		"Umvuthi is the creator of the Abavuthana, residing in a stationary seat upon a throne in savanna groves. He draws his power from the sun, calling forth sunstrikes, solar flares, and massive solar beams. He can also create Umvuthana followers - including healers called Umvuthana Cranes - from masks to defend him during combat. As such, his masked children revere him as a god. Unequipped travelers should keep their distance from his grove, lest they be smitten by his heliomancy."
		""
		"Those strong enough to face and defeat him, however, are rewarded with his mask: the Sol Visage. This mask allows its wearers to breathe life into masks to create Umvuthana followers. Unfortunately, the mask does not bestow heliomancy upon its bearer; this power is innately carried by Umvuthi, and thus dies with him. Perhaps there is another way...?"
	]
	quest.694D568E65C188C2.quest_subtitle: "Take some blaze cakes, its going to heat up!"
	quest.694D568E65C188C2.title: "Metallury Expert"
	quest.695A48FD1A51C09E.title: "Kill the &6Warden&r"
	quest.6974F4C8971081E6.title: "Catch a Herring"
	quest.6994C0B11B44A0F6.quest_desc: [
		"§7Create an automated §fSugar Cane Farm§7 for a renewable source of this versatile plant."
		""
		"§7Sugar Cane is essential for producing sugar and other refined products."
		""
		"§7Design your farm with timed harvesters to maintain optimal growth rates."
	]
	quest.6994C0B11B44A0F6.title: "Sugar Cane"
	quest.69AEFF5AD5C3F88F.quest_desc: [
		"Every burger needs the perfect patty - and that starts with quality beef."
		""
		"You'll need to set up a cow farm to ensure a steady supply of raw beef for your burgers."
		""
		"§6Tips:§r"
		"• Use fences and gates to create a proper enclosure"
		"• Keep wheat on hand for breeding"
		"• Consider automating with mob farms later"
		""
		"§7(Vegetarian alternatives will be available later in the quest chain!)§r"
	]
	quest.69AEFF5AD5C3F88F.title: "The Perfect Patty"
	quest.6A0A0001B3574AE8.quest_subtitle: "Get some liquid experience for your enchanting experiment!"
	quest.6A0A0001B3574AE8.title: "Experimental"
	quest.6A1436CB9DCCF6AA.quest_desc: ["§7 §fCrush §7tuff blocks in a §fCrusher §7or §fMillstone"]
	quest.6A1436CB9DCCF6AA.title: "Tuff -> Copper Nuggets"
	quest.6A20E91E6A709E5C.quest_desc: [
		"§7Process §fCobblestone§7 with §fCrushing Wheels§7 to break it down into Gravel."
		""
		"§7This crushing process is the first step in refining stone into more useful materials."
		""
		"§7Set up a reliable cobblestone supply to keep this process running continuously."
	]
	quest.6A20E91E6A709E5C.title: "Cobblestone → Gravel"
	quest.6A30FD9473C665FC.quest_desc: [
		"§7Monitors allow you to display information from your computers."
		""
		"§7Build a multi-block display by placing monitors next to each other and use the §fmonitor§7 API to control it."
		""
		"§7Perfect for displaying stats from your storage system or showing the status of automated processes."
	]
	quest.6A30FD9473C665FC.title: "Information Display"
	quest.6A4B3AF573557CAC.quest_desc: [
		"§6Level Emitter"
		""
		"Measure your storage contents!"
		""
		"§7Function:"
		"§7• Monitors item quantities in your network"
		"§7• Emits redstone signal based on levels"
		"§7• Configurable thresholds"
		""
		"§6Applications:"
		"§7• Automate crafting when supplies are low"
		"§7• Prevent overflow of common items"
		"§7• Create indicator panels for resource levels"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Set up crafting automation that activates when resources drop below certain levels!"
	]
	quest.6A4B3AF573557CAC.title: "§eStorage Monitoring"
	quest.6A4CB4700F0082C6.quest_desc: [
		"The tutorial is now &afinished&r! "
		""
		"To view the rest of the quests, put your cursor to the left of the screen and expand the &6Quest Groups&r. "
		""
		"Feel free to join our &bDiscord &rfor any other questions you may have: https://lunapixel.studio/discord"
	]
	quest.6A4CB4700F0082C6.quest_subtitle: "Read my description!"
	quest.6A52090D6BC064D7.quest_desc: [
		"This tutorial will guide you through some basic features. Don't worry, it won't take &otoo &rlong!"
		""
		"To start, click the checkmark under the word \"&9Tasks&r\" and then claim the &6Quest Reward&r. New quests will start to appear!"
		""
		"If new quests do not start appearing, try rejoining your world. Do not eat the bread until the tutorial is finished."
	]
	quest.6A52090D6BC064D7.quest_subtitle: "To start the tutorial, click on this quest and read the description."
	quest.6A52090D6BC064D7.title: "&eWelcome to All of Create!"
	quest.6A539510EEB5F29E.quest_subtitle: "Right click Hardened Planks with a Steel Ingot."
	quest.6A8BE37C33E3BB07.quest_desc: [
		"§6ME Controller"
		""
		"The heart of your network!"
		""
		"§7Features:"
		"§7• 32 channels per face"
		"§7• Smart channel routing"
		"§7• Network power hub"
		""
		"§6Design Tips:"
		"§7• Central location"
		"§7• Room for expansion"
		"§7• Power accessibility"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Plan your controller layout!"
	]
	quest.6A8BE37C33E3BB07.title: "§eNetwork Controller"
	quest.6AAC04F1D0ECC1D5.quest_subtitle: "Okay, so this is really complicated to explain, but to narrow it down, this controller is it will take inputs from your gamepad using the layout provided by GLFW. If you don't have a GamePad controller, have fun rebinding your keybinds."
	quest.6AAC04F1D0ECC1D5.title: "GamePad for MC"
	quest.6AC9C5DEEBA7C0AC.quest_desc: [
		"§7The §fCCC Bridge§7 mod allows your computers to interface with §fCreate§7 contraptions."
		""
		"§7Source blocks emit redstone signals based on computer commands, while target blocks can be read by computers."
		""
		"§7Scroller blocks let your programs control rotational speed and direction of Create components."
		""
		"§7With these tools, you can create sophisticated, computer-controlled machinery!"
	]
	quest.6AC9C5DEEBA7C0AC.title: "Computer-Controlled Contraptions"
	quest.6AFD022E4050ECB5.quest_subtitle: "Lets you display real-time information to a connected display board or nixie tube. Don't share personal info."
	quest.6AFF0DACB9239075.quest_subtitle: "Can be extended too."
	quest.6B093C1DD6F02BCE.quest_desc: ["The &6upgrade base&r is the main thing needed for each upgrade that you can use within the mod, it is used to craft every single upgrade"]
	quest.6B093C1DD6F02BCE.quest_subtitle: "The key to maximising the backpack"
	quest.6B0C7D194795A503.quest_desc: [
		"§7The §fVegan Delight§7 add-on provides plant-based alternatives to popular meat dishes."
		""
		"§7Setting up automation for §ftofu§7 production and §fplant-based steaks§7 is both ethical and efficient!"
		""
		"§fSetup:§7"
		"§71. Automate §fsoybean§7 farming with §fsprinklers§7"
		"§72. Process soybeans into tofu using §fmixers§7 and basins"
		"§73. Cook the tofu in §fcooking pots§7 for various vegan meals"
		""
		"§fTIP:§7 Vegan dishes can be more efficient to automate since they don't require mob farms!"
	]
	quest.6B0C7D194795A503.title: "Plant-Based Production"
	quest.6B2F2E87A99BA506.quest_desc: [
		"§7The moon is rich in valuable resources that cannot be found on Earth."
		""
		"§7Mine §fMoon Iron Ore§7 to craft advanced Ad Astra equipment and vehicles."
		""
		"§7This resource is essential for space progression and building a sustainable lunar base."
	]
	quest.6B2F2E87A99BA506.title: "Lunar Mining: Iron Ore"
	quest.6B3FCFFD367945DB.quest_subtitle: "Adds a bar on the drawer to show how full it is"
	quest.6B5D00440E177092.quest_subtitle: "Copy your written book, enchanted book, name tag and train schedule."
	quest.6B6985249AD92B24.quest_desc: ["Nature’s Compass A handy utility allowing you to craft a compass that, when activated, lets you select any biome and points the way to the nearest instance of it. In this modpack’s world of hundreds of biomes (thanks to Terralith, Incendium, etc.), Nature’s Compass is invaluable for navigation. Want to find a specific Incendium Nether biome or a rare Terralith grove? Simply calibrate the compass and follow its needle. This saves time and makes exploration goals more achievable, so you can locate the environments needed for particular resources or End Remastered’s special eyes."]
	quest.6B6985249AD92B24.quest_subtitle: "Locate biomes"
	quest.6B894F0707B3E19A.quest_subtitle: "The key to show or hide labels"
	quest.6BBEB5CA4ED9AAFF.quest_desc: [
		"Enchantments Encore Massively broadens the enchanting table’s offerings with a vast array of new enchantments (over 140!) for weapons, tools, and armor. It touches every aspect of gameplay: you might find boots that get Hop enchantment for higher jumps, swords with Firestorm to ignite wide areas, or shields with Barrier creating protective auras. Enchantments Encore ensures that as you progress, you can continually upgrade your gear in interesting ways. It’s fully compatible with all other mods’ items, meaning even Create gadgets or Better Weaponry arms can receive these magical enhancements."
		""
		"NeoEnchant+ Complements Enchantments Encore by adding its own suite of powerful enchantments and sometimes tweaking the enchanting mechanics to be more rewarding. NeoEnchant+ might introduce special high-level enchantments or allow combinations previously not possible. Together these enchantment mods turn the enchanting table and anvil into crucial tools for maxing out your loadout – you’ll want to seek out rare books in dungeon chests and set up XP farms to fully deck yourself in enchanted gear."
	]
	quest.6BF29A4BD4A18015.quest_desc: ["§7To convert §fMagma Blocks§7 into §fObsidian§7, you'll need to use the §fSplashing§7 mechanic."]
	quest.6BF29A4BD4A18015.title: "Magma Block -> Obsidian"
	quest.6C140C77281A4DD0.quest_desc: [
		"&6Slag&r is used primarily to make &econcrete&r and &easphalt&r production more efficient. "
		""
		"Or are asphalt and concrete crafting just ways to get rid of it...?"
	]
	quest.6C140C77281A4DD0.quest_subtitle: "It is useful!"
	quest.6C26214738805896.quest_subtitle: "Essential for any person working with Create. Allows you to see more information about blocks like stress impact."
	quest.6C37414661BA3357.quest_desc: ["All the copycats you've ever wanted, combined into a single mod!"]
	quest.6C3B842B28B298E4.quest_desc: [
		"The Moon is your first extraterrestrial destination! Here you'll find lunar resources that will be crucial for your journey."
		""
		"Key resources to gather:"
		"- Moon Desh Ore"
		"- Ice (for water and oxygen)"
		"- Moon Stone and Moon Sand"
		""
		"§7Warning: The Moon has no oxygen, extreme temperatures, and low gravity. Always wear your space suit!"
	]
	quest.6C3B842B28B298E4.title: "One Small Step"
	quest.6C3B954CAFC88019.quest_desc: [
		"The Cursed Eye is found in Bastion Remnants."
		""
		"§7Explore the Nether to find these massive piglin structures."
		"§7Check the treasure room for chests containing the Eye."
		"§7Be extremely careful of Piglins, Piglin Brutes, and Magma Cubes."
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7The quest is setup to allow you to kill some piglins to get the eye or you can get lucky in a chest."
	]
	quest.6C66239AB766D886.quest_subtitle: "Prevents mob spawning in a big radius."
	quest.6C9157A690AA5F3C.quest_desc: ["&3Steel vat&r required."]
	quest.6CD6BF0D17D1605E.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Light Bulb"
	quest.6CD6BF0D17D1605E.title: "Edison would be proud!"
	quest.6CE1EDF71DE33EEA.quest_desc: [
		"§7Deep in the ancient cities lurks a horror beyond comprehension. The §fWarden§7 - a blind behemoth that hunts through sound and soul detection."
		""
		"§7Its hulking form houses secrets vital to your space program, but challenging this ancient guardian is no small feat."
		""
		"§7Battle strategies:"
		"§7• Strike from afar - its melee power is unmatched"
		"§7• Fool its senses with §fSnowballs§7 and §fEggs§7"
		"§7• Fortify yourself with §fStrength§7 and §fRegeneration§7 potions"
		"§7• Create elevation advantages with pillars or terrain"
		"§7• Deploy §fIron Golems§7 as sacrificial distractions"
		""
		"§c§lCAUTION: Even the mightiest warriors fall in seconds to its devastating strikes!"
	]
	quest.6CE1EDF71DE33EEA.title: "Dancing with Death"
	quest.6CE47960B6FEF89D.quest_subtitle: "Can be used to place or extract large bodies of liquid."
	quest.6D1519B17D48252F.quest_desc: [
		"§6Ocean Monument Mastery"
		""
		"Ocean Monuments are now even more majestic and challenging to explore."
		""
		"§7Enhanced monument features:"
		"§7• More varied room layouts"
		"§7• Underwater gardens and courtyards"
		"§7• Additional guardian types and challenges"
		"§7• Expanded treasure chambers"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Bring plenty of water breathing potions and night vision - the new monuments are larger and more maze-like than before."
	]
	quest.6D1519B17D48252F.title: "Guardian's Deep"
	quest.6D223FBC4FAD5E21.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Copper backpack&r is an option if you are running low on iron as a mid point between standard and iron."
		""
		"It uses 8 copper to craft with the standard backpack"
		""
		"To upgraed it to iron costs 4 iron instead of the 8 it costs to go from standard to iron"
	]
	quest.6D223FBC4FAD5E21.quest_subtitle: "Optional Quest"
	quest.6D33EAE34E22D26A.quest_desc: [
		"§7Infused with the power of the Warden, this armor set provides unparalleled protection and unique abilities in both The Otherside and the Overworld."
		""
		"§6Set bonuses:"
		"§7• Full set grants Darkness immunity"
		"§7• Reduced detection range from Wardens"
		"§7• Enhanced vision in low light conditions"
		"§7• Increased resistance to sculk-based attacks"
		""
		"§cWarning: §7While powerful, this armor is known to occasionally resonate with nearby sculk, potentially attracting unwanted attention."
	]
	quest.6D33EAE34E22D26A.title: "Warden's Protection"
	quest.6D4E8182F109AA4F.quest_desc: [
		"A Martian base functions similarly to your lunar base but requires more advanced components to withstand the harsh environment."
		""
		"Consider adding:"
		"- Energy storage systems"
		"- Advanced oxygen generation"
		"- Crop growing facilities"
		"- Enhanced radiation protection"
		""
		"§7Tip: The Martian day/night cycle is closer to Earth's, which makes solar power more reliable than on other planets."
	]
	quest.6D4E8182F109AA4F.title: "Martian Outpost"
	quest.6D77D71FD41DB910.quest_desc: [
		"§7The next level of food automation: §fcooking§7!"
		""
		"§7Setup a system using §fCreate§7 components with §fCooking Pots§7 to automate meal production:"
		""
		"§71. Place §fStoves§7 with §fCooking Pots§7 on top"
		"§72. Use §fCreate's Mechanical Arms§7 to insert ingredients"
		"§73. Use §fDeployers§7 to remove finished meals"
		""
		"§fTIP:§7 §fMechanical Arms§7 can extract directly from §fCooking Pots§7 when recipes are complete!"
	]
	quest.6D77D71FD41DB910.title: "Automated Cooking"
	quest.6D7CC9EA47063963.quest_subtitle: "Precious metal no more."
	quest.6D809F4C68F2D8A1.quest_desc: [
		"§7Infernal Mechanisms represent the culmination of your automation efforts."
		""
		"§7These complex devices combine the best of your technological and mystical knowledge."
		""
		"§7With all the required components now automated, you can produce these mechanisms at scale for future projects."
	]
	quest.6D809F4C68F2D8A1.title: "Fully Automated Infernal Mechanism"
	quest.6D8322083F35B581.quest_desc: ["The &6pipe&r and &6mechanical pump&r are used hand in hand to move liquids around, the &6pump&r does need to be given so rotational speed, depending on the way the rotation goes decideds which way by default the &6pump&r wants to move the liquid, the wrench can be used on it to switch the way the liquid is moved by the pump"]
	quest.6D8322083F35B581.quest_subtitle: "Moving liquid in pipes"
	quest.6DF870498893C3DE.quest_desc: ["§7Same as with the gravel recipe, put gravel into a §fCrusher §7or §fMillstone §7to create sand."]
	quest.6DF870498893C3DE.title: "Gravel -> Sand"
	quest.6E1D5FC651715482.quest_desc: ["§7If you have followed the quests correctly, you should already have automated this."]
	quest.6E1DCAFE1A9CE229.quest_desc: ["&6Shafts&r are way to transfer a rotation in a straight line either vertical or horizontal"]
	quest.6E1DCAFE1A9CE229.quest_subtitle: "Crafted with 2 andesite alloy"
	quest.6E1DCAFE1A9CE229.title: "Make a shaft"
	quest.6E2C82E2740AFCD1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain any Graphite Molds"
	quest.6E2C82E2740AFCD1.title: "Graphite Molds"
	quest.6E75B12D8ACF9649.quest_desc: ["Sophisticated Storage is installed. "]
	quest.6E8E5E2BB557AAC2.quest_subtitle: "Mix gasoline and aluminum."
	quest.6EA2FA1FB88D9079.quest_desc: [
		"§7To create §fSlime Balls§7, you'll need to set up a §fMixer§7 with the following ingredients:"
		""
		"§7- §fKelp§7"
		"§7- §fDough§7"
		"§7- §fWater§7"
	]
	quest.6EA2FA1FB88D9079.title: "Kelp + Dough + Water -> Slime Ball"
	quest.6ECF7C8F342DF23A.quest_desc: [
		"§6The Carpenter's Table"
		""
		"Wood is a builder's best friend, and with the Carpenter's Table, you'll have access to countless wood variants for your construction needs."
		""
		"§7Materials you can work with:"
		"§7• All wood types (oak, spruce, birch, etc.)"
		"§7• Planks, logs, and stripped logs"
		"§7• Wooden stairs, slabs, and fences"
		"§7• Doors, trapdoors, and pressure plates"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Mix different wood patterns for interesting floor designs and paneled walls."
	]
	quest.6ECF7C8F342DF23A.title: "Woodworking Wonders"
	quest.6F1E7D3B9A8C2E6D.quest_desc: [
		"The Return Scroll is a specialized warp scroll that always returns you to a specific waystone."
		""
		"Craft it with a normal Warp Scroll and right-click on a waystone to bind it. Great for emergency escapes back to your base!"
	]
	quest.6F1E7D3B9A8C2E6D.title: "Emergency Return Scroll"
	quest.6F2935732ACBEA3D.quest_desc: [
		"§d§lBetter Archeology Guide"
		""
		"Uncover the secrets of the past!"
		""
		"§6Main Features:"
		"§7• Archeology tools and excavation"
		"§7• Ancient artifacts and relics"
		"§7• Hidden structures and ruins"
		"§7• Historical discoveries"
	]
	quest.6F2935732ACBEA3D.title: "§d§lArcheological Exploration Guide"
	quest.6F4B091DDC613408.quest_subtitle: "Blocks that allow contraptions to create farmland or launch entities."
	quest.6F58EABA6631C6DE.quest_desc: [
		"§d§lEnd Remastered Guide"
		""
		"In this world, the traditional path to The End has been changed. You must collect 12 special Eyes to activate the End Portal instead of the vanilla Eyes of Ender."
		""
		"§6Main Features:"
		"§7• 12 unique Eyes scattered across the world"
		"§7• Each Eye has its own unique source"
		"§7• Vanilla Eye of Ender has been disabled"
		"§7• Portal requires all 12 unique Eyes to activate"
		""
		"§cImportant: §7Each Eye can only be obtained from specific locations or structures. Follow this guide to collect them all!"
	]
	quest.6F58EABA6631C6DE.title: "§d§lThe Path to The End"
	quest.6F98083A1EF33FDA.quest_desc: [
		"§6Netherite Tier Storage"
		""
		"Ultimate storage capacity!"
		""
		"§7Features:"
		"§7• Base: 27 slots"
		"§7• Upgrade: +45 slots"
		"§7• Total: 72 slots"
		""
		"§6Additional Benefits:"
		"§7• 5 upgrade slots"
		"§7• Blast proof"
		"§7• Maximum security"
		"§7• Fastest operations"
	]
	quest.6F98083A1EF33FDA.title: "§dNetherite Storage Tier"
	quest.6FCB97D2C8BE5699.quest_desc: [
		"§6Woodland Mansions Reimagined"
		""
		"Woodland Mansions are now even more imposing and mysterious, with completely redesigned interiors."
		""
		"§7Enhanced mansion features:"
		"§7• More logical room layouts"
		"§7• Secret passages and hidden chambers"
		"§7• Improved illager living quarters"
		"§7• Unique ritual rooms and libraries"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Look for hidden staircases behind bookshelves or under carpets - they often lead to secret treasure rooms!"
	]
	quest.6FCB97D2C8BE5699.title: "Mansion of Mysteries"
	quest.6FD46B40F8E9D489.quest_desc: [
		"Moon exploration is easier with a rover! This vehicle allows you to travel the lunar surface more quickly and safely."
		""
		"The Tier 1 Rover can traverse the lunar terrain with ease and has storage for your collected resources."
		""
		"§7Tip: Rovers don't provide oxygen, so you'll still need your space suit!"
	]
	quest.6FD46B40F8E9D489.title: "Lunar Rover"
	quest.6FDAC276AFE8C11C.quest_desc: [
		"To speed up cogwheels you can place a &dlarge cogwheel&r adjacent to a &6small cogwheel&r"
		""
		"Then place a &dlarge cogwheel&r on the face of a &6small cogwheel&r"
		""
		"Then repeat the process as much as you can with the stress units you have available"
	]
	quest.6FDAC276AFE8C11C.quest_subtitle: " "
	quest.6FDD8A97C9F5E461.quest_desc: [
		"The &6drawer controller io&r is kind of like the &eregular drawer controller&r but it needs a &edrawer controller&r within 12 blocks to work."
		""
		"It can be used as a secondary input for your drawer system, it's helpful if you need to have your &eregular drawer controller&r is a place that is not directly accessible to the player"
	]
	quest.6FDD8A97C9F5E461.quest_subtitle: "The wannnabe brain of storage drawers"
	quest.6FE386C83D27FF6F.quest_subtitle: "Make a wooden pickaxe"
	quest.6FE386C83D27FF6F.title: "Start your mining adventures"
	quest.6FF933A5EB730FBA.title: "Upgrade your pickaxe"
	quest.70363C57FBF4C9BD.quest_desc: [
		"§7Fluid tanks are essential for storing large amounts of liquids:"
		""
		"§71. Can be stacked vertically to increase capacity"
		"§72. Right-click with a wrench to connect/disconnect from adjacent tanks"
		"§73. Connect to pipes at any height"
		""
		"§7Tip: Build a large tank array for your sealed mechanism production to ensure you never run out of water!"
	]
	quest.70363C57FBF4C9BD.title: "Storing Fluid"
	quest.70457BBE36DC7C91.quest_desc: ["Once you have the xp stored in a tank, all you need to get the xp orbs to fall back onto the player all you need is a pump and pipe with nothing on the end this will pull the liquid xp down and dispense the orbs for the player to pick up"]
	quest.70457BBE36DC7C91.quest_subtitle: "Getting back the xp"
	quest.70457BBE36DC7C91.title: "Dispensing XP onto the player"
	quest.7088750D467E771E.quest_subtitle: "Allows for fine tuning of rpm, meaning you can modify how fast or slow it can be."
	quest.709551251131BE44.quest_desc: [
		"§7Within the Otherside dimension, mysterious ancient temples lie dormant. These structures contain valuable artifacts and knowledge from a civilization that somehow adapted to the sculk corruption."
		""
		"§6Temple features:"
		"§7• Advanced sculk technology"
		"§7• Unique treasure chests"
		"§7• Reinforced echo shards"
		"§7• Dangerous guardian entities"
		""
		"§6Exploration tips:"
		"§7• Search in flatter regions of the Otherside"
		"§7• Look for distinct sculk-covered temple structures"
		"§7• Be prepared for defensive mechanisms"
		"§7• Bring excavation tools for hidden chambers"
		""
		"§cWarning: §7These temples were built to protect something valuable - expect resistance."
	]
	quest.709551251131BE44.title: "Gateway to Knowledge"
	quest.709AE2AFF5DD47EF.title: "Use an Laser to process materials"
	quest.70A45B51E9374A0D.quest_desc: ["FramedBlocks adds blocks of various shapes that can be made to look like almost any other block in the game."]
	quest.70A45B51E9374A0D.quest_subtitle: "Build with brand new shapes."
	quest.70A45B51E9374A0D.title: "Framed Blocks"
	quest.70CA16E649CB35BC.quest_desc: [
		"§7To begin your diesel production journey, you'll need to locate oil deposits."
		""
		"§7The §fOil Detector§7 is an essential tool for finding these underground reserves."
		""
		"§7Hold it in your hand and right-click to scan the area. "
		""
		"§7Once you've found oil, mark the location and prepare to set up your extraction equipment."
	]
	quest.70CA16E649CB35BC.title: "Locating Oil"
	quest.70FB8E3FB9EB0F19.quest_desc: [
		"A well-designed train platform enhances the aesthetics and functionality of your stations."
		""
		"§7Elements of a great train platform:"
		"§71. Raised platform at the right height for easy boarding"
		"§72. Roof to protect from weather"
		"§73. Seating areas for waiting passengers"
		"§74. Lighting for nighttime operation"
		"§75. Decorative elements like flowers or banners"
		""
		"§7Tip: Use stairs and slabs to create smooth transitions between platform levels!"
	]
	quest.70FB8E3FB9EB0F19.title: "Platform Design"
	quest.710F70535278A0C3.quest_desc: [
		"§7Combine §fCast Iron§7 and §fLuminous Sludge§7 in a §fMixer§7 heated by §fBlaze Burners§7 to create Molten Space Grade Alloy."
		""
		"§7This molten material is extremely hot and needs proper containment systems."
		""
		"§7Use fluid pipes with high heat resistance to transport this material safely."
	]
	quest.710F70535278A0C3.title: "Cast Iron + Luminous Sludge → Molten Space Grade Alloy"
	quest.71151BB59F5C2307.quest_subtitle: "Press &c\"Z\"&r To see How to Use It"
	quest.71151BB59F5C2307.title: "Find Petrol"
	quest.711E036FA5AF3495.quest_desc: [
		"It's originally from rarely while enchanting and I couldn't prove it worked, so now it is:"
		""
		"Over 1000?!"
	]
	quest.711E036FA5AF3495.title: "Cryptic Eye"
	quest.71205ADF676463A1.quest_desc: [
		"§7Set up an §fInfinite Water Source§7 using a 2x2 pool or §fWater Wheel§7."
		""
		"§7Use §fMechanical Pumps§7 to extract and §fFluid Pipes§7 to transport water to your systems."
	]
	quest.71205ADF676463A1.title: "Water Production"
	quest.7154F596E29262CF.quest_desc: [
		"Attach a packager to an item vault, put on a stock link and then use a stock ticker linked for full storage access. Can link up multiple stock links to one stock ticker. The stock ticker must be assigned a mob as an interact point. Can use seats to make them not move via shift right click mob. "
		""
		"Make sure to ponder the items 'w' for nice visual aids. "
	]
	quest.7154F596E29262CF.quest_subtitle: "Unified Storage System"
	quest.7154F596E29262CF.title: "Stock Link"
	quest.71B23E015AD5D829.quest_desc: ["Nullscape An End dimension overhaul that transforms the End into an awe-inspiring yet desolate expanse. Nullscape raises the world height to 384 blocks and creates colossal, layered island formations – expect fractal spires, floating valleys, and crystal-laced peaks. This alien terrain makes the End truly endless and unpredictable. Despite the beauty, it preserves the End’s bleak loneliness; you’ll feel small against Nullscape’s surreal vistas. New biomes and far-flung End cities await those daring enough to bridge the void and explore beyond the vanilla islands."]
	quest.71E695B990B107A7.title: "Already Automated: Redstone Dust"
	quest.71E90D242CF9FEAD.quest_desc: [
		"Let's automate the entire bun-making process!"
		""
		"§6Components needed:§r"
		"• Mechanical mixer with basin"
		"• Water supply system"
		"• Deployers or mechanical arms"
		"• Blast furnace or smoker"
		""
		"§6Process:§r"
		"• Mill wheat into flour automatically"
		"• Mix flour with water in the basin"
		"• Form dough using a deployer"
		"• Bake the dough automatically"
		""
		"This automated bakery will ensure a constant supply of fresh buns!"
	]
	quest.71E90D242CF9FEAD.title: "Automatic Bakery"
	quest.71EDE15818D4C2A1.quest_desc: [
		"A picture is worth a thousand-"
		"bruh just follow the ponder."
		""
		"The blast furnace can be any height you like. Taller furnaces melt steel faster."
	]
	quest.71EDE15818D4C2A1.quest_subtitle: "Gotta blast!"
	quest.71EDE15818D4C2A1.title: "Build a Blast Furnace"
	quest.71FB9546B1E7FF13.quest_desc: [
		"The &6mechanical saw&r lets you chop down a whole tree with only destroying one of the logs using the saw."
		""
		"It can also be used to process different wooden resources, just make sure that the saw is moving in the same direction as the items are flowing"
	]
	quest.71FB9546B1E7FF13.quest_subtitle: "Advanced Lumberjacking"
	quest.71FB9546B1E7FF13.title: "Mechanical Saw"
	quest.721FAF784829D344.quest_subtitle: "Collect a Bucket of Liquid Estrogen."
	quest.721FAF784829D344.title: "The Source of (Girl) Power"
	quest.7266720AB69AB7F0.quest_desc: [
		"§6The Botanist Workbench"
		""
		"The Botanist Workbench allows you to transform plants, leaves, and wooden materials into various decorative forms."
		""
		"§7Materials you can work with:"
		"§7• Leaves and flowers"
		"§7• Saplings and small plants"
		"§7• Vines and grass variants"
		"§7• Mushrooms and fungi"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Use the plant variants to create lush, detailed gardens with varied textures."
	]
	quest.7266720AB69AB7F0.title: "Botanical Designs"
	quest.726B1D91D9DFC698.quest_subtitle: "Gives a redstone signal based on most full slot"
	quest.727997758EFBA0EE.quest_desc: [
		"Congratulations! You've successfully automated the sealed mechanism production!"
		""
		"§7This component will be essential for the more advanced machines and contraptions you'll be building in the future."
		""
		"§7Make sure your automation setup is reliable and can produce these in bulk - you'll need them!"
	]
	quest.727997758EFBA0EE.title: "Fully Automated Sealed Mechanism"
	quest.72C82500D2B75055.quest_desc: [
		"§7Grime Balls can be extracted from §fSculk Grime§7 by washing or splashing it with water."
		""
		"§7Use a Create washing setup with §fEncased Fans§7 to process Sculk Grime into Grime Balls."
		""
		"§7This cleansing process separates the usable grime from other impurities."
	]
	quest.72C82500D2B75055.title: "Sculk Grime → Grime Ball"
	quest.72CFA89AAD7EC0A6.title: "Explore the outer end"
	quest.72F3965D09F3B6F0.quest_subtitle: "Ever wanted to pipe liquids into your blaze burners? Just hand them a straw and they'll slurp it straight from the pipe.\\n\\nYou can press 'U' on the straw to see what liquids it accepts as well as burn times."
	quest.73117FBCBBA359D3.quest_desc: [
		"§7Process §fTuff§7 in §fCrushing Wheels§7 to extract Copper Nuggets."
		""
		"§7This extraction method efficiently separates copper from the dense tuff rock."
		""
		"§7Implement a collection system to gather all nuggets from the crushing process."
	]
	quest.73117FBCBBA359D3.title: "Tuff → Copper Nugget"
	quest.731D568E8CDA5599.quest_desc: [
		"§7Compress §fZinc Nuggets§7 in a §fMechanical Press§7 to form Zinc Ingots."
		""
		"§7This compression process efficiently consolidates the smaller nuggets into standard ingots."
		""
		"§7Incorporate this pressing operation into your broader metal processing line."
	]
	quest.731D568E8CDA5599.title: "Zinc Nugget → Zinc Ingot"
	quest.736CD47D4389D059.quest_desc: [
		"§7With the Heart of the Deep in hand, you can now activate the dormant portal to The Otherside - a dimension corrupt with sculk, where the very terrain seems alive and hostile."
		""
		"§6To activate the portal:"
		"§7• Find an Ancient City"
		"§7• Look for a sculk-covered portal frame within the city"
		"§7• Right-click on the frame with the Heart of the Deep"
		"§7• Watch as reality tears open before you"
		""
		"§6The Otherside characteristics:"
		"§7• Perpetual twilight"
		"§7• Sculk-infested terrain"
		"§7• Unique hostile mobs"
		"§7• Valuable and rare resources"
		""
		"§cWarning: §7The Otherside is extremely dangerous. Prepare thoroughly before entering."
	]
	quest.736CD47D4389D059.title: "Through the Veil"
	quest.73A2838E56534342.quest_subtitle: "Allows contraptions to transfer fluids to blocks."
	quest.73AB418C030C2797.quest_desc: ["The Infernal Dragon can be found in a custom-designed dungeon deep within the mountains. It unleashes devastating fire attacks and aerial strikes. Beware of its infernal phase when low on health!"]
	quest.73C13D12A9DE6733.quest_desc: [
		"§6The Glassblower's Bench"
		""
		"Create beautiful glass variants with the Glassblower's Bench. From clear panels to stained designs, enhance your windows and glass structures."
		""
		"§7Materials you can work with:"
		"§7• Glass blocks and panes"
		"§7• Stained glass in all colors"
		"§7• Glass bottles and other glass items"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Combine different glass patterns for intricate window designs in your builds."
	]
	quest.73C13D12A9DE6733.title: "Glass Artistry"
	quest.73D8B97B56258F37.quest_desc: [
		"§6Stone Variants"
		""
		"Blockus adds numerous stone-type blocks to enhance your building options!"
		""
		"§7Try crafting some of these stone variants:"
		"§7• Limestone and its variants"
		"§7• Marble and its variants"
		"§7• Bluestone"
		"§7• Polished stone"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Mix different stone types for textured walls and floors"
	]
	quest.73D8B97B56258F37.title: "§eStone Varieties"
	quest.73FCF73711802617.quest_desc: [
		"Simple Voice Chat Enables proximity voice chat in multiplayer, so you can talk to friends in-game without external software. It’s crystal clear and distance-based – walk closer to hear players louder, or drift apart and their voice fades. Coordinating during boss fights or when building large Create contraptions becomes much easier and more immersive. It supports group chats and even has an option for voice modulation (like sounding like you’re “on radio”). While it doesn’t affect single-player, for servers this mod greatly enhances teamwork and roleplay potential."
		""
		"Voiceless Survival A challenging twist that integrates with Voice Chat: hostile mobs can hear you if you talk in real life! With Voiceless Survival, you must be quiet when sneaking around enemies – one loud remark or nervous laugh on voice chat could send a horde of zombies your way. This feature ramps up the immersion and tension, especially during nights or deep cave exploration. It encourages real stealth and adds a horror-game vibe: if you must communicate, whisper, or face the consequences. In multiplayer, this leads to fun scenarios of coordinating silently or using signs/chat instead of speech when danger is near."
	]
	quest.73FCF73711802617.quest_subtitle: "Use the Voicechat to communicate with players."
	quest.7412EE58B053F4D4.quest_desc: [
		"CosmeticWeapons is a CosmeticArmours expansion mod focused on adding new, balanced weapons to your Minecraft worlds, all designed to fit the vanilla Minecraft style for a seamless experience!"
		""
		"Show your individuality and style through the weapons you use! Wield knives, battleaxes, clubs and more!"
		"Customise even further using unique Weapon Styles!"
		"Perfect for roleplay and customisation!"
	]
	quest.74272CC185344524.quest_desc: [
		"§7Lava is an excellent long-term fuel source for your blaze burners."
		""
		"§7Using a §fStraw§7, you can feed lava directly to a blaze burner:"
		"§71. Craft a straw"
		"§72. Right-click the blaze burner with the straw"
		"§73. Pipe lava straight into the blaze burner"
		""
		"§7This provides a long-lasting heat source that's perfect for steam engines!"
	]
	quest.74272CC185344524.title: "Lava Fuel"
	quest.742D3ABA089A450E.quest_desc: [
		"§7Mix §fGunpowder§7, §fRedstone Dust§7, and §fGlowstone Dust§7 together in a §fSuperheated Mixer§7."
		""
		"§7The intense heat reaction creates Blaze Powder, an essential component for several advanced processes."
		""
		"§7Carefully integrate this into your automation line for maximum efficiency."
	]
	quest.742D3ABA089A450E.title: "Gunpowder + Redstone + Glowstone Dust → Blaze Powder"
	quest.742F8AD423465FCB.quest_desc: [
		"§fSplashing §7soul sand will wash off all of the dirty bits, and leave only nether quartz, and gold nuggets*."
		""
		"§fSplashing §7almost works the same as §fHaunting§7, but instead of soul fire, you use water."
		""
		"§7[*slim chance]"
	]
	quest.742F8AD423465FCB.title: "Soul Sand -> Nether Quartz"
	quest.743E57F5D7920FD7.quest_desc: [
		"The windmill provides powerful rotational force when it has open space around it."
		""
		"§7Tip: The more sail blocks you add to the windmill, the more power it generates!"
		""
		"§7Make sure to place it in an open area for maximum effectiveness."
	]
	quest.743E57F5D7920FD7.title: "Wind Power"
	quest.7452A3A5599B09AB.quest_subtitle: "A block that allows input and output of inventories 1 item at a time.\\n\\nOne thing not mentioned by the ponder is that the funnel can drop items on the ground when placed on an inventory and will only keep 1 item on the ground if it's close enough to the block the item lands on."
	quest.7479D9BF739021B8.quest_desc: [
		"§7Water is a crucial component for sealed mechanisms and many other Create contraptions."
		""
		"§7You have several options for water automation:"
		"§71. Use §fMechanical Pumps §7in a water source"
		"§72. Use §fHose Pulleys §7to draw from large water bodies"
		""
		"§7Tip: Set up a network of §fFluid Pipes §7to distribute water to different parts of your factory!"
	]
	quest.7479D9BF739021B8.title: "Water Automation"
	quest.74869FC09527B303.title: "Flat Lamps"
	quest.748C345C3E28BADB.quest_subtitle: "Put one on recieving end and input then connect with a wire"
	quest.748C345C3E28BADB.title: "Energy transporting"
	quest.74A26739DD0D21EE.quest_desc: [
		"§7Copper ingots are needed for creating copper sheets."
		""
		"§7Place 9 copper nuggets into a §fBasin§7, then compact it with a §fMechanical Press§7"
		""
		"§7Tip: An automated crafting system for nugget-to-ingot conversion will save you a lot of time!"
	]
	quest.74A26739DD0D21EE.title: "Copper Nuggets -> Copper Ingots"
	quest.74ADDF7066B30B3F.quest_subtitle: "Allows for multiple paralell rotational outputs."
	quest.74DA690631920E06.quest_desc: ["Cooked and crafted like normal bricks."]
	quest.74DA690631920E06.quest_subtitle: "Bricked up on a %DAY OF WEEK% night."
	quest.7528CA66674FAD1A.quest_desc: ["Made in any vat type, no mixing required."]
	quest.75619B23BB13A8D7.quest_desc: ["The &6deployer&r is the start of automation as it is used in many different multi step crafts like &6precision mechanisms&r and many others"]
	quest.75619B23BB13A8D7.quest_subtitle: "Start of automation"
	quest.7569BB5427BCA43F.quest_desc: [
		"Connecting &bsails&r to a plank or any block ontop of the &9windmill bearing&r will generate more stress"
		""
		"You can place them in any shape you like"
	]
	quest.7569BB5427BCA43F.quest_subtitle: "More sails = quicker windmill = more stress created"
	quest.756ABA56B7F07D82.quest_desc: [
		"As you collect resources from multiple planets, you'll need efficient ways to process and store them."
		""
		"Create a multi-planetary resource management system using Create mechanisms and automation."
		""
		"§7Tip: Consider setting up dedicated processing facilities for each planetary material, with a central storage hub for finished products."
	]
	quest.756ABA56B7F07D82.title: "Interplanetary Resource Management"
	quest.756FE34BBC2FB534.quest_subtitle: "Collect an apple"
	quest.757B12A4C7F7D355.quest_subtitle: "A more advanced funnel that allows for filtering and higher stack sizes."
	quest.7598DD2F2254AB4D.quest_desc: [
		"§6Inventory Cable Connector"
		""
		"Extend your storage network!"
		""
		"§7Function:"
		"§7• Creates a connection point along inventory cables"
		"§7• Allows branches in your network"
		"§7• Can connect terminals and other components"
		""
		"§6Variations:"
		"§7• Standard Connector - Basic connection point"
		"§7• Filtered Connector - Only passes certain items"
		"§7• Framed Connector - Can be decorated"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Use these to create neat, organized storage rooms!"
	]
	quest.7598DD2F2254AB4D.title: "§eNetwork Branching"
	quest.7598DDA7144F31C5.quest_subtitle: "Pick n' place."
	quest.75A28517E08FE190.quest_subtitle: "Place down a Brass Gearbox"
	quest.75A28517E08FE190.title: "Serious Organization"
	quest.75B31991F2FD27AB.quest_desc: ["Lootr Overhauls loot chests to be instance-based and resettable. With Lootr, every player gets their own loot from dungeon chests, so playing co-op doesn’t halve your rewards – each person can open the same chest and find their own prize. Additionally, chests marked by Lootr will refresh loot periodically, similar to Respawning Structures’ concept. This mod ensures everyone gets a fair shot at treasure and encourages revisiting cleared structures later for new loot rolls. It’s especially useful in a modpack with so many unique items – there are more chances to obtain those Artifacts, Relics, or enchantment books when loot can respawn and isn’t one-and-done per world."]
	quest.75B31991F2FD27AB.title: "Lootr"
	quest.75BA8D3D6C0B9D1C.quest_subtitle: "Basket (Farmer's Delight) can now directly interact with Belt and Mechanical Arm."
	quest.75BA8D3D6C0B9D1C.title: "Smarter Basket"
	quest.75CD1CA790060DC4.quest_subtitle: "Are we nuclear yet?"
	quest.76360D36722AEEBA.quest_desc: [
		"§7Tuff can be created by combining deep materials:"
		""
		"§71. Place deepslate in a §fBasin"
		"§72. Use a §fMixer §7to process it into tuff"
		""
		"§7This synthetic tuff is identical to naturally occurring tuff and can be processed further for copper nuggets."
	]
	quest.76360D36722AEEBA.title: "Deepslate -> Tuff"
	quest.763EC1241C4E9EFA.quest_subtitle: "Can decide which slot on hotbar is refilled and can pick block items in the backpack"
	quest.7687403FB93F51B3.quest_desc: [
		"§7Your technological advancements have prepared you for the next frontier: space exploration."
		""
		"§7Build a §fRocket§7 and travel to the Moon to access unique lunar resources."
		""
		"§7The lunar environment offers materials that can't be synthesized on Earth, which will be crucial for your advanced automation systems."
		""
		"§7Don't forget to bring oxygen supplies and wear a space suit for your journey!"
	]
	quest.768F721251C3B072.title: "Obtain a &2Vex Armour Trim&r"
	quest.76A8F4011F8809B5.quest_desc: [
		"§7Silver bombs are powerful explosive devices crafted from silver ingots."
		""
		"§7Unlike regular TNT, these bombs can be thrown and explode on impact."
		""
		"§7Perfect for mining expeditions or dealing with groups of hostile mobs!"
		""
		"§7These bombs have a moderate blast radius, making them safer than TNT for controlled demolition."
	]
	quest.76A8F4011F8809B5.title: "Explosive Innovation"
	quest.76AEE2802CA23591.quest_desc: [
		"§6Wooden Furniture Blocks"
		""
		"Create gorgeous wooden furniture and details!"
		""
		"§7Try crafting these blocks:"
		"§7• Wooden seats"
		"§7• Carved wood panels"
		"§7• Wooden barrels and crates"
		"§7• Decorative beams"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Use these to add detail to your interior spaces"
	]
	quest.76AEE2802CA23591.title: "§eWooden Furniture Blocks"
	quest.76B29C61ECDA10FF.quest_desc: [
		"Ancient §bfossils§r can be found while exploring various biomes and structures."
		""
		"Use your §bArcheology Hammer§r to carefully extract fossils from stone and deepslate."
		""
		"Each fossil provides unique benefits when held or placed:"
		""
		"- §bWolf Fossil§r - Scares away skeletons"
		"- §bOcelot Fossil§r - Keeps creepers at bay"
		"- §bChicken Fossil§r - Grants slow falling"
		"- §bGuardian Fossil§r - Provides water breathing"
	]
	quest.76B29C61ECDA10FF.title: "Fossil Collection"
	quest.76B45C5766C61369.quest_desc: ["The &6Goggles&r are really helpful to be able to see how much stress units (SU) machines are using or producing, it's really nice to be able to see why you machines have stopped"]
	quest.76B45C5766C61369.quest_subtitle: "See extra information"
	quest.76BD35864351DC4C.quest_subtitle: "Collect some glow berries"
	quest.76C8F4D63CA81793.quest_desc: [
		"It's time to make your base more than just functional - it should be beautiful too!"
		""
		"§7The §fDawn of Time Builder §7mod and §fBlockus §7give you access to hundreds of new decorative blocks."
		""
		"§7Try different block combinations to create your own unique style."
	]
	quest.76C8F4D63CA81793.title: "Aesthetics Matter"
	quest.76D185BEC0C37EC0.quest_subtitle: "32x base storage capacity"
	quest.774B9FB972ACD1B0.quest_desc: ["Once all parts are added, the engine will ask for as many pistons as necessary to fill out the config you chose."]
	quest.774B9FB972ACD1B0.quest_subtitle: "The engine base will prompt you to right click each of these items onto it."
	quest.774B9FB972ACD1B0.title: "Engine Parts"
	quest.776451A1A5F3B2FB.quest_desc: ["Place the electric gauge on part of a circuit to measure different stats. Exact values can be seen using &6goggles&r and the quantity being measured is changed with the &6wrench.&r"]
	quest.776451A1A5F3B2FB.quest_subtitle: "My careful measurements indicate..."
	quest.776D2582BF00C2AB.quest_desc: ["§7If you have followed the quests correctly, you should already have automated this."]
	quest.776F0CA023690BC6.quest_subtitle: "Can display text or numbers. This would be useful in making elevators too."
	quest.777696F39238142E.quest_desc: [
		"§7Every journey to the stars begins from solid ground. The §fLaunch Pad§7 provides the necessary foundation for your rocket's ascent."
		""
		"§7This reinforced platform is engineered to withstand the extreme heat and pressure of liftoff, while its specialized sensors help calibrate your trajectory toward lunar orbit."
		""
		"§7Build a 3×3 square of launch pads with the center block last, creating a stable platform for your spacecraft. The pad's guidance systems will automatically interface with your rocket when placed correctly."
		""
		"§7Without this critical infrastructure, no rocket can safely leave Earth's surface."
	]
	quest.777696F39238142E.title: "Foundations of Flight"
	quest.77814DAB91725098.title: "Locate a &bMonument&r"
	quest.778996586F76CDF0.quest_desc: [
		"§6Advanced Magnet"
		""
		"Enhanced item collection!"
		""
		"§7Features:"
		"§7• Larger collection radius"
		"§7• Filter compatibility"
		"§7• Toggle options"
		""
		"§6Settings:"
		"§7• Range control"
		"§7• Filter settings"
		"§7• Redstone control"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Perfect for mob farms!"
	]
	quest.778996586F76CDF0.title: "§eMagnet Upgrade"
	quest.7795CDCBAA1C9A1F.quest_desc: [
		"Advanced train interiors make travel more functional and comfortable."
		""
		"§7For a proper passenger car:"
		"§71. Add seating with chairs or benches"
		"§72. Place chests for storage"
		"§73. Add lighting with lanterns"
		"§74. Consider decorative elements like signs and item frames"
		""
		"§7Tip: Different wood types and materials can create unique aesthetics for each car!"
	]
	quest.7795CDCBAA1C9A1F.title: "Interior Design"
	quest.7796359B0F6A6606.quest_desc: ["The basic &6backpack&r has 27 storage slots and can hold 1 upgrade"]
	quest.7796359B0F6A6606.quest_subtitle: "A nice way to store items on the go"
	quest.77DDF57E9E43C076.title: "Use an Spring Coiling Machine to obtain a spring"
	quest.77DE3A3D3230ABD3.quest_desc: [
		"§6Stack Upgrades"
		""
		"Maximize storage efficiency!"
		""
		"§7Tiers Available:"
		"§7• Tier 1: 2x stacks"
		"§7• Tier 2: 4x stacks"
		"§7• Tier 3: 8x stacks"
		"§7• Tier 4: 16x stacks"
		""
		"§6Benefits:"
		"§7• Massive capacity increase"
		"§7• Perfect for bulk items"
		"§7• Stackable upgrades"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Essential for resource gathering!"
	]
	quest.77DE3A3D3230ABD3.title: "§eStack Upgrades"
	quest.77FB064296CB5CE8.quest_subtitle: "Be more decicive in what is voided and how"
	quest.781AA60967A22E0D.quest_desc: [
		"§7The §fLarge Diesel Engine§7 offers a significant upgrade over the basic diesel engine."
		""
		"§7The tremendous power output can drive your most demanding automation setups."
	]
	quest.784228C2304DAD3C.quest_subtitle: "Diesel cylinder + Spark plug"
	quest.784228C2304DAD3C.title: "Gasoline, Naptha, Kerosene Cylinder"
	quest.785322C002100649.quest_subtitle: "Keep a network running at speed with a powered brake attached"
	quest.785322C002100649.title: "Overpowered"
	quest.786F2AFB1C07E423.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to §lChapter 3!"
		""
		"Now that you've mastered the basics of Create in Chapter 2, it's time to enter the Industrial Revolution!"
		""
		"§7In this chapter, you'll learn how to harness steam power, work with more advanced fluids, and create complex automated systems."
		""
		"§7By the end, you'll have built a fully automated sealed mechanism production line!"
	]
	quest.786F2AFB1C07E423.title: "3. Industrial Revolution"
	quest.78AB2B4CEBDFB0D3.quest_desc: [
		"§7The §fRustic Delight§7 mod brings traditional countryside flavors to your automation journey!"
		""
		"§7From rustic crops to hearty stews, these classic recipes are perfect for automated production."
		""
		"§fSetup:§7"
		"§71. Cultivate unique §frustic crops§7 with §fsprinklers§7 and §fharvesters§7"
		"§72. Process raw ingredients using §fslicers§7 for traditional preparations"
		"§73. Set up §fcooking pots§7 for stews and traditional recipes"
		"§74. Use §fdeployers§7 to assemble rustic sandwiches and meals"
		""
		"§fTIP:§7 Rustic meals often provide excellent saturation, making them efficient for long adventures!"
	]
	quest.78AB2B4CEBDFB0D3.title: "Rustic Kitchen Automation"
	quest.78C692F91A349443.quest_desc: ["Hp: 30 (50 when charged) / Attack: 8 (16 when charged) / Repaired: Kelp / Drops: 1-3 Kelp, 1-3 Prismarine crystals / Info: Becomes 'charged' when within range of a conduit - This increases damage, regeneration, and resistance."]
	quest.798CADF6B8930572.quest_subtitle: "A machine that can autocraft shapeless recepies aswell as mix things like potions.\\n\\nNeeds to rotate at at least 30 rpm to function"
	quest.79C615608E3FE660.quest_desc: [
		"Every home needs proper storage!"
		"Chests are good, but cabinets and barrels offer style and functionality."
		""
		"§7Tip: Different wood types make different looking storage!"
	]
	quest.79C615608E3FE660.title: "Storage Solutions"
	quest.79C98F24D7700C6A.quest_desc: [
		"§7The moon's low gravity environment is perfect for establishing a permanent base of operations."
		""
		"§7Build an enclosed space with proper §fOxygen Distribution§7 systems to create a breathable environment."
		""
		"§7Your lunar base will serve as a launching point for further space exploration."
	]
	quest.79C98F24D7700C6A.title: "Establish a Lunar Base"
	quest.79FAB4A9DAC5CFA4.quest_desc: [
		"§7You've mastered the basics of §fApplied Energistics 2§7!"
		""
		"§7This unlocks the §fAdvanced Storage§7 chapter with more detailed information about AE2's features."
		""
		"§7Continue your journey to become a true network master!"
	]
	quest.79FAB4A9DAC5CFA4.title: "Advanced Storage"
	quest.79FCBEBFE6E29E44.quest_desc: ["The &6mechinal drill&r is a item that will mine any block infront of it which is really nice for setting up farms that require blocks to be broken, like a cobblestone farm"]
	quest.79FCBEBFE6E29E44.quest_subtitle: "Mines for you"
	quest.7A12A3545393A741.quest_desc: [
		"§7Enter the world of §fComputers§7 in Minecraft with ComputerCraft!"
		""
		"§7These powerful machines can automate tasks, control systems, and even communicate with other mods like AE2."
		""
		"§7Start with a basic computer and explore the potential of Lua programming."
	]
	quest.7A12A3545393A741.title: "Digital Revolution"
	quest.7A39A5B9E3CAC840.quest_desc: ["To get the liquid xp from the &6bottle o' enchanting&r you need the item drain, it will give you back the bottle after it has drained the xp"]
	quest.7A39A5B9E3CAC840.quest_subtitle: "Stealing the precious liquid xp"
	quest.7A46B847C2C0899C.quest_desc: [
		"§7Train signals are crucial for managing multiple trains on the same track network."
		""
		"§7To set up signals:"
		"§71. Place signals along your track at regular intervals"
		"§72. Configure signal behavior by right-clicking them"
		"§73. Connect signals to redstone if you want conditional operation"
		""
		"§7Tip: Signals prevent train collisions by creating 'blocks' that only one train can occupy at a time!"
	]
	quest.7A46B847C2C0899C.title: "Safety First"
	quest.7A4D01AF34BB7E0E.quest_desc: ["Right click on the industrial mixer to install it."]
	quest.7A4D01AF34BB7E0E.quest_subtitle: "Speen!"
	quest.7A80F0A31E481EEC.quest_desc: [
		"The Pumpkin Valley is filled with pumpkin patches as far as the eye can see."
		""
		"§6Features:"
		"§7• Abundant pumpkins"
		"§7• Autumn foliage"
		"§7• Rolling hills"
		""
		"Perfect for all your pumpkin needs - no more searching for that rare pumpkin!"
	]
	quest.7A80F0A31E481EEC.title: "Great Pumpkin Hunt"
	quest.7A8A2F37BD0C6706.quest_desc: [
		"Congratulations! You have mastered space exploration and reached the ultimate destination - beyond our solar system itself."
		""
		"Build the Tier 11 rocket - the pinnacle of space technology - to reach destinations previously thought impossible."
		""
		"§7This is the culmination of your journey through Ad Astra and Ad Extendra. The universe is now yours to explore!"
	]
	quest.7A8A2F37BD0C6706.title: "Beyond the Final Frontier"
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAE4.quest_desc: [
		"The Mechanical Press is one of the most important machines you'll make!"
		"It can press ingots into plates and automate various crafting processes."
		""
		"§7Tip: Right-click and hold to turn the crank - but be careful, it's tiring work!"
		""
		"§7Tip: Place it above the items you want to press."
		""
		"§6The Hand Crank is your first way to provide rotation."
	]
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAE4.title: "Under Pressure"
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAE5.quest_desc: [
		"A good adventurer needs proper sustenance!"
		"Let's start with the basics - a Stove for cooking and some basic cooking tools."
		""
		"§7Tip: The Stove works like a Campfire but better - it won't go out in the rain!"
		""
		"§7Tip: Place a Pot on top of the Stove for more cooking options."
	]
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAE5.title: "Time to Cook!"
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAE6.quest_desc: [
		"Every chef needs their tools!"
		"The Cutting Board lets you prepare ingredients in new ways."
	]
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAE6.title: "Slice and Dice"
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAE7.quest_desc: [
		"Time to start growing your own ingredients!"
		"Rich Soil will help your crops grow faster and yield more produce."
		""
		"§7Tip: Place Organic Compost on the ground and wait for it to decompose."
		""
		"§7Tip: Use bone meal to speed up the composting process."
	]
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAE7.title: "Green Thumb"
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAE8.quest_desc: [
		"With your garden growing, it's time to make some proper meals!"
		"These dishes will give you better saturation and special effects."
		""
		"§7Tip: Eating varied foods gives you better nutrition."
		""
		"§6Important: Store leftovers in a Cabinet to keep them fresh!"
	]
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAE8.title: "Proper Meals"
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAE9.quest_desc: [
		"You've mastered the basics of cooking and farming!"
		"You're ready to explore more advanced culinary arts and recipes."
		""
		"§7Tip: The next chapter will introduce advanced cooking techniques and special dishes."
		""
		"§6Important: Keep your basic ingredients and tools handy!"
		""
		"§bClick the checkmark to unlock the Automating The Kitchen chapter."
	]
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAE9.title: "Culinary Mastery"
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAF0.quest_desc: [
		"Sweet treats are not just tasty - they're great for quick energy!"
		""
		"§7Tip: Pies can be placed as blocks and eaten slice by slice."
		""
		"§7Tip: Sweet foods restore hunger quickly but provide less saturation."
	]
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAF0.title: "Sweet Treats"
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAF1.quest_desc: [
		"Sandwiches are perfect for adventuring!"
		"Easy to make, easy to carry, and very filling."
		""
		"§7Tip: Try different meat and vegetable combinations."
		""
		"§7Tip: Store them in a basket for a proper picnic!"
	]
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAF1.title: "Packed Lunch"
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAF2.quest_desc: [
		"Raw ingredients are the foundation of good cooking!"
		"The cutting board helps prepare ingredients efficiently."
		""
		"§7Tip: Some cut ingredients are better than their whole versions!"
	]
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAF2.title: "Prep Work"
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAF3.quest_desc: [
		"A proper garden needs proper planning!"
		"These crops will give you a good variety of ingredients."
		""
		"§7Tip: Plant in alternating patterns for better organization."
		""
		"§7Tip: Rich Soil works even better with these special crops!"
	]
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAF3.title: "Crop Planning"
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAF4.quest_desc: [
		"Some crops need special care to grow properly."
		"Rice needs water, and some plants grow better together!"
		""
		"§7Tip: Plant rice in water for best results."
		""
		"§7Tip: Use the hoe to prepare soil near water for rice paddies."
	]
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAF4.title: "Rice Farming"
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAF5.quest_desc: [
		"Villagers need proper workstations to offer their trades."
		"Different job blocks will give villagers different professions!"
		""
		"§7Tip: Break and replace job blocks to refresh trades."
		""
		"§6Important: Villagers can only change jobs during work hours."
	]
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAF5.title: "Job Hunting"
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAF6.quest_desc: [
		"A well-fed villager is a happy villager!"
		"Throw bread or other food at villagers to make them willing to breed."
		""
		"§7Tip: Make sure there are enough beds for new villagers."
		""
		"§7Tip: Villagers need to be able to pathfind to their beds."
	]
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAF6.title: "Growing the Population"
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAF7.quest_desc: [
		"Villagers love emeralds, and they're essential for trading!"
		"Different professions offer different ways to get emeralds."
		""
		"§7Tip: Farmers buy crops, Butchers buy meat, and Fletchers buy sticks."
		""
		"§7Tip: Level up villagers by trading to unlock better deals!"
	]
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAF7.title: "Emerald Economy"
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAF8.quest_desc: [
		"Villagers need protection from zombies and other threats!"
		"Iron Golems will spawn naturally in large villages, but you can help too."
		""
		"§7Tip: Place torches to prevent zombie sieges."
		""
		"§7Tip: Build walls at least 2 blocks high for better protection."
	]
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BAF8.title: "Village Security"
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BB01.quest_desc: [
		"§d§lStorage Systems Guide"
		""
		"Welcome to the world of advanced storage solutions!"
		""
		"§6Storage Types:"
		"§7• Sophisticated Chests"
		"§7• Sophisticated Barrels"
		"§7• Sophisticated Backpacks"
		""
		"§6Upgrade Categories:"
		"§7• Storage Tiers"
		"§7• Utility Features"
		"§7• Automation"
		"§7• Special Functions"
		""
		"§6Pro Tips:"
		"§7• Start with basic upgrades"
		"§7• Plan your storage network"
		"§7• Combine different storage types"
	]
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BB01.title: "§d§lAdvanced Storage Systems"
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BB08.quest_desc: [
		"§6ME Drive"
		""
		"Your digital storage unit!"
		""
		"§7Features:"
		"§7• Holds 10 storage cells"
		"§7• Priority settings"
		"§7• Cell status display"
		""
		"§6Cell Types:"
		"§7• Item storage"
		"§7• Fluid storage"
		"§7• Chemical storage"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Use view cells to organize!"
	]
	quest.7A8BE37C33E3BB08.title: "§eStorage Drive"
	quest.7A9AC48E63F158BE.quest_desc: [
		"§7Create an interactive chatbot that can converse with players!"
		""
		"§7Basic steps:"
		"§7- Set up a §fchat interface§7 using monitors"
		"§7- Create a simple §fpattern matching§7 system for responses"
		"§7- Store conversation data in files"
		""
		"§7Advanced features:"
		"§7- §fContext awareness§7 that remembers previous messages"
		"§7- §fCommand processing§7 to perform actions when asked"
		"§7- §fPersonality traits§7 that make your bot unique"
		"§7- §fMulti-user support§7 for conversations with multiple players"
	]
	quest.7A9AC48E63F158BE.title: "Artificial Intelligence"
	quest.7AF8AE0E14CB1C68.quest_desc: [
		"§7The Sculk Snapper's powerful jaws can be harvested and crafted into tools with unique properties."
		""
		"§6Creating a Sculk Jaw Trap:"
		"§7• Place the trap on the ground in strategic locations"
		"§7• The trap will snap shut on any creature that steps on it"
		"§7• Useful for defending your base or creating safe paths"
		""
		"§6Trap characteristics:"
		"§7• Deals significant damage on activation"
		"§7• Can be retrieved and reused after triggering"
		"§7• More effective against non-sculk creatures"
		"§7• Can be enhanced with redstone for automation"
	]
	quest.7AF8AE0E14CB1C68.title: "Jaws of Death"
	quest.7B17911BC0E8E8C6.quest_desc: [
		"Customize the Railways Navigator to suit your preferences."
		""
		"§7Customization options include:"
		"§71. Map colors and visibility settings"
		"§72. Speed display units (m/s or km/h)"
		"§73. Interface language"
		"§74. Notification preferences"
		"§75. Hotkey bindings"
		""
		"§7Access these settings through the gear icon in the Navigator interface!"
	]
	quest.7B17911BC0E8E8C6.title: "Navigator Customization"
	quest.7B27F03A27C2DD7A.quest_desc: [
		"§6Rustic Cabin Design"
		""
		"Build a cozy wooden cabin with enhanced details!"
		""
		"§7Key elements to include:"
		"§7• Mixed wooden planks for walls"
		"§7• Timber frame accents"
		"§7• Small log pillars at corners"
		"§7• Decorative wooden furniture"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Add a stone chimney and fireplace for extra coziness"
	]
	quest.7B27F03A27C2DD7A.title: "§eRustic Cabin Designer"
	quest.7B3913CCEBC7717D.quest_subtitle: "Gives off a redstone signal when detecting a train."
	quest.7B598A12DCD02559.quest_desc: ["Little Big Redstone is installed. "]
	quest.7B72B8A2A801BDBE.quest_desc: ["The &6netherite backpack&r is the upgrade of the &ediamond backpack&r. It has 120 storage slots and can hold 7 upgrades"]
	quest.7B72B8A2A801BDBE.quest_subtitle: "Insane storage on the go"
	quest.7B7D0C8E25725B21.quest_desc: [
		"§7To create raw rubber:"
		""
		"§71. Place logs in a §fBasin"
		"§72. Add water"
		"§73. Process with a §fMixer §7to extract the raw rubber"
		""
		"§7Tip: Set up an automated system with funnels and spouts to process logs in batches!"
	]
	quest.7B7D0C8E25725B21.title: "Side quest: Rubber automation"
	quest.7B81BC2FAA980E8D.quest_desc: [
		"§7The §fSprinkler§7 automatically irrigates crops in a 5x5 area below it, dramatically accelerating their growth."
		""
		"§7Connect it to a water source with §fpipes§7, §ftanks§7, or even a §fCreate pump§7."
		""
		"§fTIP:§7 Combine with §fCreate's mechanical harvester§7 to fully automate crop farming!"
	]
	quest.7B81BC2FAA980E8D.title: "Automated Irrigation"
	quest.7B90A1A66B750F76.quest_subtitle: "Give your Blaze Burner a Enchanting Guide and turn it into a Blaze Enchanter"
	quest.7B90A1A66B750F76.title: "Blaze's New Job"
	quest.7B9B6917BE069793.quest_desc: [
		"§7Iron is a basic but essential material for your sealed mechanisms."
		""
		"§7To efficiently produce iron ingots:"
		"§71. Smelt your iron nuggets into ingots using a furnace"
		"§72. Alternatively, use §fCrushed Iron Ore §7directly if you have it"
		""
		"§7Tip: Consider setting up a dedicated smelting system using §fEnchanted Fans §7with lava for bulk processing."
	]
	quest.7B9B6917BE069793.title: "Iron Nuggets -> Iron Ingots"
	quest.7B9D2F7F33818837.quest_subtitle: "Essentially the an upgrade to the millstone, provides some different recipes so it might be worth keeping both around."
	quest.7BA17A1CD1393E60.quest_desc: [
		"§6Diamond Barrel"
		""
		"Premium vertical storage!"
		""
		"§7Storage:"
		"§7• Base: 27 slots"
		"§7• Upgrade: +36 slots"
		"§7• Total: 63 slots"
		""
		"§6Features:"
		"§7• 4 upgrade slots"
		"§7• Maximum visibility"
		"§7• Fastest access"
	]
	quest.7BA17A1CD1393E60.title: "§eDiamond Barrel"
	quest.7BC6C4778F957D7F.quest_desc: [
		"The Wither Eye is dropped by the Wither boss. (normally it is but loot tables are broken, so this quest provides one)"
		""
		"§7Summon the Wither using 4 Soul Sand/Soil arranged in a T-shape, topped with 3 Wither Skeleton Skulls."
		"§7Defeat this powerful boss to obtain the Eye."
		"§7Be very well prepared - the Wither is one of the most dangerous enemies!"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Summon the Wither in a confined space underground to limit its movement."
		"{image:emi_loot:textures/gui/wither.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.7BFBAEC124D78197.quest_desc: [
		"§7Process §fTuff§7 in §fCrushing Wheels§7 to extract Zinc Nuggets."
		""
		"§7This crushing operation liberates valuable zinc particles from the dense stone."
		""
		"§7Set up an automated sorting system to separate zinc from other byproducts."
	]
	quest.7BFBAEC124D78197.title: "Tuff → Zinc Nugget"
	quest.7C0C87AECC742AC0.quest_subtitle: "Basically electricity = speed"
	quest.7C20781A65838BB5.quest_desc: [
		"§7If you followed Chapter 2 correctly, you should already have cogwheel automation set up."
		""
		"§7Your existing automation system should be:"
		"§71. Generating planks from logs"
		"§72. Creating shafts from andesite alloy"
		"§73. Using a §fDeployer §7to combine planks with shafts to create cogwheels"
		""
		"§7You can reuse this automation for Chapter 3's sealed mechanism production."
	]
	quest.7C20781A65838BB5.title: "Already Automated: Cogwheel"
	quest.7C2D833725CFED1B.quest_desc: [
		"Time to assemble your first burger by hand!"
		""
		"§6Ingredients needed:§r"
		"• Bread (top and bottom bun)"
		"• Cooked Beef Patty"
		"• Sliced Tomatoes"
		"• Cabbage Leaves"
		""
		"Use the Cooking Pot to combine all ingredients and create your burger."
		""
		"§7Soon you'll be automating this entire process!§r"
	]
	quest.7C2D833725CFED1B.title: "Your First Burger"
	quest.7C3CAC3FD4C32F0A.quest_desc: [
		"Create and Blockus together open up amazing architectural possibilities!"
		""
		"§7Use Create's moving contraptions to build structures that transform and change."
		""
		"§7Blockus's decorative blocks can be placed on Create's chassis to make beautiful moving buildings."
		""
		"§7Try building a drawbridge, rotating tower, or retractable staircase!"
	]
	quest.7C3CAC3FD4C32F0A.title: "Moving Architecture"
	quest.7C4A51A2D0A3BB26.quest_desc: [
		"§6Advanced Stone Construction"
		""
		"Create beautiful patterns with these more complex stone variants!"
		""
		"§7Try these combinations:"
		"§7• Chiseled patterns"
		"§7• Pillar designs"
		"§7• Herringbone patterns"
		"§7• Mixed stone types"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Use pillars at corners and chiseled blocks as accents"
	]
	quest.7C4A51A2D0A3BB26.title: "§eAdvanced Stone Designs"
	quest.7C53E556EF451A95.quest_subtitle: "Allows more filtering of what is or isn't depostited"
	quest.7C56B70320485D32.quest_desc: [
		"§6Reworked Pillager Outposts"
		""
		"Pillager outposts are no longer simple towers. They've been completely redesigned into formidable strongholds."
		""
		"§7Features of the new outposts:"
		"§7• Multiple buildings and structures"
		"§7• Training grounds and barracks"
		"§7• Loot caches and treasure rooms"
		"§7• More challenging enemy placement"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Come prepared with ranged weapons and shields. These outposts are much more dangerous than their vanilla counterparts."
	]
	quest.7C56B70320485D32.title: "Pillager Stronghold"
	quest.7C5CDB413D2EBD0C.quest_subtitle: "Copycat blocks allow you to make steps and panels out of things that typically cannot take those shapes."
	quest.7C5EC6AACBCF88CE.quest_desc: [
		"Beyond the known planets lie the trans-Neptunian objects - distant worlds at the very edge of our solar system."
		""
		"Craft the ultimate Tier 10 rocket to reach these extreme destinations."
		""
		"§7The knowledge and resources gained from these distant worlds will allow you to master space technology and perhaps even venture beyond our solar system."
	]
	quest.7C5EC6AACBCF88CE.title: "Solar System's Edge"
	quest.7C77FA44B80B6BB4.quest_subtitle: "This mod requires cookies to work properly. Please insert them into the jar"
	quest.7C77FA44B80B6BB4.title: "Accept and Continue"
	quest.7C8CD9E620C220AA.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.7C8CD9E620C220AA.quest_subtitle: "Numpad Enter to ping"
	quest.7C8CD9E620C220AA.title: "Ping System"
	quest.7CA4365A78A7E42B.quest_desc: [
		"The Witch Pupil is dropped by Witches."
		""
		"§7Hunt for Witches in swamps or witch huts."
		"§7Defeat them for a chance to obtain this Eye."
		"§7Be careful of their potions - they can heal themselves and harm you!"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Build a small witch farm at a witch hut for a reliable source of witch drops. You can use \"spawn fluid witch\" as well to force the mob spawn in a mechanical spawner."
		""
		""
		"{image:cosmeticarmoursmod:item/witchhat width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.7CC8581851053989.title: "Already Automated: Zinc Nugget"
	quest.7CD315EEF62CFCC2.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Graphite"
	quest.7CD315EEF62CFCC2.title: "High Carbon Density"
	quest.7D3131F56F58DF19.quest_desc: [
		"It's time to automate the beef preparation process!"
		""
		"§6Components needed:§r"
		"• Deployer (equipped with a knife)"
		"• Belt system to move beef through"
		"• Funnel system to collect minced beef"
		""
		"§6Setup:§r"
		"• Feed raw beef onto a belt"
		"• Have a deployer with a knife 'cut' the beef"
		"• Collect the minced beef with funnels"
	]
	quest.7D3131F56F58DF19.title: "Automated Mincing"
	quest.7D82FBD21A2D6E3E.quest_desc: [
		"The mechanical saw can cut logs into planks, but it can also harvest trees when used in automated tree farms."
		""
		"§7Set up a contraption with a mechanical bearing and attach saws to harvest trees automatically."
		""
		"§7Don't forget to include a deployer with saplings to replant!"
	]
	quest.7D82FBD21A2D6E3E.title: "Automated Lumberjack"
	quest.7D9E1B5F3C8A6E2D.quest_desc: [
		"The Warp Stone is the key component for all waystones technology."
		""
		"Using Create's mechanical crafting, combine Polished Rose Quartz, Fluix Crystals, and Warp Dust in the pattern shown to create this powerful teleportation catalyst."
	]
	quest.7D9E1B5F3C8A6E2D.title: "Teleportation Catalyst"
	quest.7DA9A9D0548937B1.quest_desc: [
		"§6Original Terrain Blocks"
		""
		"Experience the nostalgic textures of Minecraft's earliest days!"
		""
		"§7These blocks include:"
		"§7• Alpha Grass Block (with side coloring)"
		"§7• First Dirt Block texture"
		"§7• Beta Stone patterns"
		"§7• Early grass and dirt combinations"
		""
		"§6Pro Tip: §7Use these blocks to create a classic Alpha/Beta-era build"
	]
	quest.7DA9A9D0548937B1.title: "§eClassic Terrain Blocks"
	quest.7DC70E338A7F5ECD.quest_desc: [
		"§7Upon landing on the lunar surface, you might be surprised to discover that it's made of §fMoon Cobblestone§7, not cheese as folklore suggests!"
		""
		"§7This unique material can be collected and processed for various lunar crafting recipes."
		""
		"§7Gather enough to begin your lunar construction projects and automated production lines."
	]
	quest.7DC70E338A7F5ECD.title: "It's not cheese!?"
	quest.7DC9A48B25E63807.quest_desc: ["The &6brass funnel&r is an upgraded andesite funnel, lets you add item filters and moves upto a stack at a time"]
	quest.7DC9A48B25E63807.quest_subtitle: "An upgraded funnel"
	quest.7DD05DDD6A816DFC.quest_subtitle: "Create: Bitterballen is an addon for Create which adds Dutch snacks. (Quests WIP)"
	quest.7DD05DDD6A816DFC.title: "Bitterballen"
	quest.7DF0DCE32FF9E896.quest_desc: [
		"§7Your first locomotive marks a major milestone in your railway journey!"
		""
		"§7To assemble a functional locomotive:"
		"§71. Place bogeys on the track"
		"§72. Right-click with a §fTrain Controls§7 item"
		""
		"§7Tip: Different fuel sources and engine types will affect your train's speed and efficiency!"
	]
	quest.7DF0DCE32FF9E896.title: "First Locomotive"
	quest.7DFFD1F66AB6296F.title: "Visit crimson forest"
	quest.7E023A9B6A3AEB64.title: "Obtain a &2Host Armour Trim&r"
	quest.7E31DE031A232C6A.quest_desc: [
		"Using the Calorite gathered from Venus and Mercury, you can now craft the ultimate rocket - the Tier 4 Rocket! This interstellar vessel will allow you to leave our solar system and travel to the Proxima Centauri system."
		""
		"Beyond lies new worlds and challenges!"
		""
		"§7Tip: Before departing, ensure you have plenty of fuel, oxygen, and supplies. Interstellar travel is no small feat!"
	]
	quest.7E31DE031A232C6A.title: "Interstellar Travel"
	quest.7E46F131FF61C0EA.quest_subtitle: "4x Stack Size"
	quest.7E8E6019017D76EC.quest_subtitle: "Sticks to blocks when powered by redstone."
	quest.7EA4E2D90A0FBC21.quest_subtitle: "Allows you to walk underwater like you do on land as well as walk on belts without them moving you, if you think about it, must be really slippery."
	quest.7EAEC99B487F27BD.quest_desc: [
		"§d§lThe End Awaits!"
		""
		"Now that you've collected all 12 special Eyes, it's time to find the End Portal!"
		""
		"§7Steps to complete:"
		"§71. Use the Eyes like a compass by right-clicking with them"
		"§72. Follow their direction to locate the Stronghold"
		"§73. Navigate the Stronghold to find the End Portal room"
		"§74. Place the 12 unique Eyes in the portal frames"
		"§75. The portal will activate, allowing you to enter The End!"
		""
		"§6Final Tip: §7Make sure you're well prepared for the End Dragon fight. Bring your best gear, potions, and plenty of food!"
	]
	quest.7EAEC99B487F27BD.title: "§d§lThe End Awaits!"
	quest.7EF1D870E752E4DA.quest_desc: [
		"The &6cart assembler&r has the ability to attach any machine you want to build to a minecart, it can also move blocks that aren't able to be moved in regular vanilla like budding ameythyst and spawners"
		""
		"&l&cIf you want to move spawners you need to enable it in the create configs&r&r"
	]
	quest.7EF1D870E752E4DA.quest_subtitle: "Maybe one of the most OP items"
	quest.7EF1EC9FA90EE109.quest_desc: [
		"§7Equip your turtles with different tools to specialize them for specific tasks."
		""
		"§7A §fMining Turtle§7 with a pickaxe can efficiently excavate tunnels and quarries."
		""
		"§7The §fLumberjack Turtle§7 with an axe can harvest trees automatically."
		""
		"§7A §fFarming Turtle§7 with a hoe will tend to your crops without you lifting a finger."
	]
	quest.7EF1EC9FA90EE109.title: "Specialized Workforce"
	quest.7EF8F5155514A83C.quest_desc: [
		"Craft your first instrument and start playing!"
		""
		"§7Different instruments have different sounds and can be placed in the world or played in your hand."
		""
		"§7Try creating a band with friends by playing different instruments together!"
	]
	quest.7EF8F5155514A83C.title: "First Instrument"
	quest.7F11E8E9DA942295.quest_desc: ["These adorable crystal crustaceans live deep underground in caves and ravines. Sometimes called “living ore,” Grottols are prized as a rare source of diamonds. But only the quickest of adventurers can manage to catch them before they burrow away; grottols are very fast and surprisingly clever, even using minecarts to escape pursuers. Keep in mind that only iron or stronger pickaxes can penetrate their diamond shells."]
	quest.7F1E7D3B5A8C2E6D.quest_desc: [
		"The Bound Scroll is similar to the Return Scroll but can be bound to any waystone in your network."
		""
		"This allows you to create a one-time-use teleporter to a specific waystone, which can be useful for providing others with access to specific locations."
	]
	quest.7F1E7D3B5A8C2E6D.title: "Location-Specific Teleporter"
	quest.7F3CB796664E3DE5.quest_desc: [
		"Congratulations! You've built a fully automated fast-food empire!"
		""
		"Your CraftDonalds is now capable of producing all kinds of meals with incredible efficiency. Your automated systems handle everything from farming to final delivery."
		""
		"§6Your achievements:§r"
		"• Fully automated ingredient production"
		"• Advanced cooking and processing systems"
		"• Sophisticated assembly lines"
		"• Multiple menu options and sides"
		"• Efficient delivery systems"
		""
		"You are truly the burger automation master!"
	]
	quest.7F3CB796664E3DE5.title: "Fast Food Emperor"
	quest.7F4222314963E50A.quest_desc: ["§7If you have followed the quests correctly, you should already have automated this."]
	quest.7F4D5B0A7A3CA576.quest_subtitle: "Used to controll the flow of trains across tracks and intersections of tracks."
	quest.7F5228C9A9FC87D5.quest_desc: [
		"The &6encased fan&r has many different uses, it can be used to blast, wash, haunt and smoke items. The rotation will mean it either pushes or pulls air"
		""
		"To &cblast&r items you need to put a lava source infront of the fan"
		"To &9wash&r items you need to put a water source infront of the fan"
		"To &bhaunt&r items you need to put a soul campfire infront of the fan"
		"To &esmoke&r items you need to put a campire infront of the fan"
	]
	quest.7F5228C9A9FC87D5.quest_subtitle: "Has multiple uses"
	quest.7F5228C9A9FC87D5.title: "Encased fan"
	quest.7F5963067BF634EE.quest_desc: [
		"This is an alternate quest for obtaining the magic eye. Can use the explorer's compass to look for the Citadel. "
		""
		"The cinderous soulcaller is what summons him in his arena. Do be mindful he is a challenge. "
	]
	quest.7F5E2D38C40E93F7.quest_subtitle: "Lets you transfer a redstone signal wirelessly within a range. No, this is not for Wi-Fi."
	quest.7F5E2D38C40E93F7.title: "Wi-Fi? No?"
	quest.7F98083A1EF33FDB.quest_desc: [
		"§6Basic Barrel Storage"
		""
		"Vertical storage solution!"
		""
		"§7Features:"
		"§7• 27 slots base storage"
		"§7• Stackable vertically"
		"§7• Visual item count"
		"§7• 4 upgrade slots"
		""
		"§6Advantages:"
		"§7• Space efficient"
		"§7• Easy access"
		"§7• Visual feedback"
	]
	quest.7F98083A1EF33FDB.title: "§eBasic Barrel"
	quest.7FC36EE69F4F3119.quest_desc: [
		"§7Welcome to Chapter 5, where we'll create §ffully automated§7 production lines for resources."
		""
		"§7This chapter focuses on setting up complex automation chains that work together to produce §fInfernal Mechanisms§7."
		""
		"§7Completing these automation challenges will expand your factory and prepare you for even greater engineering feats."
	]
	quest.7FC36EE69F4F3119.title: "5. Fully Automated"
	quest.7FD0E84C5EBA6702.quest_subtitle: "Foundational block for the reactor"
	quest.7FF6AD2D68DC28A4.quest_desc: [
		"§7The twisted landscape of the Otherside holds many secrets. Among its most valuable treasures are the §fEcho Shards§7 - crystallized fragments of interdimensional energy."
		""
		"§7These resonant crystals can be found:"
		"§7• Embedded in sculk-infused stone formations"
		"§7• Inside small alcoves and cavities"
		"§7• Near pulsating sculk veins"
		"§7• Occasionally dropped by the Shattered when defeated"
		""
		"§7These shards have unique properties that allow them to:"
		"§7• Be crafted into §fRecovery Compasses§7"
		"§7• Create specialized detection equipment"
		"§7• Enhance certain magical components"
		"§7• Potentially stabilize dimensional technology"
		""
		"§7Collect these valuable crystals while exploring - they may prove useful for both navigation and advanced technological applications."
	]
	quest.7FF6AD2D68DC28A4.title: "Resonant Fragments"
